<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- TarifitLBS</book>
  <para style="h">Luqa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luq</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luqa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Aseȓmeḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lkitab n Luqa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aseȓmeḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="mt3">Lkitab n Luqa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Luqa itari i yijjen n ssiyyed qqaren-as Tufilus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />A si Tufilus, aṭṭas n yiwḏan ggin aḏ arin min iweqƹen ɣarneɣ. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Urin nican ƹlaḥsab mamc ḏaneɣ xbaren ȓechuḏ ḏ ixeddamen n wawaȓ <char style="it">n Arebbi</char> iǧan ḏeg umezwaru. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3-4" />A siḏi uȓa ḏ nec tɣiȓ-ayi mliḥ aḏ ggeɣ aḏ ariɣ min iweqƹen wami beḥṯeɣ ḏi marra manaya mliḥ. Aḏac ṯ ariɣ ṯa s ṯa ḥima aḏ tessneḏ ȓḥaqq n ṯmesȓayin nni iy ḏac seȓmaḏen.<verse eid="LUK 1:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmalak itxebbar mammec ɣa d ixȓeq Siḏna Yaḥya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Tuɣa ḏi ȓweqṯ n uzeǧiḏ Hirudus netta iḥekkmen x ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya ḏinni ijjen n ȓefqi netta zi lfirqa n Abyu qqaren-as Zakariya. Ɣares ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ zi ddurriṯ n Harun nettaṯ qqaren-as Ilizabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Zakariya ḏ Ilizabet niṯni gguren nican ak Arebbi, uȓ nsen ḏ acemȓaȓ. Teggen marra min yumar ḏ marra min iweṣṣa Siḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Walakin war ɣarsen bu iḥenjiren minzi Ilizabet war tirew ca. Ƹaweḏ niṯni s ṯnayen iḏsen mɣaren aṭṭas.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ijjen n nhar Zakariya ṯuweḍ-d nnuba nnes aḏ ixḏem ḏi ṯemziḏa ḏ ȓefqi zzaṯ i Arebbi ak lfirqa nnes. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ggin lqurƹa ƹlaḥsab ttaqalid nsen iy teggen ȓfuqaha. Nhar nni ṯusa-d lqurƹa ḏi Zakariya bac aḏ yaḏef ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Siḏi Arebbi ḥima aḏ iceƹƹeȓ tbaxur ḏinni. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Wami itceƹƹaȓ tbaxur, marra ccaƹb nni iy ḏinni imunen qqimen ɣar barra i ṯemziḏa tẓaǧan. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ȓexddenni imeḍhar-as-d i Zakariya ijjen n lmalak n Siḏi Arebbi ibedd x ufusi n ȓmeḏbaḥ n tbaxur. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariya wami ṯ iẓra inexȓeƹ, iggweḏ.<verse eid="LUK 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Inna-as Lmalak nni: "A Zakariya war teggweḏ ca, qa istajeb-ac Arebbi ḏi min ḏas ṯettareḏ. Ṯamɣarṯ nnec Ilizabet aḏac d ṯejj ijjen n uḥenjir, aṯ ṯsemmiḏ cek Yaḥya. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ssaƹḏ nnec aḏ tfarḥeḏ. Xmi d ɣa ixȓeq azzayes farḥen aṭṭas n yiwḏan <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />minzi aḏ yiȓi ḏ ameqqran ɣar Siḏi Arebbi. Aḏ tiȓi labud ƹemmarṣ aḏ isew aman n uḍiȓ niɣ ḏ waman n imendi. Aḏ yiȓi iƹemmar s Arruḥ iqeddsen ḥetta ḏeg uƹeddis n yemmas. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Aḏ yarr aṭṭas n Ayṯ-Israʼil ɣar Siḏi Arebbi nsen. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Aḏ yuyur zzaṯ i Siḏi Arebbi s yijjen n arruḥ ijheḏ am wenni n <char style="it">nnabi</char> Ilyas. Aḏ ismeṣȓaḥ lwalidin ak ṯarwa nsen. Aḏ yarr yinni iƹeṣṣan ɣar ubriḏ n yinni iǧan nican ḥima aḏ isewjeḏ ccaƹb i Siḏi Arebbi aḏ iȓin wejḏen."<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Inna-as Zakariya i lmalak nni: "Mammec ɣa ssneɣ nec manaya ḏ ṣṣaḥ? Qa nec wessareɣ, ṯamɣarṯ inu ṯewsar."<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Indeq-d lmalak nni inna-as: "Qa nec ḏ Jibril ḏ wenni itbeddan zzaṯ i Arebbi, issekk-ayi-d Arebbi ɣarec bac akic ssiwȓeɣ aḏac iniɣ ȓexbar-a isfarraḥen. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ȓexxu cek aḏ tiȓiḏ ḏ azeynun. War ṯessiwiȓeḏ ca ḥetta aȓ nhar nni iy ɣa iwqeƹ manaya minzi cek war ṯumineḏ ca zeg wawaȓ inu wenni iy d ɣa iffɣen nican ḏi ȓweqṯ nnes."<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ccaƹb qqimen trajan Zakariya, tƹejjben wami iƹḍeȓ aṭṭas ɣar ḏaxeȓ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Wami d iffeɣ ssenni war izemmar ca akiḏsen issiweȓ, iqqim issawaȓ akiḏsen s ifassen waha. Ssenni fehmen imeḍhar-as-d lwaḥi ɣar ḏaxeȓ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant iḏweȓ ḏ azeynun.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Wami ƹḏun wussan n ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes iḏweȓ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Menbaƹd ṯeysi ṯemɣarṯ nnes Ilizabet aƹeddis ṯeqqim xems chur ṯesnuffar ixef nnes. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Ṯeqqar: "Ḏ manaya iy ḏayi yuca Siḏi Arebbi ḏi nhar wami ḏayi ifqeḏ ḥima axafi ikkes ȓƹib n yiwḏan."<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmalak itxebbar mamc d ɣa ixȓeq Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ilizabet wami ṯeǧa ḏi char wis setta, issekk-d Arebbi ijjen n lmalak qqaren-as Jibril ɣar yijjen n ubilaj ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil qqaren-as Naṣira. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Iruḥ ɣar yijjen n ṯeƹzriṯ qqaren-as Maryam ṯenni iy keḏ igga zzujiya ijjen n uryaz zi ddurriṯ n Dawed netta qqaren-as Yusef. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Yuḏef ɣares lmalak nni inna-as: "Azul ya ṯenni iy xef irḍa Arebbi, aqa Siḏi Arebbi aqaṯ akiḏem."<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Ḏinni Maryam ṯnexȓeƹ wami ṯesȓa i wawaȓen nnes, ṯrezzu aḏ tmeyyez min iƹna sȓam nni.<verse eid="LUK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Inna-as lmalak nni: "War teggweḏ ca a Maryam, aqa cem yarḍa xam Arebbi! <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Aḏ teysiḏ aƹeddis, aḏ d tejjeḏ ijjen n uḥenjir aṯ tsemmiḏ Ƹisa. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Aḏ yiȓi imɣar, ataf tȓaɣan-as a Mmis n Wenni Yuƹȓan. Aḏas yuc Siḏi Arebbi nnes lƹarc n jeddis ameqqran Dawed. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Aḏ iḥkem x ȓqum n Yaƹqub i ȓebda, ȓmulk nnes ƹemmarṣ aḏ ifna."<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Ṯenna-as Maryam i lmalak nni: "Mammec iy ɣa yiȓi manaya? Aqa nec ƹaḏ ḏ ṯaƹzriṯ."<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Indeq-d lmalak nni inna-as: "Axam d ihwa Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ jjheḏ n Wenni Yuƹȓan axam yarr ṯiȓi. S manayenni aḥenjir iqeddsen iy ɣa d ṯejjeḏ ataf tȓaɣan-as a Mmis n Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Ilizabet ṯenni iǧan zi ȓeḥbab nnem, waxxa nettaṯ ṯemɣar aqat s uƹeddis. Aqat ḏi char wis setta waxxa tȓaɣan-as yiwḏan a ṯenni war itirwen ca. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />War ṯeǧi bu can ȓḥajeṯ ṯeqseḥ ɣar Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Ṯenna-as Maryam: "Nec aqayi ḏ ṯaxeddant ɣar Siḏi Arebbi, arḍiɣ x wawaȓ nnec aḏayi iwqeƹ." Ssenni iruḥ xas lmalak nni.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maryam ḏ Ilizabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ḏeg wussan nni ṯekkar Maryam ṯruḥ s ṯazzȓa ɣar uḏrar ɣar yijjen n ubilaj ḏi ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ṯuḏef ɣar ṯeddarṯ n Zakariya ṯseǧem x Ilizabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Wami ṯesȓa Ilizabet i sȓam n Maryam, inhezz useymi nni ḏeg uƹeddis nnes, nettaṯ ṯeccur s Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ṯȓaɣa s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯejheḏ ṯenna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:42">"Cem twabarkeḏ jar ṯemɣarin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:42">ƹaweḏ itwabarek wenni iy iǧan ḏeg uƹeddis nnem!<verse eid="LUK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nhara ḏ nhar ḏ ameqqran i nec wami ɣari d tusa yemmas n Siḏi!<verse eid="LUK 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Wami d tusiḏ sȓiɣ i sȓam nnem, inhezz uƹeddis inu s ȓefraḥeṯ.<verse eid="LUK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />A ssaƹḏ n ṯenni yumnen min ḏas inna Siḏi Arebbi aḏ yiȓi."<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maryam ṯḥemmeḏ Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Uca ṯenna Maryam:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">"Ȓaƹmar inu iḥemmeḏ Siḏi Arebbi,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />arruḥ inu ifareḥ zi Arebbi iy ḏayi isnejmen.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Iẓra-ayi ḏ ṯaxeddanṯ nnes ḏ ṯadriwect waha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Ssa aȓ ṯsawent marra iwḏan aḏayi ḥessben ḏ ṯamimunt,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />minzi wenni izemmaren igga-ayi aṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin ḏ ṯimeqqranin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">Netta isem nnes ḏ ameqqran,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />arraḥmeṯ nnes ṯeǧa zi ljil ɣar ljil i yinni ṯ iteggwḏen.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Igga s ufus nnes ȓexḏayem ṯimeqqranin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">icettet yinni iḥesben ixef nsen ḏ imeqqranen.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Isehwa-d izeǧiḏen zi lƹarcaṯ nsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">isgaƹƹeḏ yinni iǧan ḏ ḏrawec.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Isejjiwen s ȓxir nnes yinni iǧuzen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">issekk twajar s ifassen nsen xwan.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Iƹawen Ayṯ-Israʼil iy iǧan ḏ ȓƹabḏ nnes ƹlaḥsab arraḥmeṯ nnes,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />mamc iwƹeḏ ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Brahim ḏ ddurriṯ nnes i ȓebda."<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Ṯeqqim Maryam ak Ilizabet can ṯeȓt chur ssenni ṯeƹqeb-d ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ammu ixȓeq Siḏna Yaḥya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Wami d ṯuweḍ ȓweqṯ n Ilizabet aḏ tarew, ṯejja-d aḥenjir. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Jjiran nnes ḏ ȓeḥbab nnes farḥen akiḏes wami ɣarsen ȓexbar belli Siḏ Arebbi irḍa xas aṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ṯeƹḏu ṯmenyam, usin-d yiwḏan ḥima aṯ ṭehharen. Rezzun aḏas semman Zakariya x yisem n babas, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />walakin yemmas ṯugi ṯenna-asen: "Lla, aṯ nsemma Yaḥya."<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Nnan-as: "Uȓa ḏ ijjen zi ȓeḥbab nnem ma isemma s yisem-a." <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Sseqsan babas s ifassen: "Mammec ṯexseḏ cek aṯ tsemmiḏ?"<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Ittar Zakariya ijjen n ṯaȓwiḥet yura ḏayes: "Isem nnes Yaḥya." Qqimen yiwḏan nni tƹejjben marra iḏsen. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ḏeg umcan indeq Zakariya ibḏa issawaȓ iḥemmeḏ Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Ggwḏen marra jjiran. Bḏan ssawaȓen yiwḏan x marra manaya ḏi marra iḏurar n ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Marra ug itesȓan x ṯmesȓayin-a qqaren ḏeg wuȓawen nsen, Min ɣa iḏweȓ uḥenjir-a? Minzi fus n Siḏi Arebbi aqaṯ akiḏes.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zakariya iḥemmeḏ Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakariya babas n Yaḥya, iccur s Arruḥ iqeddsen, issiweȓ s min iƹȓem zi Arebbi inna:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />"Lḥamdu lillah i Siḏi Arebbi n Ayṯ-Israʼil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">ȓaḥeqqac ifqeḏ ccaƹb nnes ifekk-iṯ.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Ismeḍhar-aneɣ-d wenni ḏeg iǧa jjheḏ iy ḏaneɣ ɣa isnejmen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">yusa-d zi ddurriṯ n Dawed ȓƹabḏ n Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Manaya issiweȓ s yiȓesawen n lʼanbiya ṣṣaliḥin aṭṭas zeg wami,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />aḏaneɣ isenjem zi ȓƹaḏyan nneɣ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">ƹaweḏ zeg ifassen n marra yinni ḏaneɣ itƹiffan.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Aḏ d ismeḍhar arraḥmeṯ nnes iy zi iwƹeḏ ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">aḏ iƹqeȓ x ȓƹaheḏ nnes iqeddsen.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Yuca-as ȓƹaheḏ i jeddiṯneɣ Brahim,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />aḏaneɣ isenjem zeg ifassen n ȓƹaḏyan nneɣ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">ḥima aṯ neƹbeḏ bȓa ṯiggwḏi,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />s wuȓ iṣfa ḏ acemȓaȓ i marra ṯuḏarṯ nneɣ.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Y cek ay aḥenjir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">aḏac tȓaɣan nnabi n Wenni Yuƹȓan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">minzi aḏ tuyureḏ ɣar zzaṯ ḥima aḏ teswejḏeḏ abriḏ i Siḏi Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Ƹaweḏ aḏ tesȓemḏeḏ i ccaƹb nnes x usenjem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">iƹni mamc iy ɣa twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Minzi Arebbi nneɣ ḏ araḥman ḏ araḥim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">ifqeḏ-aneɣ-d zeg ujenna xmi ṯɣeǧi ṯfuct.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Ḥima aḏ yuc ṯfawṯ i yinni itƹicen ḏi ṯaǧesṯ ḏi ṯiȓi n ȓmewṯ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ḥima aḏaneɣ isuyur iḍaren nneɣ ɣar ubriḏ n ȓehna."<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Tuɣa aḥenjir itemɣar itejhiḏ s arruḥ nnes. Izeddeɣ ḏi ȓexȓa aȓ wami d imeḍhar i Ayṯ-Israʼil.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ammu iy d ixȓeq Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ḏi ȓiyyam nni azeǧiḏ Qayṣar Agusṭus yuca lʼamar aḏ ḥesben marra imezḏaɣ n ṯmura iy ḏi iḥkem. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Aḥsab-a amezwaru iwqeƹ wami iḥkem Kurinus ḏi ṯmurṯ n Surya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Ruḥen marra iwḏan ḥima aḏ sejjlen, kuȓ ijjen iruḥ ɣar ubilaj nnes.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Igaƹƹeḏ Yusef zi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil zeg ubilaj n Naṣira iruḥ ɣar ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya ɣar ubilaj n Dawed wenni umi qqaren Bayt Laḥm minzi netta zi ddurriṯ n Dawed ḏ ȓeḥbab nnes. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Igaƹƹeḏ ḏinni aḏ isejjel netta ḏ Maryam ṯenni iy keḏ igga zzujiya, nettaṯ aqat s uƹeddis. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Wami uwḍen ḏinni, ṯuweḍ-d ȓweqṯ nnes ḥima aḏ tarew. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Ṯurew mmis amenzu ṯseḥnunneḍ-iṯ ṯeggi-ṯ ḏi ȓmeḏweḏ minzi war ufin bu umcan ḏi ṯeddarṯ n imsafaren.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmalaʼikaṯ ḏ imeksawen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Tuɣa ḏinni aȓ jjiheṯ nni imeksawen ḥeṭṭan ṯiḥimeriwin nsen s ǧiȓeṯ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ṯusa-d ijjen n lmalaʼika n Siḏ Arebbi ṯbedd-d ɣarsen, itceƹciƹ nnur n lƹaḍama n Siḏ Arebbi inneḍ-d xasen ggwḏen aṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ṯenna-asen lmalaʼika nni: "War teggwḏem ca. Aqa nec tbeccareɣ-kenniw s yijjen n ȓexbar imɣar aṭṭas azzayes ifareḥ marra ccaƹb. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ixȓeq-d nhara ḏeg ubilaj n Dawed wenni iy kenniw ɣa isnejmen, netta ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Kenniw aḏ tafem ijjen n lƹalama aḏ tafem ijjen n useymi iḥnunneḍ iṭṭeṣ ḏi ȓmeḏweḏ." <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ƹlaɣafla meḍharen-d ak lmalaʼika nni aṭṭas n imezḏaɣ n ujenna ḥemmḏen Arebbi qqaren:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />"Lƹaḍama i Arebbi Yuƹȓan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">ḏ ȓehna n yinni ḏi ṯmurṯ mixef irḍa."<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Wami ruḥent lmalaʼikaṯ nni ƹeqbent ɣar ujenna, ssiwȓen imeksawen nni jarasen nnan: "Yallahet a nraḥeṯ ɣar Bayt Laḥm a nẓer manaya ig iweqƹen min xaneɣ issiweȓ Siḏi Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Ruḥen ḏeɣya ufin Maryam ḏ Yusef ḏ useymi nni iṭṭeṣ ḏi ȓmeḏweḏ. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Wami ṯ ufin ḏinni, kkaren xbaren iwḏan min ḏasen ṯenna lmalaʼika nni x uḥenjir-a. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Marra wenni itsȓan itƹejjeb ḏeg wawaȓ nni iy ḏasen nnan imeksawen. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Amma Maryam, ṯxemmeȓ marra ṯimesȓayin-a ḏeg wuȓ nnes txemmam ḏaysent. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ssenni ƹeqben imeksawen nni semɣaren Arebbi ḥemmḏen-ṯ x marra min sȓin ḏ min ẓrin, ufin ṯimesȓayin nni weqƹent nican amecnaw mamc ḏasen ṯenna <char style="it">lmalaʼika nni</char>.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṭṭahareṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Wami ikemmeȓ uḥenjir nni ṯmeniyyam ḥima aḏayes iṭehhar, semman-ṯ Ƹisa s yisem nni mamec ṯ isemma lmalak nni zi qbeȓ ma aḏ yiȓi ḏeg uƹeddis n yemmas.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Wami kemmȓen wussan nni iy ḏi teggen ruḍu bac lwalidin nnes aḏ iȓin ṣfan ƹlaḥsab Ccariƹa n Musa, uwin-ṯ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds ḥima axas ttaren i Siḏ Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Ammu ig yuri ḏi Lkitab n Siḏ Arebbi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:23">&lt;Mkuȓ mmis amenzu aḏ yiȓi ḏ ameqqran ɣar Siḏ Arebbi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Ƹaweḏ bac aḏ qeddmen ijjen n dbiḥeṯ mamc d yusa ḏi Lkitab n Siḏ Arebbi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:24">&lt;Ṯnayen n ṯeḏbirin n ȓexȓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:24">niɣ ṯnayen n ṯeḏbirin ḏ ṯimezyanin.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Tuɣa ḏinni ḏi ṯendint n Lquds ijjen n bnaḏem qqaren-as Cimƹun. Iggur nican, iteggweḏ Arebbi, itraja Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ nejmen, Arruḥ iqeddsen aqaṯ xas. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Tuɣa netta ixbar-iṯ Arruḥ iqeddsen war itmetti ca aȓ ɣa iẓer Lmasiḥ n Siḏ Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Ikkar Cimƹun isuyur-iṯ Arruḥ iqeddsen ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant. Wami uḏfen lwalidin n Ƹisa ḥima aḏas ggen min ṯeqqar Ccariƹa n Musa, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />yufa Cimƹun aḥarmuc nni iysi-ṯ jar ifassen nnes icekkar Arebbi inna:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />"Ya Mulana, ejj-ayi ȓƹabḏ nnec aḏ raḥeɣ ȓexxu ɣar ṯeddarṯ n ȓehna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">amecnaw mamc ṯenniḏ cek s wawaȓ nnec.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Minzi ṯiṭṭawin inu ẓrint asenjem nnec,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />iy ṯeswejḏeḏ i marra iwḏan.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Netta ḏ ijjen n nnur iy ṯesmeḍhareḏ i ȓegnus,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">netta ḏ ijjen n lƹaḍama n ccaƹb nnec n Ayṯ-Israʼil."<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Babas ḏ yemmas qqimen tƹejjben ḏi min xas itwannan. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Ibarek-iṯen Cimƹun inna-yas i yemmas Maryam:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:34">"Aqa wanita iggi-ṯ Siḏi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:34">aḏ d isehwa aḏ isiȓi aṭṭas n yiwḏan ḏi Ayṯ-Israʼil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:34">Netta ḏ ijjen n lƹalama ataf war t txisen ca,<verse eid="LUK 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />aḏ nfeḍḥen lʼafkar n waṭṭas n wuȓawen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:35">ḏ ijjen n lḥuzen am ssif iqeḍƹen aḏ icukk ȓaƹmar nnem."<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Tuɣa ḏinni ƹaweḏ ijjen n nnabiya ḏ ṯawessarṯ qqaren-as Ḥanan nettaṯ ḏ yeǧis n Fanwil zi ṯeqbiȓṯ n Ƹacur. Ṯƹic ak uryaz nnes sebƹa iseggwusa. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ȓexddenni immuṯ netta, ṯeqqim nettaṯ ḏ ṯajjaȓṯ ḥetta wami ṯemmuṯ x arbeƹa u ṯmanin iseggwusa. Tɣima ȓebda ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, ṯƹebbeḏ Arebbi tẓumma tẓaǧa ǧiȓeṯ ḏ wass. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni ṯusa-d ṯḥemmeḏ Arebbi ṯessiweȓ x uḥenjir nni ak marra yinni itrajan nhar nni ḏi ɣa ifekk Arebbi Lquds.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Wami Yusef ḏ Maryam ṣafi kemmȓen marra min zzaysen ṯumar Ccariƹa n Siḏ Arebbi, ḏewȓen ɣar ṯmurṯ n Ljalil ɣar ubilaj nsen n Naṣira. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Ƹisa itemɣar itejhiḏ itcar s ȓefhameṯ, xas arḍa n Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯimesȓayin nni iy itegg Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa wami iǧa ḏ aḥenjir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Lwalidin nnes traḥen mkuȓ aseggwas ɣar Lquds ḏi Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ƹisa wami yuweḍ ṯenƹac n iseggwusa, gaƹƹḏen ɣar Lquds ƹlaḥsab taqalid n Ȓƹiḏ. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Wami kemmȓen wussan n Ȓƹiḏ rewwḥen netta iqqim ḏi Lquds, walakin niṯni war ssinen ca belli netta ƹaḏ iqqim ḏinni. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Tɣir-asen aqaṯ akiḏsen ak lmejmaƹ nsen. Uyuren nhar ikmaȓ, bḏan rezzun xas jar familya ḏ imeddukaȓ. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Wami war ṯ ufin ca, ḏewȓen ɣar ṯendint rezzun xas. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Kkin ṯeȓtiyyam uca ufin-ṯ iqqim ḏi ṯemzida ṯameqqrant jar yinni iseȓmaḏen, itsȓa-yasen itseqsa-ṯen. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Marra yinni ḏas itsȓan tƹejjben ḏayes s ȓaƹqeȓ nnes ḏ ljawabaṯ nnes.<verse eid="LUK 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Wami ṯ ẓrin lwalidin nnes tƹejjben ḏayes, ṯenna-as yemmas: "Mayemmi ḏaneɣ ṯeggiḏ ammu? Aqa nec ḏ babac nrezzu xak, ṯejjiḏ-aneɣ ḏi ȓaƹḏab."<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Mayemmi xafi ṯrezzum? Ma war ṯessinem ca belli nec itxeṣṣa-ayi aḏ iȓiɣ ḏi ṯeddarṯ n Baba?"<verse eid="LUK 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />War ḏas fhimen ca i wawaȓ nni iy ḏasen inna. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Iḏweȓ-d akiḏsen ɣar Naṣira itegg-asen array. Yemmas txemmam ḏi marra manaya ḏeg wuȓ nnes. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Ƹisa yarenni ḏi ȓefhameṯ ḏ ṭṭul, itemɣar ḏi arḍa ɣar Arebbi ḏ ȓƹabḏ.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Siḏna Yaḥya isewjaḏ abriḏ i Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Azeǧiḏ Qayṣar Tibaryus yuweḍ xemessṭacar ssna zeg wami iteḥkam, lƹam nni ƹaweḏ Bilaṭus Lbanṭi netta ḏ lḥakem x Yahuḏiya, Hirudus netta ḏ lwali x Ljalil, umas Filippas netta ḏ lwali x Iṭurya ḏ jwayeh n Tarxanitis, Laṣan netta ḏ lwali x Abilina, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ḥanin ḏ Qiyafa niṯni ḏ arruyas n ȓfuqaha. Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni yusa-d wawaȓ n Arebbi i Yaḥya mmis n Zakariya ḏi ȓexȓa. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Ikkar netta ikka x marra imucan ṭṭarf n iɣzar n Lʼurdun ibḏa itbeccar iwḏan ḥima aḏ tuben aḏ twaṭehharen s waman ḥima aḏ twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Manaya ƹlaḥsab min yura ḏi Lkitab n wawaȓ n nnabi Icaƹya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;<char style="bd">Ṯmijja tȓaɣa ḏi ȓexȓa ṯeqqar: </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="bd">Swejḏeṯ abriḏ i Siḏi Arebbi, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="bd">ggem ibriḏen nnes nican. </char><verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />
    <char style="bd">Aḏ itwanṭu kuȓ iɣzar, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="bd">aḏ iwaṭa kuȓ aḏrar ḏ ṯaƹrurṯ. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="bd">Min war icnin aḏ icna, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="bd">aḏ twaƹeḏȓen ibriḏen itwaḥfaren. </char><verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />
    <char style="bd">Marra iwḏan aḏ ẓren asenjem n Arebbi.&gt; </char><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yaḥya iqqar-asen i ȓɣaci yinni iffɣen bac aḏ twaṭehharen s waman: "Ya ṯarwa n ifiɣeran, wi ḏawem iƹeȓmen aḏ tarewȓem zi lɣaḍab <char style="it">n Siḏi Arebbi</char> iy d ɣa yasen? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Meȓa ṯtubem ḏ ṣṣaḥ, ggeṯ ȓexḏayem ḏ ṯiṣebḥanin. Maci aḏ tinim ḏi nnefs nwem qa neccin ḏ ṯarwa n Brahim u ṣafi. Meȓa ixes Arebbi ṯarwa n Brahim, ataf aḏ iysi izra-ya aṯen yarr ḏ ṯarwa n Brahim! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Aqa caqur iwjeḏ ḥima aḏ iqess iẓewran n ȓcejjur. Mkuȓ ṯacejjarṯ iy war itirwen ca min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan ataf aḏ twaqess aḏ tmenḍar ḏi ṯmessi."<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Nnan-as ȓɣaci: "Y neccin min ɣa negg?"<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yarra xasen Yaḥya inna-asen: "Wenni ɣar ǧant ṯnayen n ṯeqmijaṯin itxeṣṣa aḏ yuc icten i wenni war ɣar iǧi ca. Ƹaweḏ wenni ɣar iǧa min ɣa icc itxeṣṣa aḏ yuc i wenni war ɣar iǧi ca."<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Usin-d ɣares ȓebƹaḍ zeg yinni ijemmƹen ḍḍariba bac aḏ twaṭehharen s waman nnan-as: "A Lmuƹallim, min ɣa negg neccin?"<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Yarra xasen inna-asen: "War jemmƹeṯ bu ktar zi lqanun."<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Ƹaweḏ sseqsan-ṯ ȓƹaskar nnan-as: "Y neccin min ɣa negg?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Inna-asen Yaḥya: "War tkessim bu tmenyaṯ s bessif. War znuzam ḥadd x ȓbaṭeȓ. Qenƹem s min ṯrebḥem."<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Qaƹ iwḏan nni trajan <char style="it">Lmasiḥ</char> tfekkaren ḏeg wuȓ nsen Yaḥya ma netta ḏ Lmasiḥ ma lla.<verse eid="LUK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Ijaweb-iṯen Yaḥya marra inna-asen: "Qa nec ṭehhareɣ-kenniw s waman, walakin aḏ d yas ijjen ijheḏ xafi, war sḏihiǧeɣ ca aḏas fesyeɣ uȓa ḏ ifiȓan n ṯsiȓa nnes. Netta akenniw iṭehhar s Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ <char style="it">yiȓesawen n</char> ṯmessi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S ṯyunaniṯ n lʼaṣel iqqar "s Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ ṯmessi." Imken issawaȓ ḏanita x min ɣa iweqƹen ḏi Ȓexḏayem n Arrusul 2:3.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Ɣares ṯazzarṯ ḏeg ufus ḥima aḏ izuzzar ṯaffa nnes qaƹ, aḏ ismun ṯiḥebba n yirḏan aṯent igg ḏi ṯesrafṯ. Min war ineffƹen ca aṯ issecmeḍ ḏi ṯmessi iy war ixessin ƹemmarṣ." <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Amenni Yaḥya iseȓmaḏ iwḏan itbeccar-iṯen s waṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin nneɣni.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Menbaƹd lwali Hirudus yuwi icten qqaren-as Hirudya u nettaṯ ḏ ṯamɣarṯ n wumas. Yaḥya inha Hirudus x manaya, ƹaweḏ inha-ṯ x marra lʼaɣlaṭ nneɣni iy itegg. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Hirudus netta min igga? Yarni ḏi ccarr nnes igga Yaḥya ḏi ȓeḥbes.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏna Yaḥya itṭehhar i Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa s waman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Wami marra ccaƹb ittwaṭehhar s waman, yusa-d uȓa ḏ Ƹisa itwaṭehhar s waman. Netta wami itẓaǧa, ṯnurzem ṯewwarṯ ḏeg ujenna <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />ihwa-d Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏi ṣṣifeṯ n ṯeḏbirṯ yarsa-d x Ƹisa. Ḏ ijjen n ṯmijja zeg ujenna ṯeqqar-as qa cek ḏ Memmi iƹizzen, nec farrḥeɣ zzayek.<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓejḏuḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Wami ibḏa Ƹisa ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes tuɣa ɣares ca n ṯȓaṯin iseggwusa. Tɣir-asen ḏ mmis n Yusef, n Ƹali, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />n Maṭyu, n Lawi, n Mluki, n Yani, n Yusef, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />n Maṭyusus, n Amun, n Naḥum, n Ḥuṣni, n Naji, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />n Muḥit, n Maṭyusus, n Camƹi, n Yuski, n Yuḍa, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />n Yuhan, n Ris, n Zarubbabil, n Cƹaltihil, n Nir, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />n Mluki, n Adi, n Qasem, n Lmudam, n Ƹir, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />n Yassu, n Liƹazar, n Yurim, n Maṭyu, n Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />n Cimƹun, n Yahuḏa, n Yusef, n Yunam, n Lyaqim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />n Malyu, n Mennan, n Maṭyus, n Naṯan, n Dawed, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />n Yassa, n Ƹubid, n Buƹazza, n Salmun, n Nassun, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />n Ƹaminadab, n Admi, n Ƹarni, n Ḥaṣrun, n Faris, n Yahuḏa, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />n Yaƹqub, n Isḥaq, n Brahim, n Taraḥ, n Naḥur, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />n Sarug, n Raƹu, n Falaj, n Ƹabir, n Ṣalaḥ, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />n Qinan, n Arfakceḏ, n Sam, n Nuḥ, n Lamak, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />n Matucaliḥ, n Axnux, n Yarid, n Muhallil, n Qinan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />n Anuc, n Cuṯ, n Adam mmis n Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Ibȓis itjerrab Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Iḏweȓ-d Ƹisa zeg iɣzar n Lʼurdun iccur s Arruḥ iqeddsen, ȓexddenni yuwi-ṯ Arruḥ nni ɣar ȓexȓa. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Ikka ḏinni arbeƹin yum itjerrab-iṯ Ibȓis. Ḏeg wussan nni war icci walu. Wami kemmȓen wussan nni iǧuz.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ikkar Ibȓis inna-as i Ƹisa: "Cek meȓa ḏ Mmis n Arebbi, ini-yasen i yizra-ya aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ aɣrum."<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yarra xas Ƹisa inna-as: "Lla, Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Bnaḏem war itƹic ca s uɣrum waha.&gt;"<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ikkar Ibȓis yuwi Ƹisa ɣar yijjen n umcan yuƹȓa, ismeḍhar-as-d marra lmemlakaṯ n ddunect-a ḏeg yijjen n dqiqeṯ. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Inna-as Ibȓis: "Aḏac uceɣ marra jjheḏ-a ḏ lƹaḍama-ya nsent ȓaḥeqqac nec ṯemmuc-ayi, at uceɣ i wumi ma xseɣ. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Meȓa ṯsejjḏeḏ-ayi, aḏ yiȓi qaƹ manaya i cek."<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Lla, Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Sejjeḏ i Siḏi Arebbi nnec, ƹbeḏ-iṯ netta waḥḏes.&gt;"<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ikkar Ibȓis yuwi Ƹisa ɣar ṯendint n Lquds, isiȓi-ṯ x ṯqiccat n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant inna-as: "Cek meȓa ḏ Mmis n Arebbi, ngez ssanita ɣar ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Aqa Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Qa Arebbi aḏ iweṣṣa bac ac ḥḍant lmalaʼikaṯ nnes.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Ƹaweḏ iqqar: &lt;Ac ysint x ifassen nsent bac war ṯeȓqifeḏ uȓa ḏ ij uzru s uḍar nnec.&gt;"<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-as: "Lla, Lkitab iqqar: &lt;War tjarrab ca Siḏi Arebbi nnec.&gt;" <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ibȓis wami ikemmeȓ akiḏes marra ajerrab nni, ikkar ibeƹƹeḏ xas aȓ yijjen n ṯwaȓa nneɣni.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tazzȓen x Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zi ṯendint nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Iḏweȓ Ƹisa ɣar ṯmurṯ n Ljalil s jjheḏ n Arruḥ iqeddsen, itentacar ȓexbar nnes marra ḏi jwayeh nni. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Iseȓmaḏ ḏi ṯemziḏawin nsen semɣaren-ṯ marra iwḏan.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yusa-d ɣar ubilaj n Naṣira mani irebba. Nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada iruḥ ɣar ṯemzida am ȓebda, ikkar ḥima aḏ iɣar. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Ucin-as Lkitab nni n nnabi Icaƹya, irzem-iṯ yufa amcan iy ḏi yura wawaȓ-a:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;Aqa Arruḥ n Siḏi Arebbi aqaṯ xafi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ixḍar-ayi ḥima aḏ beccareɣ ȓmusakin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Issekk-ayi-d aḏ xbareɣ lḥurriya i imeḥbas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">yinni itwaḍarɣȓen aṯen arreɣ twaȓan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">yinni itwaḍeȓmen aḏasen d rxuɣ.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Aḏ xbareɣ x useggwas n arḍa n Siḏi Arebbi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ibelleƹ lkitab nni yarra-as-ṯ i uxeddam iqqim. Marra yinni iǧan ḏi ṯemziḏa qqimen txezzaren ḏayes. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ibḏa iqqar-asen: "Nhara qa iffeɣ-d wawaȓ n Lkitab-a iy umi ṯesȓim."<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Marra ssawaȓen xas mliḥ, tƹejjben ḏeg wawaȓen iṣebḥanen iy d iffɣen zeg uqemmum nnes. Nnan xas: Ma war iǧi ca wanita ḏ mmis n Yusef?<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Bȓa ccekk aḏayi ṯinim ȓmaƹna-ya: Cek ay aḍbib mȓi ṯeddawiḏ, iȓi ṯeddawiḏ ixef nnec. Aḏayi ṯinim ƹaweḏ qa min nesȓa iweqƹen ḏeg ubilaj n Kafernaḥum, ȓexxu manayenni egg-iṯ uȓa ḏanita ḏi ṯmurṯ nnec." <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Inna-asen: "Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: War iǧi ca can nnabi qebȓen-ṯ ḏi ṯmurṯ nnes. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Tuɣa ḏinni aṭṭas n ṯajjaȓin ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi zman n nnabi Ilyas wami war yuwṯi bu unẓar ṯeȓt snin u sett chur wami iwqeƹ ijjen n buheyyuf ḏi ṯmurṯ ṯekmaȓ. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Walakin ṯajjaȓin nni war ɣarsent d itwassekk ca nnabi Ilyas, itwassekk-d ɣir ɣar yicten n ṯajjaȓṯ waha ḏi dcar n Ṣarepta ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ṣayda. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Ƹaweḏ tuɣa aṭṭas n yiwḏan heȓcen ḏaysen jḏam ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi zman nni n nnabi Alicaƹ. Arebbi war zzaysen isgenfi uȓa ḏ ijjen, isgenfa illa Nuƹman zi Surya."<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Yinni imunen ḏi ṯemziḏa wami sȓin i wawaȓ-a ɣeḍben aṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Kkaren sufɣen-ṯ ɣar barra n ṯendint. Uwin-ṯ ɣar jjarf n uḏrar mani ṯebna ṯendint nsen bac aṯ seyyben x jjarf nni. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Walakin netta ifȓeṯ-asen yuyur.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isufuɣ ijjen n jjenn ḏ aƹeffan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Iruḥ Ƹisa ɣar ubilaj n Kafernaḥum ig iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil, ibḏa iseȓmaḏ iwḏan ḏinni ḏi nhar n lƹibada nsen kuȓ ssebṯ. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Qqimen yiwḏan nni tƹejjben ḏeg useȓmeḏ nnes minzi ɣares ssulṭa iy zi iseȓmaḏ.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Ufin ḏi ṯemziḏa nni ijjen n uryaz ḏayes ijjen n jjenn ḏ aƹeffan. Ibḏa isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />inna-as i Ƹisa: "Min ḏayneɣ ṯrezzuḏ a Ƹisa Naṣiri? Ma ṯusiḏ-d axaneɣ ṯeqḍiḏ? Nec qa ssneɣ min ṯeƹniḏ; cek ḏ Lƹaḍim n Arebbi!" <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Izeyyar-iṯ Ƹisa inna-as: "Stuk cek, ffeɣ zzayes!" Iseɣḍeȓ jjenn aryaz nni ɣar ṯmurṯ ḏi ȓwesṭ nsen ȓexddenni iffeɣ zzayes war ḏas iggi walu. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Qqimen marra iwḏan nni ḏehhcen nnan i wayawya: "Min iƹna manaya? Itʼamar uȓa ḏ jnun iƹeffanen s yijjen n ssulṭa ḏ ṯzemmar niṯni teffɣen." <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Itentacar ȓexbar nnes ḏi mkuȓ amcan ḏi jwayeh nni.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ṯaḏeggwaȓṯ n Simƹan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Ssenni Ƹisa iffeɣ-d zi ṯemziḏa nni yuḏef ɣar ṯeddarṯ n Simƹan. Yufa ḏinni ṯaḏeggwaȓṯ n Simƹan qa ṯehȓec ḏayes ṯimessi aṭṭas, ttaren zzayes ḥima at isgenfa. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yuḏar aɣares isbedd ṯimessi ṯeffeɣ-it. Ḏeg umcan ṯekkar ṯebḏa tsexxar xasen.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Wami ṯeɣȓi ṯfuct ɣar ṯmeddiṯ, iwḏan uwin ɣar Ƹisa imehȓac nsen kuȓ ijjen mamec igga ȓehȓac nnes. Mkuȓ ijjen zzaysen isrusa xas fus nnes isgenfa-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Zeg waṭṭas n yiwḏan ƹaweḏ teffɣen jnun snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ qqaren-as qa cek ḏ Mmis n Arebbi." Walakin netta itzeyyar-iṯen, war ṯen itejji ca aḏ ssiwȓen minzi ssnen netta ḏ Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Wami iṣbaḥ ȓḥaȓ iffeɣ Ƹisa iruḥ ɣar yijjen n umcan n ȓexȓa. Iwḏan nni bḏan rezzun xas, usin-d ɣares ṭṭfen-ṯ ḥima war xasen iggur ca. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Inna-asen: "Lla, nec itxeṣṣa-ayi aḏ beccareɣ s ȓmulk n Arebbi ḏi ṯneddam nneɣni minzi twassekkeɣ-d i manaya." <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Iruḥ itḥeddaṯ ḏi ṯemziḏawin nsen n Yahuḏiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itȓaɣa-d i imeḥḍaren nnes imezwura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ijjen n nhar ibedd Ƹisa ɣar ȓebḥar n Ganisarat, mzaḥamen xas ȓɣaci bac aḏ sȓen i wawaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Yufa ṯnayen n ṯɣarruba beddent x ṭṭarf n ȓebḥar. Tuɣa hwan-d zzaysent iḥeǧaqen n iseȓman bac aḏ ƹeḏȓen ṯiracciwin nsen. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Inya Ƹisa ḏeg yicten zi ṯɣarruba nni ṯenni iy iǧan n Simƹan, iṭaleb zzayes aḏ yuyur cwayt x ȓbarr u netta iqqim ḏayes ibḏa iseȓmaḏ ȓɣaci zi ṯɣarrabut nni.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Wami ikemmeȓ awaȓ nni inna-as i Simƹan: "Ndeh ṯaɣarrabut nnec ɣar mani uǧɣen waman ḍȓeq ṯiracciwin ḥima aḏ tḥeǧqeḏ iseȓman."<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Inna-as Simƹan: "A Lmuƹallim, neccin ǧiȓeṯ ṯekmaȓ nxeddem war d nsiȓi uȓa ḏ ijjen n usȓem, walakin wami t ṯenniḏ cek aḏ ḍeȓqeɣ ṯiracciwin." <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Wami ggin ammu siȓin-d aṭṭas n iseȓman, ṯiracciwin nsen ƹȓayen aḏ qqarṣent. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ceyyaren imeddukaȓ nsen ḏi ṯɣarrabut nni nneɣni ḥima aḏ d asen aṯen ƹawnen. Usin-d ƹemmaren ṯnayen n ṯɣarruba nsen aȓ wami ƹȓayen aḏ ɣerqent.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simƹan Buṭrus wami iẓra manaya yusa-d iwḍa ɣar iḍaren n Ƹisa inna-as: "A Siḏi, beƹƹeḏ xafi nec ḏ lƹaṣi." <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Iḏhec netta ḏ yinni akiḏes marra ȓaḥeqqac ḥeǧqen-d aṭṭas n iseȓman. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ƹaweḏ iḏhec uȓa ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna ṯarwa n Zabadi niṯni ḏ imeddukaȓ n Simƹan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Inna-as Ƹisa i Simƹan: "War teggweḏ ca, cek ssa aȓ ṯsawent ataf aḏ tḥeǧqeḏ iwḏan." <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Wami d ḏewȓen s ṯɣarruba ɣar ȓbarr semḥen ḏi marra min ɣarsen ḏfaren Ƹisa.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ijjen ḏayes jḏam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Wami Ƹisa aqaṯ ḏeg yijjen n ṯendint, yusa-d ijjen n uryaz ḏayes jḏam aṭṭas. Iẓra Ƹisa iwḍa-yas ɣar iḍaren ittar-as inna-as: "A Siḏi, cek meȓa ṯexseḏ ṯzemmareḏ aḏayi ṯessiṣfiḏ."<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Iqarreb ɣares Ƹisa iḥaḏa-ṯ s ufus nnes inna-as: "Wah nec xseɣ, cek qa ṯgenfiḏ!" Ṣafi ḏeg umcan iruḥ-as jḏam nni.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Iweṣṣa-ṯ inna-as: "War txebbar ḥadd. Inna-as: "Ruḥ ɣar ȓefqi seḍhar-as ixef nnec. Egg ṣṣeḏqeṯ nni iy zi iweṣṣa Musa ḥima aɣarsen ṯiȓi chaḏeṯ x min iweqƹen."<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Walakin ssenni ibḏa itentacar xas ȓexbar ktar ƹaḏ. Usin-d ɣares aṭṭas n ȓɣaci ḥima aḏas sȓen ḥima aḏ genfan zi ȓehȓacaṯ nsen. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Netta tuɣa itraḥ ɣar imucan ig ixȓan ḥima aḏ iẓẓaǧ ḏinni.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ijjen n unecruf</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ijjen n nhar tuɣa Ƹisa iseȓmaḏ iwḏan. Qqimen ḏinni jarasen ȓebƹaḍ zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa, usin-d zi marra ȓedcuraṯ n Ljalil ḏ Yahuḏiya ḏ Lquds. Jjheḏ n Siḏi Arebbi aqaṯ ak Ƹisa bac aḏ isgenfa imehȓac. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Usin-d can yiwḏan ysin ijjen n uryaz izzeȓ ḏi ṯassuṯ nnes mmuṯen-as iḍaren. Rezzun mammec ɣa ggen aṯ siḏfen aṯ sersen zzaṯes. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Wami ufin war zemmaren aṯ siḏfen minzi ḏinni aṭṭas n ȓɣaci, gaƹƹḏen zzayes ɣar ṯzeqqa qeȓƹen ijjen n umcan ḏi ssqef sehwan-ṯ-id x ṯassuṯ nnes ɣar ȓwesṭ zzaṯ i iḍaren n Ƹisa.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Netta wami iẓra lʼiman nsen inna-as i unecruf nni: "Ay aryaz, twaɣfarent-ac ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnec."<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Bḏan imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ḏ ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen tfekkaren nnan ḏeg wuȓawen nsen: "Min iƹna wanita itarra ixef nnes ḏ Arebbi? Ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ war ṯent iɣfar ca illa Arebbi waḥḏes!"<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Ƹisa issen min nwan inna-asen: "Mayemmi tfekkarem ammu kenniw ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Min isehȓen aṭṭas aḏas iniɣ <char style="it">i unecruf-a</char>, ma aḏas iniɣ: Twaɣfarent-ac ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnec? Niɣ ma aḏas iniɣ: Kkar cek uyur? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Nec xseɣ aḏ tessnem Mmis n bnaḏem ɣares ssulṭa x ṯmurṯ ḥima aḏ iɣfar ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ." Uca inna-as Ƹisa i unecruf nni: "Aḏac iniɣ, bedd x iḍaren nnec ysi ṯassuṯ nnec ruḥ aḏ trewwḥeḏ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnec!" <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ȓexddenni ikkar unecruf nni zzaṯsen iysi min tuɣa xef izzeȓ, irewweḥ iḥemmeḏ Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Marra ḏehcen ḏi manaya ḥemmḏen Arebbi, ggwḏen aṭṭas nnan: "Nhara neẓra ṯimesȓayin seḏhacent aṭṭas!"<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itȓaɣa-d i Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Menbaƹd iruḥ Ƹisa yufa ijjen ijemmeƹ ḍḍariba qqaren-as Lawi, iqqim ḏeg umcan mani jemmƹen ḍḍariba. Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ḏfar-ayi-d." <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Uca ikkar Lawi ismeḥ ḏi marra iḏfar-iṯ. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Igga-as Lawi ijjen n zarrdeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant ḏi ṯeddarṯ nnes. Ḥḍaren akiḏsen aṭṭas n iƹeccaren ḏ inneɣni iy qqimen akiḏsen aḏ ccen.<verse eid="LUK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ceṯcan zzayes ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa nnan-asen i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Mayemmi tettem ṯsessem ak iƹeccaren<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Min ƹennan iƹeccaren? Niṯni zi Ayṯ-Israʼil xeddmen ak lmexzen n arrumanus jemmƹen ḍḍariba zi ayṯmaṯsen. Israʼiliyen nneḍni qqaren belli iƹeccaren ƹeṣṣan aṭṭas. Ƹaweḏ azyen ameqqran n iƹeccaren arennin ci ḥaja ḥima aṯent ksin i yixef nsen.</char></note> ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan?"<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yarra xasen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Iwḏan iṣeḥḥan war teḥḏijin bu uḍbib, aḍbib teḥḏajan-ṯ imehȓac." <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Inna-asen: "Nec war d usiɣ ca aḏ ȓaɣiɣ i yinni iǧan nican ḥima aḏ tuben, usiɣ-d ɣar yinni iƹeṣṣan."<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Nnan-as: "Mayemmi imeḥḍaren n Yaḥya ḏ imeḥḍaren n ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen tẓumman tẓaǧan aṭṭas, imeḥḍaren nnec tetten sessen waha?"<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Kenniw ma tejjem imeddukaȓ n muȓay aḏ ẓummen ḏi ȓfarḥ nnes?" <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Inna-asen: "Lla, walakin ƹaḏ aḏ d asen wussan aḏ imeysi muȓay zi ȓwesṭ nsen, ȓexddenni aḏ ẓummen ḏeg wussan nni."<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Issiweȓ ƹaweḏ akiḏsen s ȓmaƹna-ya: "War iǧi ḥadd iteqssas-d ṯareqqiƹṯ zeg warruḍ n jḏiḏ ḥima s ṯreqqiƹṯ nni azzayes ireqqeƹ arruḍ ḏ ȓbaȓi. Mayemmi? Arruḍ ḏ jḏiḏ aḏ iqqim itcerrag waha, wenni n ȓbaȓi war xas d tis ṯreqqiƹṯ nni n jḏiḏ. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Uȓa ḏ aman n uḍiȓ ḏ jḏiḏ war xeǧqen ca ḏeg yiȓemawen iqḏimen, ḥima war dduqquzen war tzeǧiƹen ca waman n uḍiȓ aḏ ḍeyyƹen yiȓemawen nni. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Walakin aman n uḍiȓ ḏ jḏiḏ xeǧqen ḏeg yiȓemawen ḏ jḏiḏ. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Meȓa iswa can ijjen aman uḍiȓ iqḏimen, ataf war itexs ca yinni ḏ jḏiḏ minzi iqqar qa yinni iqḏimen ḏ iṣebḥanen."<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Min iǧan ḥalal ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Ijjen n nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada, iƹḏu Ƹisa ḏeg ubriḏ ḏi ȓwesṭ n imendi akiḏes imeḥḍaren nnes. Bḏan imeḥḍaren nnes tekksen ṯiyḏerin, tqeccaren-ṯent s ifassen nsen, tetten-ṯent.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Nnan-asen ȓebƹaḍ zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen: "Mayemmi teggem min iǧan ḥram ḏi nhar n lƹibada?"<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Ma war ṯeɣrim ca min igga Dawed wami tuɣa iǧuz netta ḏ yinni akiḏes? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Yuḏef ɣar ṯemziḏa n Arebbi yufa ḏinni aɣrum nni iy iǧan ḏ ṣṣeḏqeṯ icca netta yuca-asen i yinni akiḏes; waxxa manayenni war iǧi ca ḥalal ɣir i ȓfuqaha waha." <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Mmis n bnaḏem ig iǧan ḏ lḥakem ḥetta x nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada."<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ijjen n nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada nneɣni, yuḏef Ƹisa ɣar yijjen n ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil ibḏa iseȓmaḏ. Ḏinni ijjen n uryaz fus nnes afusi immuṯ. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ḏ ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen tlaḥaḍen xas ma aṯ isgenfa ma lla ḏi nhar n lƹibada ḥima aṯ tahmen.<verse eid="LUK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ƹisa issen min ɣarsen ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen, inna-as i uryaz nni iy ɣar iǧa fus immuṯ: "Kkar bedd ḏi ȓwesṭ." Aryaz nni ikkar ibedd ḏinni. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Akenniw sseqsiɣ: Ḏi nhar n lƹibada ma ḥalal a negg ȓxir niɣ a negg ccarr? A nsenjem nnefs niɣ aṯ nneɣ?" <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Ixzar ɣarsen marra ij-ij, inna-as i uryaz nni: "Sarreḥ fus nnec!" Isarreḥ-iṯ uca iḏweȓ ufus nnes igenfa. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Niṯni min ggin? Ɣeḍben aṭṭas mcawaren jarasen min ɣa ggen i Ƹisa.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ixḍar ṯenƹac n arrusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ḏeg wussan nni, igaƹƹeḏ Ƹisa ɣar uḏrar aḏ iẓẓaǧ iqqim ḏinni ǧiȓeṯ ṯekmaȓ itẓaǧa i Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Wami iṣbaḥ ȓḥaȓ, iȓaɣa-d x imeḥḍaren nnes ixḍar ṯenƹac zzaysen iggi-ṯen ḏ arrusul. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Ḏinni Simƹan, isemma-ṯ Buṭrus, ḏ wumas Andrus, ḏ Yaƹqub, ḏ Yuḥanna, ḏ Filippas, ḏ Bartulumay, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />ḏ Matta, ḏ Tuma, ḏ Yaƹqub mmis n Ḥalfa, ḏ Simƹan umi qqaren &lt;Lmunaḍil&gt;, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />ḏ Yahuḏa mmis n Yaƹqub, ḏ Yahuḏa Isxaryuṭi iƹni wenni izzenzen Ƹisa.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa aṭṭas n yiwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Ihwa-d Ƹisa ibedd ḏeg yijjen n umcan ḏ ȓewḍa. Ḏinni aṭṭas n imeḥḍaren nnes ḏ waṭṭas n yiwḏan zi ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya ṯekmaȓ, zi Lquds, ƹaweḏ zi Ṣur ḏ Ṣayda ig iǧan x uɣezḏis n ȓebḥar. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Usin-d ɣares ḥima aḏ sȓan i wawaȓ nnes, ƹaweḏ ḥima aṯen isgenfa zi ȓehȓacaṯ nsen. Yinni itƹeddaben s jnun ḏ iƹeffanen uȓa ḏ niṯni tgenfan. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Xsen marra ȓɣaci nni aṯ ḥaḏan minzi ijjen n jjheḏ iteffeɣ-d zzayes, isgenfa-ṯen marra iḏsen.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ssaƹḏ nwem, ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Iysi ṯiṭṭawin nnes Ƹisa ɣar imeḥḍaren nnes inna-asen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">"Ssaƹḏ nwem a ȓmusakin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">aqa ȓmulk n Arebbi i kenniw.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Ssaƹḏ nwem a yinni iǧuzen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">aqa aḏ tejjawnem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Ssaƹḏ nwem a yinni itrun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">aqa aḏ tḍeḥcem.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Ssaƹḏ nwem meȓa tƹiffan-kenniw yiwḏan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">war kenniw qebȓen ssawaȓen ḏaywem s ȓƹib,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">tzawaren-kenniw ƹlaḥsab Mmis n bnaḏem.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Ḏi Nhar nni farḥem negzem s ȓefraḥeṯ ȓaḥeqqac aɣarwem yiȓi ijjen n lʼajar ḏ ameqqran ḏeg ujenna minzi ammu iy iggin ȓejḏuḏ nsen i lʼanbiya.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Walakin, ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem a twajar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">minzi ṯƹicem min ṯƹicem.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem a yinni ijjiwnen ȓexxu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">minzi akenniw iȓqef jjuƹ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem a yinni iḍeḥcen ȓexxu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">minzi aḏ txeyyqem aḏ trum.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem meȓa tcekkaren-kenniw yiwḏan minzi ammu iy iggin ȓejḏuḏ nsen i yinni itarran ixef nsen ḏ lʼanbiya.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xsem ȓƹaḏyan nwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Aḏawem iniɣ a yinni itesȓan: Xseṯ ȓƹaḏyan nwem, ggeṯ ȓxir ḏeg yinni kenniw itƹiffan. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Barkeṯ wenni iy kenniw ineƹȓen, ttareṯ i Arebbi x yinni kenniw itƹeddaben. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Wenni c ɣa yuwṯan ɣar umeggiz nnec, uc-as cek uȓa ḏ ameggiz nnec nneɣni. Wenni ḏac ɣa iysin azeǧab nnec, ejj-iṯ cek aḏac iysi uȓa ḏ ṯaqmijat nnec. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Wenni ḏac ɣa ittaren can ṯmesȓayṯ, uc-as-t. Wenni ḏac ɣa ikksen ṯimesȓayin nnec, war ṯ tettar ca aḏac ṯent yarr. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Mammec texsem aḏawem ggen yiwḏan, uȓa ḏ kenniw ggem-asen amenni. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Meȓa kenniw texsem ɣir yinni iy kenniw itexsen, man lʼajar iy ɣarwem? Iwa uȓa ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan texsen yinni ṯen itexsen. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Meȓa teggem ȓxir ɣir ḏeg yinni iy ḏaywem iteggen ȓxir, man lʼajar iy ɣarwem? Uȓa ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan teggen manaya. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Meȓa ṯerḍȓem i yinni ṯessnem aḏawem d arren, man lʼajar iy ɣarwem? Uȓa ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan reṭṭȓen i yinni iƹeṣṣan ḥima aḏ d arren amarwas nsen. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Walakin xseṯ ȓƹaḏyan nwem, ggeṯ ḏaysen ȓxir. Reḍȓeṯ war trajaṯ walu. Uca aɣarwem yiȓi lʼajar ḏ ameqqran, aḏ tiȓim ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi Yuƹȓan. Minzi netta ḏ aṣebḥan ak yinni war ṯ itcekkaren ca ḏ yinni iteggen ccarr. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Reḥmeṯ iwḏan mammec ireḥḥem Babaṯwem.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">War tƹeyyabem bu yiwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />War tƹeyyabem ḥadd ḥima war kenniw itƹeyyib ca Arebbi. War tzawaȓem ḥadd ḥima war kenniw itzawaȓ ca Arebbi. Semḥem i yiwḏan, aḏawem iɣfar Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ucem-asen i yiwḏan, ataf aḏawem immuc. Aḏawem immuc ȓaƹbar ḏ aṣebḥan ḏeg waḥsi n uzeǧab nwem, aṯ shezzen aṯ ḏekknen ḥetta aḏ infeyyeḍ. Ȓaƹbar iy ṯsexḏamem ḏ wenni iy kiḏwem ɣa isexḏem Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Issiweȓ akiḏsen ƹaweḏ Ƹisa s yijjen n ȓmaƹna inna-asen: "Aḍarɣaȓ, ma aḏ ijarr aḍarɣaȓ? Ma war weṭṭin ca s ṯnayen iḏsen ḏi can ṯesrafṯ? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Ameḥḍar war iǧi ca ḏ ameqqran x lmuƹallim nnes. Walakin mkuȓ ameḥḍar ig ikemmȓen ṯɣuri nnes itiȓi amecnaw lmuƹallim nnes.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Mayemmi tseḥqareḏ cwayt n uȓum ig iǧan ḏi ṯiṭṭ n wumac, cek tettuḏ akeccuḍ ig iǧan ḏi ṯiṭṭ nnec? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Mammec teggeḏ ṯzeƹƹmeḏ aḏ tiniḏ i wumac: Ay uma, ejj-ayi aḏac d kkseɣ ȓum-a ig iǧan ḏi ṯiṭṭ nnec, cek ƹaḏ tejjiḏ akeccuḍ ḏi ṯiṭṭ nnec? A lmunafiq, kkes ḏ amezwaru akeccuḍ zi ṯiṭṭ nnec. Ƹaḏ iy ɣa ṯetwaȓiḏ mliḥ ḥima aḏ tekkseḏ ȓum ig iǧan ḏi ṯiṭṭ n wumac!<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯacejjarṯ ḏ min tarew</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />War ṯeǧi ṯcejjarṯ ṯaṣebḥant tarew min iǧan ḏ aƹeffan. War ṯeǧi ƹaweḏ ṯcejjarṯ ṯaƹeffant tarew min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Minzi kuȓ ṯacejjarṯ ṯḍehhar-d s min tarew. War d ȓeqḏen bu ṯazarṯ zeg isennanen. War d tekksen bu uḍiȓ zi ṯzeggwarṯ. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Bnaḏem aṣebḥan isufuɣ-d min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan zi ȓkenz aṣebḥan n wuȓ nnes. Bnaḏem aƹeffan isufuɣ-d min iǧan ḏ aƹeffan zi ȓkenz aƹeffan n wuȓ nnes. Ȓaḥeqqac aqemmum n bnaḏem issawaȓ min iǧan ḏeg wuȓ nnes.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓebni n ṣṣaḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Mayemmi ḏayi ṯeqqarem a Siḏi, a Siḏi u kenniw war teggem min ḏawem qqareɣ? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Marra wenni ɣari d itasen itesȓa i wawaȓ inu ixeddem zzayes ataf aḏawem iniɣ mindi itcabbah. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Itcabbah ḏeg yijjen n uryaz ig ibennan ṯaddarṯ nnes, iɣza aṭṭas igga dsas x uzru. Wami d iḥmeȓ iɣzar iƹḏu x ṯeddarṯ nni, war izemmar at isenhezz minzi ṯebna mliḥ.<verse eid="LUK 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Wenni itsȓan i wawaȓ inu war zzayes ixeddem ca ataf itcabbah ḏeg yijjen n uryaz ibna ṯaddarṯ nnes x ucaȓ bȓa dsas. Wami xas iƹḏu iɣzar nni ṯewḍa ḏeɣya ḏ abriḏ, ṯeqqim ḏ ȓxirbeṯ."<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Lʼiman n ijjen n uƹaskari ḏ ameqqran n arrumanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Wami ikemmeȓ Ƹisa awaȓ nnes ak yiwḏan iy tuɣa ḏas itesȓan, yuḏef ɣar ubilaj n Kafernaḥum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ḏinni ijjen n uƹaskari ḏ ameqqran n arrumanus ɣares ijjen n uxeddam itƹewwaȓ xas aṭṭas, walakin axeddam nni ihȓec ƹȓayen aḏ immeṯ. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Wami isȓa x Ƹisa issekk ɣares ca n ȓecyux n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḥima aṯ ḥeccmen aḏ d yas aḏ isgenfa axeddam nnes. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Wami d usin ɣar Ƹisa ḥeccmen-ṯ nnan-as: Bnaḏem-a isḏaheǧ aṯ tƹawneḏ <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />minzi itexs ccaƹb nneɣ ƹaweḏ ibna ṯamziḏa nneɣ. <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ikkar Ƹisa iruḥ akiḏsen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Wami iqarreb ɣar ṯeddarṯ nni issekk-d ɣares uƹaskari nni can imeddukaȓ nnes inna-as: "A Siḏi ṯƹeddbeḏ ixef nnec waha, nec war sḏihiǧeɣ ca aḏ taḏfeḏ ɣar ṯeddarṯ inu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />X manaya nec ḥesbeɣ ixef inu war sḏihǧeɣ ca aḏ d aseɣ ɣarek. Ini ɣir ijjen n wawaȓ u ṣafi ataf aḏ igenfa uxeddam inu. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Uȓa ḏ nec s yixef inu ɣari yinni xafi iḥekkmen. Ɣari ȓƹaskar x ufus inu ḥekkmeɣ xasen. Aḏ iniɣ i yijjen: Ruḥ, aḏ iraḥ. Aḏ iniɣ i yijjen: Araḥ-d, aḏ d yas. Aḏ iniɣ i uxeddam inu: Egg ṯa, at igg."<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Wami isȓa Ƹisa i manayenni itƹejjeb ḏayes aṭṭas, ineqȓeb ɣar ȓɣaci iy ṯ iḏfaren inna-asen: "Aḏawem iniɣ: Yinni iǧan zi Ayṯ-Israʼil war ḏaysen ufiɣ bu lʼiman imɣar aṭṭas am wanita!" <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Yinni issekk uƹaskari nni ḏewȓen ɣar ṯeddarṯ ufin axeddam igenfa.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isnekkar-d ijjen n umettin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ṯiwecca nnes iruḥ Ƹisa ɣar yijjen n ubilaj qqaren-as Naƹin, akiḏes imeḥḍaren nnes ḏ ȓɣaci aṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Wami iqarreb ɣar ṯewwarṯ n ubilaj, yufa ḏinni ysin-d ijjen n umettin aṯ neḍȓen. Netta iy ɣares ɣar yemmas waḥḏes, nettaṯ ḏ ṯajjaȓṯ. Akiḏes ḏinni aṭṭas n ȓɣaci zeg ubilaj nni.<verse eid="LUK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Wami t iẓra Siḏiṯneɣ ṯeqqes-as inna-as: "War tru ca!" <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Iqarreb ɣar ȓmeḥmeȓ iḥaḏa-ṯ, bedden yinni ṯ iysin. Inna: "Kkar ay aḥenjir." <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Ikkar-d umettin nni ibḏa issawaȓ, yarr-iṯ Ƹisa i yemmas.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Marra ggwḏen semɣaren Arebbi nnan: "Imeḍhar-d jaraneɣ ijjen n nnabi ḏ ameqqran. Arebbi ifqeḏ ccaƹb nnes!" <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Iffeɣ ȓexbar-a x Ƹisa ḏi marra ṯamurṯ n Yahuḏiya ḏ marra jwayeh iy ḏas d innḍen.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ Siḏna Yaḥya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Yaḥya yarra-d ȓexbar x marra manaya zeg imeḥḍaren nnes. Iȓaɣa-d x ṯnayen zzaysen <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />issekk-iṯen ɣar Siḏiṯneɣ ḥima aḏas inin ma ḏ cek iy xef netsȓa aḏ d taseḏ niɣ a nraja can yijjen nneɣni?<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Wami d usin <char style="it">ṯnayen</char> nni n iryazen ɣar Ƹisa, nnan-as qa isqaḏ-aneɣ-d ɣarek Yaḥya ac nesseqsa: Ma ḏ cek iy netraja aḏ d taseḏ niɣ ḏ can yijjen nneɣni? <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni isgenfa Ƹisa aṭṭas n imehȓac ḏ yinni ḏi iǧa ȓeḥȓiq ḏ yinni ḏi ǧan jnun ḏ iƹeffanen. Ƹaweḏ yarra aṭṭas n iḍarɣaȓen twaȓan.<verse eid="LUK 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ƹeqbeṯ ɣar Yaḥya ƹawḏem-as min twaȓam ḏ min tesȓam: iḍarɣaȓen twaȓan, izeḥḥafen gguren, yinni iy ḏi iǧa jḏam genfan, iḏehcuren tesȓan, yinni immuṯen tnekkaren-d, ȓmusakin twabeccaren. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ssaƹḏ n yinni war ḏayi itcekkin ca."<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ṣafi rewwḥen yinni issekk Yaḥya, Ƹisa ibḏa issawaȓ x Yaḥya iqqar-asen i ȓɣaci nni: "Minxef ṯeffɣem aḏ teẓrem ḏi ȓexȓa? Ma ɣar yij uɣanim ithezza-ṯ arriḥ? Lla! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Meȓa lla, minxef ṯeffɣem aḏ teẓrem? Ma ḏ ijjen n uryaz yareḍ arruḍ ḏ aṣebḥan? Lla, yinni iy ɣar iǧa warruḍ ḏ aṣebḥan tƹicen mliḥ tiȓin ḏi ȓquṣur n izeǧiḏen! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Meȓa lla, minxef ṯeffɣem aḏ teẓrem? Ma ḏ ijjen n nnabi? Qqareɣ-awem: Wah, netta ktar zeg yijjen n nnabi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ḏ Yaḥya iy xef issawaȓ Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">&lt;Aqa tsekkiɣ-d ijjen n arrasul inu zzaṯec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">ḥima aḏac isewjeḏ abriḏ nnec.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Aqa tesȓam: Zi min d jjint ṯemɣarin war iǧi ḥadd ḏ ameqqran zi Yaḥya, walakin wenni iy iǧan ḏ amezyan qaƹ ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi netta ḏ ameqqran zi Yaḥya."<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Marra iwḏan tesȓan xas, uȓa ḏ iƹeccaren niṯni s yixef nsen ƹtarfen belli manaya iǧa nican minzi niṯni twaṭehharen s waman ƹlaḥsab Yaḥya. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Walakin ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḏ yinni itcerraḥen ccariƹa war xisen ca min ixes Arebbi, ugin aṯen iṭehhar Yaḥya s waman.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />"X manaya wi ḏi ɣa cabbheɣ iwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a? Minḏi tcabbahen? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Niṯni am ca n iḥenjiren iy iqqimen ḏi ssaḥa tȓaɣan i wayawya qqaren: Netṣuḍ ḏi ṯemja, war ṯecḍiḥem ca. Netƹezza-kenniw, war ṯetrum ca. <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Minzi Yaḥya yusa-d itẓumma war isess aman n uḍiȓ kenniw ṯennim aqa ḏayes jnun! <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Yusa-d Mmis n bnaḏem itett isess war itẓummi ca. Kenniw ṯennim aqa bnaḏem-a itett isess aṭṭas, ƹaweḏ netta ḏ ameddukeȓ n iƹeccaren ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Innama, ȓefhameṯ n Arebbi qebbȓen-teṯ marra yinni itefhamen."<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ twaɣfarent-as ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Ij ufarrisi iƹareḍ Ƹisa ḥima aḏ icc akiḏes. Yuḏef ɣar ṯeddarṯ n ufarrisi nni iqqim ɣar missa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Ḏinni ḏeg ubilaj nni ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯƹeṣṣa. Ṯarra-d ȓexbar Ƹisa iqqim aḏ icc ḏi ṯeddarṯ n ufarrisi nni, ṯusa-d nettaṯ ɣares ijjen n ṯzeyyat ḏayes aman n lwarḏ. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ṯeqqim ɣar ḏeffar n Ƹisa ɣar iḍaren nnes ṯebḏa ṯetru wḍan-as imeṭṭawen nnes x iḍaren n Ƹisa. Ṯruḥ ṯemseḥ-iṯen s ucewwaf nnes, ṯseǧem-iṯen ṯeḏhen-iṯen s waman n lwarḏ.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Afarrisi nni iy ṯ iƹarḍen wami iẓra manaya inna ḏi nnefs nnes: Wanita maƹlik ḏ nnabi ataf aḏ issen min ṯeƹna ṯemɣarṯ-a iy ṯ itḥaḏan, nettaṯ ṯeƹṣa Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-as: "A Simƹan, ɣari ij n ȓḥajeṯ aḏac t iniɣ."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Inna-as Simƹan: "Siweȓ a Lmuƹallim."<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />"Ḏinni ijjen n ssiyyed irḍeȓ tmenyaṯ i ṯnayen n yiwḏan. Ijjen irḍeȓ-as xemsmiyya dinar, ijjen irḍeȓ-as xemsin dinar. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Walakin war ɣarsen minzi ɣa arren, ṣafi ssiyyed nni ismeḥ-asen marra. In-ayi cek: Manwen iy ṯ ɣa iḥibben aṭṭas?"<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Inna-as Simƹan: "Imken wenni umi ismeḥ ḏeg waṭṭas n umarwas."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ɣarek ȓḥaqq."<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ineqȓeb ɣar ṯemɣarṯ nni inna-as i Simƹan: "Aqa twaȓiḏ ṯamɣarṯ-a? Usiɣ-d ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnec war ḏayi d ṯuwiḏ cek uȓa ḏ aman iy zi ɣa sirḏeɣ iḍaren inu. Nettaṯ ṯsireḏ-ayi iḍaren inu s imeṭṭawen nnes ṯemseḥ-iṯen s ucewwaf nnes. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Cek war xafi ṯseǧmeḏ ca. Zeg wami d usiɣ nettaṯ ṯseǧam-ayi iḍaren inu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Cek war ḏayi ṯeḏhineḏ azeǧif uȓa s zzect. Nettaṯ ṯeḏhen-ayi iḍaren inu s waman n lwarḏ. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />X manaya aḏac iniɣ, ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nni iy ṯegga aṭṭas twaɣfarent-as minzi nettaṯ ḏayes ȓemḥibbeṯ aṭṭas. Wenni umi twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ ḏrus, netta ḏayes ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏrus."<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Inna-as i ṯemɣarṯ nni: "Ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnem twaɣfarent-am."<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bḏan yinni iy kis iqqimen qqaren i wayawya: "Min iƹna wanita ig iɣfaren ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ-a?"<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Inna-as Ƹisa i ṯemɣarṯ nni: "Cem isenjem-icem lʼiman nnem, ruḥ ḏi ȓehna."<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n wenni izerrƹen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Menbaƹd i manaya iggur Ƹisa zi dcar ɣar dcar zeg ubilaj ɣar ubilaj itḥeddaṯ itbeccar s ȓmulk n Arebbi. Akiḏes ṯenƹac n imeḥḍaren nnes <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />ḏ can ṯemɣarin isgenfa-ṯent zi jnun ḏ ȓehȓacaṯ. Niṯenti ḏ Maryam umi qqaren ṯamagdaliṯ iy zi ffɣen sebƹa n jnun, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />ḏ Ayunna ṯamɣarṯ n Xuzi lwakil n Hirudus, ḏ Suzana, ḏ ṯinneḍni aṭṭas iy tƹawanent s wagȓa nsent.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Wami xas d munen ƹaweḏ aṭṭas n ȓɣaci ḏ yinni ɣares d yusin zi mkuȓ abilaj, ibḏa issawaȓ akiḏsen s yijjen n ȓmaƹna inna: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />"Iffeɣ ufeǧaḥ aḏ izreƹ. Wami izerreƹ, ṯewḍa-yas can zzarriƹeṯ x ṭṭarf n ubriḏ. Ƹeffsen xas yiwḏan ccin-teṯ ijḍaḍ n ujenna. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Can zzarriƹeṯ ṯewḍa-yas jar yizra. Ṯeɣmi-d, ȓexddenni ṯnezȓef ṯisraw ȓaḥeqqac war ṯeswi bu waman. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Can zzarriƹeṯ ṯewḍa jar isennanen. Ɣmin-d akiḏes isennanen nni jeyyfen-teṯ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Can zzarriƹeṯ ṯewḍa x ṯmurṯ ṯaṣebḥant. Ṯuȓi-d ṯemɣar ṯegga ṯiyḏerin, kuȓ icten ṯurew miyya." Wami ikemmeȓ wawaȓ-a inna s jjheḏ: "Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan."<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asefhem n ȓmaƹna n wenni izerrƹen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Sseqsan-ṯ imeḥḍaren nnes nnan-as: "Min ixes aḏ yini ȓmaƹna-ya?"<verse eid="LUK 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Inna-asen: "Itwasmeḥ i kenniw aḏ tessnem min inuffaren ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi, walakin i yiwḏan nneɣni lla. Ssawaȓeɣ akiḏsen s ȓemƹani ḥima aḏ xzaren walakin war twiȓin ca, ḥima aḏ sȓen walakin war fehhmen i ca.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Ȓmaƹna-ya ixes aḏ yini: Zzarriƹeṯ nni nettaṯ ḏ awaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Zzarriƹeṯ nni ig iwḍan x ubriḏ nettaṯ am yiwḏan iy tesȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi. Itraḥ Ibȓis itekkes-asen-ṯ zeg wuȓ ḥima war timnen ca, war nejjmen ca. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Zzarriƹeṯ nni ig iwḍan jar yizra nettaṯ am yiwḏan iy tesȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi, qebȓen-ṯ s ȓefraḥeṯ. Wami war uwṯin bu iẓewran mliḥ ḏeɣya tneqȓaƹen. Tamnen zzayes ɣir ḏeg yijjen n ȓweqṯ waha, ḏi ȓweqṯ n ȓemḥayen ḏeɣya teffɣen abriḏ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Zzarriƹeṯ nni ig iwḍan jar isennanen nettaṯ am yiwḏan iy tesȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi, walakin ḏeɣya temjeyyafen s umnus ḏ wagȓa ḏ ccehawaṯ n ddunect-a war neffƹen ca. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Walakin zzarriƹeṯ nni ig iwḍan ḏi ṯmurṯ ṯaṣebḥant nettaṯ am yiwḏan iy tesȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi qebȓen-ṯ s wuȓ nsen aṣebḥan ḏ acemȓaȓ, ṣebbaren ḥima aḏ arwen.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n ȓqendiȓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Uȓa ḏ ijjen war itcaƹƹiȓ ȓqendiȓ ḥima axas iqȓeb aqnuc niɣ aṯ igg swadday i qama. Lla, itegg-iṯ x ȓmarfaƹ ḥima aḏasen yuc ṯfawṯ i yinni iy d ɣa yaḏfen. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Marra min inuffaren aḏ d imeḍhar. Marra min itwasnuffaren aḏ inefḍeḥ aḏ itwassen. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem i mammec tesȓam. Wenni iǧan ɣares itmarni-yas. Walakin wenni war ɣar iǧi ca, itwaksi-yas uȓa ḏ min ḏas itɣir ɣares."<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ yemmas ḏ ayṯmas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Ƹisa ṯusa-d ɣares yemmas ḏ ayṯmas, war zemmaren ca aɣares awḍen, ḏinni aṭṭas n ȓɣaci.<verse eid="LUK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Nedqen-d can yiwḏan nnan-as: "Aqa yemmac ḏ ayṯmac bedden ɣar barra rezzun acek ẓren."<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yarra xasen inna-asen: "Aqa yemma ḏ ayṯma niṯni ḏ iwḏan nni itsȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi xeddmen zzayes."<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isbedda arriḥ ḏi ȓebḥar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Ijjen n nhar inya Ƹisa ḏi ṯɣarrabut ak imeḥḍaren nnes inna-asen: "Yallah a neẓwam ɣar ujemmaḍ-in n ȓebḥar." Ruḥen, <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />wami uyuren ḏi ȓebḥar, Ƹisa ikka xas yiḍeṣ. Ƹlaɣafla ikkar-d ijjen n arriḥ ijheḏ aṭṭas ḏi ȓebḥar, ṯebḏa ṯɣarrabut tƹemmar s waman uwḍen-d ḏeg yijjen n lxaṭar.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Qarrben ɣares imeḥḍaren sfaqen-ṯ nnan-as: "A Lmuƹallim a Lmuƹallim, aqa neccin netmetta!" Ikkar Ƹisa isbedd arriḥ ḏ ȓemwaj ihedden ȓḥaȓ irsa.<verse eid="LUK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Inna-asen: "Mani iǧa lʼiman nwem?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Ggwḏen tƹejjben nnan i wayawya: "Min iƹna wanitan? Uȓa ḏ arriḥ ḏ waman n ȓebḥar itʼamar-iṯen tṭaƹan-as."<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ijjen ḏayes jnun ḏi ṯmurṯ n ijariṯiyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Uwḍen ɣar ṯmurṯ n ijariṯiyen zzaṯ i ṯmurṯ n Ljalil. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Wami yuweḍ Ƹisa ɣar ȓbarr iȓqa-ṯ-iḏ ijjen n bnaḏem zi ṯendint ḏayes jnun. Netta aṭṭas zeg wami war yarreḍ bu warruḍ war izeddeɣ ca ḏi ṯeddarṯ, izeddeɣ ḏeg imeḍȓan.<verse eid="LUK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Wami yufa Ƹisa ḏinni ibḏa isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ, iwḍa ɣar iḍaren n Ƹisa indeq-d s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯuƹȓa inna-as: "A Ƹisa a Mmis n Arebbi Yuƹȓan, min ṯexseḏ zzayi? Tettareɣ zzayek ḥima war ḏayi tƹeddibeḏ ca!" <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Inna manaya minzi Ƹisa tuɣa yumar jjenn nni aƹeffan ḥima aḏ iffeɣ zeg uryaz nni. Ƹaweḏ minzi jjenn nni iteṭṭef-iṯ aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin. Waxxa teqqnen-as ifassen ḏ iḍaren nnes s snaseȓ ḥeṭṭan-ṯ, itrezza-ṯent indeh-iṯ jjenn nni ɣar ȓexȓa.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Isseqsa-ṯ Ƹisa inna-as: "Mammec ḏac qqaren?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Inna-as: "Nec qqaren-ayi Aberru" minzi tuɣa uḏfen ḏayes aṭṭas n jnun. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ḥeccmen-ṯ aṭṭas jnun nni ḥima war ṯen itsekki ca ɣar wanu bȓa ȓaḥedd.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ḏinni ijjen n ṯḥimerṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant n yiȓfan ṯarwes x uḏrar. Ttaren zzayes ḥima aṯen ijj aḏayes aḏfen. Ssenni ijji-ṯen. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ffɣen jnun zi bnaḏem nni uḏfen ḏeg yiȓfan. Ṯehwa ṯḥimerṯ nni x uḏrar ɣar ȓebḥar ṯeɣreq ḏinni. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Yinni yarewwsen, ẓrin min iweqƹen arewȓen sufɣen ȓexbar ḏi ṯendint ḏ ȓedcuraṯ. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Ffɣen-d yiwḏan ḥima aḏ ẓren min iweqƹen. Usin-d ɣar Ƹisa ufin aryaz nni ffɣen zzayes jnun, iqqim ɣar iḍaren n Ƹisa yareḍ arruḍ nnes igenfa iḏweȓ s ȓaƹqeȓ nnes. Uca ggwḏen aṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Xebbaren-ṯen ȓechuḏ mammec igga Ƹisa isgenfa aryaz nni iy ḏi tuɣa ǧan jnun. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Uca ttaren zi Ƹisa marra ayṯbab n jjiheṯ n ijariṯiyen ḥima axasen ibeƹƹeḏ minzi ggwḏen aṭṭas. Inya ḏi ṯɣarrabut iƹqeb ssenni.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Aryaz nni iy zi ffɣen jnun ittar zi Ƹisa ḥima akiḏes iraḥ. Walakin Ƹisa yugi issekk-iṯ inna-as: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />"Ƹqeb ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnec, sxebbar-iṯen s min ḏac igga Arebbi." Iruḥ uryaz nni ibḏa itxebbar ḏi ṯendint ṯekmaȓ zi min ḏas igga Ƹisa.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa yeǧis n Yagrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Wami d iḏweȓ Ƹisa, reḥḥben zzayes ȓɣaci minzi marra iḏsen trajan-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Yusa-d ɣares ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Yagrus. Netta ḏ arrayes n ṯemziḏa iy iǧan ḏinni. Iwḍa ɣar iḍaren n Ƹisa ibḏa itḥeccam-iṯ aṭṭas ḥima akiḏes iraḥ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />minzi ɣares ɣir ijjen n ṯḥenjirṯ waha ƹȓayen aḏ tegg ṯenƹac iseggwusa, tmetta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ikkar Ƹisa iruḥ, temzaḥamen xas ȓɣaci. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ḏinni jar yiwḏan nni ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯenƹac iseggwusa zeg wami iy ṯehȓec, tazzeȓ s iḏammen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note> Marra min ɣares ḏ agȓa ṯḍeyyeƹ-iṯ x iḍbiben, war izemmar ḥadd at isgenfa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ṯeḏfar Ƹisa, ṯḥaḏa-yas ṭṭarf n useȓham nnes ȓexddenni ṯgenfa ḏeg umcan.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Inna Ƹisa: "Wi ḏayi iḥaḏan?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Marra iḏsen nkaren. Inna-as Buṭrus: "A Lmuƹallim, qa marra yiwḏan-a temzaḥamen xac!"<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Inna Ƹisa: "Lla, sḥisseɣ can yijjen iḥaḏa-ayi minzi ssneɣ jjheḏ iffeɣ zzayi." <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Wami ṯufa ṯemɣarṯ nni ṯnefḍeḥ, ṯruḥ ɣar Ƹisa terjiji ṯewḍa-yas ɣar iḍaren nnes. Ṯƹaweḏ-as zzaṯ i marra iwḏan nni mayemmi iy ṯ ṯḥaḏa ḏ mammec ṯgenfa ḏeg umcan.<verse eid="LUK 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "A yeǧi, cem lʼiman nnem isgenfa-cem. Ruḥ ḏi ȓehna."<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Wami ƹaḏ issawaȓ, yusa-d ijjen zi ṯeddarṯ n arrayes nni n ṯemziḏa inna-as: "Yeǧic cek ṯemmuṯ. War tƹeddab ca ȓexxu lmuƹallim."<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Isȓa-yas Ƹisa inna-as: "War teggweḏ ca! Amen waha, aqa yeǧic aḏ tgenfa." <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Wami yuweḍ ɣar ṯeddarṯ n Yagrus, war ijji uȓa ḏ ijjen aḏ yaḏef illa Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ babas d yemmas n ṯḥenjirṯ nni.<verse eid="LUK 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Marra trun xas tƹezzan. Inna-asen Ƹisa: "War xas trum ca. Aqa ṯaḥenjirṯ-a war ṯemmuṯ ca, ṯeṭṭeṣ waha!" <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bḏan ḍeḥḥcen xas qa ssnen belli ṯemmuṯ.<verse eid="LUK 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Iṭṭef-as ḏeg ufus i ṯḥenjirṯ nni inna-as: "A ṯaḥenjirṯ kkar." <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ȓexddenni buḥbeȓ nnes iḏweȓ-as-d, ṯekkar ḏeg umcan. Iweṣṣa-ṯen aḏas ucen min ɣa ṯecc. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Babas ḏ yemmas qqimen tƹejjben. Netta iweṣṣa-ṯen inna-asen war tƹawaḏem i ḥadd min iweqƹen.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issekk arrusul aḏ beccaren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Iȓaɣa-d Ƹisa x ṯenƹac n arrusul yuca-asen ṯizemmar ḏ ssulṭa aḏ ḥekmen x marra jnun u ƹaweḏ ḥima aḏ sgenfan ȓehȓacaṯ. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Issekk-iṯen ḥima aḏ beccaren s ȓmulk n Arebbi aḏ sgenfan imehȓac. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Inna-asen: "War kiḏwem tiwim walu x ubriḏ. War kessim ni aƹekkaz, ni aqrab, ni aɣrum, ni nnuqarṯ, ni ṯnayen n ičammiren. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Xmi ɣa ṯaḏfem ɣar can ṯeddarṯ, qqimem ḏinni aȓ ɣa ṯuyurem ssenni. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Meȓa war kenniw qbiȓen ca ḏi can ṯendint, ffɣem ssenni mesḥeṯ ṯaƹejjact zeg iḍaren nwem am ca n chaḏeṯ xasen." <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ṣafi ruḥen arrusul ƹḏun ḏi ȓedcuraṯ, tbeccaren sgenfan iwḏan ḏi mkuȓ amcan.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Lwali Hirudus yarra-d ȓexbar x marra min itewqiƹen, iḏhec minzi can yiwḏan qqaren qa wanita ḏ Yaḥya nni, itwasekkar-d zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Ijjen iqqar lla, qa ḏ Ilyas iy d imeḍharen. Ijjen iqqar lla, qa ikkar-d ijjen zi lʼanbiya nni iqḏimen.<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Hirudus inna: "Aqa nec qesseɣ azeǧif i Yaḥya nni, min iƹna wanita iy xef tesȓiɣ manaya?" Ixes aṯ iẓer.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isecc xemsaȓaf n iryazen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Wami d ḏewȓen arrusul, ƹawḏen-as i Ƹisa x marra min ggin. Yuwi-ṯen ssenni ɣar jjiheṯ n yijjen n ubilaj umi qqaren Bayt Ṣayda. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Wami ȓɣaci ssnen manaya ḏfaren-ṯ. Netta isteqbeȓ-iṯen ibḏa issawaȓ akiḏsen x ȓmulk n Arebbi isgenfa yinni ixsen aḏ genfan.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Wami iƹḏu ȓḥaȓ usin-d ɣares ṯenƹac <char style="it">n imeḥḍaren nnes</char> nnan-as: "Sekk iwḏan-a ssa ɣar ȓedcuraṯ ḏ ṯuḏrin yuḏsen ammu ḏ wammu, aḏ rzun min ɣa ccen ḏ mani ɣa sensen minzi amcan-a ḏ ȓexȓa waha."<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ucem-asen kenniw min ɣa ccen."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Nnan-as: "Neccin ɣarneɣ ḏa ɣir xemsa n ṯxebbazin ḏ ṯnayen n iseȓman. Ma a nraḥ neccin a d nseɣ macca i marra iwḏan-a?" <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Minzi ḏinni can xemsaȓaf n iryazen.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Sɣimem-ṯen ḏ lfirqaṯ, xemsin xemsin."<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Ggin manayenni, sɣimen-ṯen marra. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Ikkar iṭṭef xemsa nni n ṯxebbazin ḏ ṯnayen nni n iseȓman, iysi ṯiṭṭawin nnes ɣar ujenna uca icekkar Arebbi. Irza aɣrum nni yuca-asen-ṯ i imeḥḍaren nnes ḥima aṯ ferqen x yiwḏan nni marra. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Ccin marra jjiwnen. Ssenni ysin ṯenƹac n ṯeqrabin ƹemmarent s iȓeqquzen nni iceṭṭen.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buṭrus itcehhaḏ x Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Ijjen n nhar Ƹisa itẓaǧa waḥḏes ṭṭarf nnes imeḥḍaren nnes. Ikkar isseqsa-ṯen inna-asen: "Min xafi qqaren yiwḏan?"<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Arrin xas nnan-as: "Ijjen iqqar cek ḏ Yaḥya. Ijjen iqqar cek ḏ Ilyas. Ijjen iqqar cek zi lʼanbiya iqḏimen iy d ikkaren zi ȓmewṯ."<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Y kenniw, min ḏayi d tarram nec?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Indeq-d Buṭrus inna-as: "Cek ḏ Lmasiḥ n Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Ƹisa iʼakked xasen yumar-iṯen bac war txebbaren ḥadd x manayenni.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Inna-asen i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Mmis n bnaḏem labud aḏ itwaƹeddeb x waṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin, aṯ ƹiffen imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa. Aṯ nɣen, wis ṯeȓtiyyam aḏ d itwasekkar <char style="it">zi ȓmewṯ</char>."<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ṯumma inna-asen i marra iwḏan nni: "Wenni ixsen aḏayi iḏfar nec, labud aḏ ismeḥ ḏeg yixef nnes, labud kuȓ nhar aḏ ikessi ṣṣalib nnes <char style="it">minxef ɣa iƹeddeb</char> aḏayi iḏfar. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ȓaḥeqqac wenni irezzun aḏ isenjem ṯuḏarṯ nnes ataf at ixsar. Wenni ɣa ixsaren ṯuḏarṯ nnes x ssabab inu ataf at isenjem. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Minzi ɣa infeƹ bnaḏem meȓa irbeḥ ddunect-a qaƹ wa ixsar ixef nnes niɣ iḍeyyeƹ ixef nnes? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Wenni xafi ɣa iƹeffaren nec niɣ aḏ iƹeffar x wawaȓ inu, ataf axas iƹeffar Mmis n bnaḏem xmi d ɣa yas s lƹaḍama nnes ḏ lƹaḍama n Babas ak lmalaʼikaṯ iqeddsen. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Ȓebƹaḍ zeg yinni iǧan ḏa akiḏi war tmettin ca aȓ ɣa ẓren ȓmulk n Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏna Musa ḏ Siḏna Ilyas tmeḍharen-d ak Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Menbaƹd i wawaȓ nni can ṯmenyam igaƹƹeḏ Ƹisa ɣar uḏrar ḥima aḏ iẓẓaǧ, yuwi akiḏes Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna ḏ Yaƹqub. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Wami iẓẓuǧ, ibeddeȓ uɣembub nnes iḏweȓ ḏayes nnur, iḏweȓ warruḍ nnes ḏ acemȓaȓ itceƹciƹ. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Meḍharen-d ṯnayen n iryazen ssawaȓen akiḏes ijjen ḏ nnabi Musa ijjen ḏ nnabi Ilyas. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Meḍharen-d ak Ƹisa s yijjen n lƹaḍama ḏ ṯameqqrant, bḏan ssawaȓen akiḏes x wufuɣ nnes iy zi ɣa iffeɣ ḏeɣya zi Lquds. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Walakin Buṭrus ḏ yinni akiḏes teṭṭṣen tnuddumen s yiḏes, wami faqen mliḥ ṯumma ufin lƹaḍama n Ƹisa, akiḏes ṯnayen n iryazen bedden.<verse eid="LUK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Wami ƹaḏ gguren zzayes iryazen nni, indeq-d Buṭrus inna-as i Ƹisa: "A Siḏi, ḏ aṣebḥan akiḏec neqqim ḏanita. Neccin a negg ṯȓaṯa n iqiḍan, ijjen i cek, ijjen i Musa, ijjen i Ilyas."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:33">Buṭrus tuɣa ifaja, war yufi ca min ɣa yini. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Wami netta tuɣaṯ ƹaḏ issawaȓ ihwa-d xasen ij useynu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aseynu netta ḏ asegnu.</char></note> iɣeṭṭa-ṯen ggwḏen.<verse eid="LUK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Ṯendeq-d zzayes ijjen n ṯmijja zeg useynu nni ṯenna-asen: "Qa ḏ wanita ḏ Mmi iy ixḍareɣ, ṣennṭeṯ ɣares."<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Wami ṣafi ṯmijja nni ṯessiweȓ ufin Ƹisa waḥḏes. Imeḥḍaren nni snuffaren manayenni ḏeg wuȓ nsen war xebbaren ḥadd ḏi lʼayamaṯ nni x min ẓrin.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ijjen n uḥenjir ḏayes jjenn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ṯiwecca nnes hwan-d zeg uḏrar, reḥḥben zzaysen ȓɣaci aṭṭas.<verse eid="LUK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Iȓaɣa ijjen n uryaz zi ȓɣaci nni inna: "A Lmuƹallim, tettareɣ zzayec aḏ texzareḏ mmi aqa ḏ wa waha iy ɣari. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Memmi ixeṭṭef-iṯ ijjen n jjenn, ḏeɣya isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ. Jjen nni iserjiji-ṯ aȓ d ɣa isufeɣ netta kuffu zeg uqemmum nnes, war ḏas irexxu ḥetta aȓ ṯ ɣa isala. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ttareɣ zeg imeḥḍaren nnec azzayes sufɣen jjenn-a walakin niṯni war ḏas zemmaren ca."<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yarra xasen Ƹisa inna-asen: "A iwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a iy ḏi war iǧi bu lʼiman, a yinni iffɣen abriḏ! Mecḥaȓ iy kiḏwem ɣa qqimeɣ u mecḥaȓ ḏawem ɣa ṣbareɣ? Awi-yayi-d mmic ḏanita."<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Wami d iqarreb uḥenjir nni ɣar Ƹisa, iserjiji-ṯ jjenn nni iɣḍeȓ-iṯ ɣar ṯmurṯ. Isbedd Ƹisa jjenn nni aƹeffan, isgenfa aḥenjir nni yarri-ṯ i babas. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Qqimen yiwḏan nni marra tƹejjben ḏi jjheḏ n Arebbi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Wami tƹejjben marra ḏi qaƹ min igga Ƹisa, ikkar netta inna-asen i imeḥḍaren nnes: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />"Ṣennṭeṯ mliḥ i wawaȓ-a iy ḏawem ɣa iniɣ: Mmis n bnaḏem ƹȓayen aḏ itwasellem ɣar ifassen n yiwḏan." <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Walakin niṯni war fhimen ca i wawaȓ nni, iqseḥ xasen ḥima aḏ fehmen, ggwḏen aṯ sseqsan x min ḏasen inna.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manwen ig iǧan ḏ ameqqran qaƹ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Tmenɣan imeḥḍaren ak wayawya ug iǧan ḏ ameqqran zzaysen. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ƹisa issen min ɣarsen ḏeg wuȓawen nsen. Isqarreb-d ɣares ij uḥenjir ḏ amezyan, isbedd-iṯ zzaṯes. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Inna-asen: "Wenni ɣa iqebȓen can uḥenjir am wanita ƹlaḥsab isem inu, axmi ḏ nec ig iqbeȓ. Wenni ḏayi iqebbȓen, ataf iqbeȓ wenni ḏayi d issekken. Minzi wenni iǧan zzaywem ḏ amezyan qaƹ, ḏ netta ig iǧan ḏ ameqqran."<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Inna-as Yuḥanna: "A Lmuƹallim, qa neẓra ijjen isufuɣ jnun ƹlaḥsab isem nnec. Neccin nerzu aṯ nesbedd wami war iǧi ca ḏ ameḥḍar akiḏneɣ."<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "War ṯ sbeddam ca. Minzi yinni war iǧin ca ḍed nwem, aqaṯen akiḏwem."<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ijjen n dcar ḏi Samarya war iqebbeȓ ca Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ƹisa wami d tuweḍ ȓweqṯ nnes iy ḏi ɣa itwarfeƹ ɣar ujenna, ikkar iwejjeh aɣembub nnes bac aḏ iraḥ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Issekk arrusul qbeȓ ma aḏ iraḥ netta, ruḥen niṯni uḏfen ɣar yijjen n dcar ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ayṯ-Samarya ḥima aḏas swejḏen amcan. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Walakin iwḏan n dcar nni war ṯ qbiȓen ca minzi ssnen itraḥ illa ɣar Lquds.<verse eid="LUK 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Imeḥḍaren nnes Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna wami ufin manayenni nnan-as i Ƹisa: "A Siḏi, ma ṯexseḏ a nȓaɣa i ṯmessi aḏ tehwa zeg ujenna ḥima aṯen ṯecc?"<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inha-ṯen inna-asen lla. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ṣafi kkaren ruḥen ɣar yijjen n dcar nneɣni.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yinni ixsen aḏ ḏfaren Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Wami gguren x ubriḏ, yusa-d ijjen inna-as i Ƹisa: "Nec ac ḏfareɣ mani ma ṯruḥeḏ."<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Uccanen ɣarsen ifran nsen, ijḍaḍ ɣarsen ȓaƹwac nsen, walakin Mmis n bnaḏem war ɣares uȓa ḏ mani ɣa isummeṯ azeǧif nnes."<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Inna-as Ƹisa i yijjen nneɣni: "Ḏfar-ayi-d!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Inna-as wenni: "A Siḏi, sameḥ-ayi ḏ amezwaru aḏ raḥeɣ aḏ neḍȓeɣ baba."<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Yinni immuṯen ejj-iṯen aḏ neḍȓen imettinen nsen. Cek arwaḥ aḏ tbeccareḏ s ȓmulk n Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Yusa-d ijjen nneɣni inna-as i Ƹisa: "Acek ḏfareɣ a Siḏi, walakin ḏ amezwaru ejj-ayi aḏ msafaḍeɣ x familya inu."<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Wenni isersen fus nnes x usɣar ƹaḏ ixezzar ɣar ḏeffar ataf war iṣeǧeḥ ca aḏ ixḏem ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issekk ṯnayen u sebƹin aḏ beccaren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Menbaƹd i manaya ixḍar Siḏiṯneɣ ijjen ṯnayen u sebƹin n imeḥḍaren, issekk-iṯen ṯnayen ṯnayen izwaren-as ɣar kuȓ ṯendint ḏ umcan ig igga netta aɣarsen iraḥ.<verse eid="LUK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Inna-asen i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Ṯafeǧaḥṯ aṭṭas walakin ḏrus icewwaren iy ɣa ixeḏmen. Ttareṯ zi Bab n ṯfeǧaḥṯ aḏ yarni icewwaren ḏeg umarjeƹ nnes. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Ruḥeṯ, aqa ssekkeɣ-kenniw amecnaw izmaren jar wuccanen. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />War kiḏwem kessim ni ṯazeƹbuȓṯ, ni aqrab, ni ṯisiȓa. War tseǧamem ca x wenni ɣa ṯafem ḏeg ubriḏ. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Xmi ɣa ṯaḏfem ɣar ca n ṯeddarṯ, inim ḏ amezwaru: Sȓam x ṯeddarṯ-a. <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Meȓa iqbeȓ-kenniw bab n ṯeddarṯ nni, ataf akiḏes tiȓi lbaraka nwem. Meȓa war kenniw iqbiȓ ca, ataf war kiḏes tɣimi ca lbaraka nwem. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Qqimem ḏi ṯeddarṯ nni, ccem swem zi min ɣarsen minzi wenni itbeccaren ɣares ȓḥaqq aḏ itxaȓes. War traḥem ca zi ṯeddarṯ ɣar ṯeddarṯ. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Xmi ɣa ṯaḏfem can ṯendint, meȓa qebȓen-kenniw ayṯbab nnes, ccem s minzi ḏawem ɣa ucen. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Sgenfam imehȓac nsen inim-asen qa ȓmulk n Arebbi yuḏes-d ɣarwem.<verse eid="LUK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10-11" />Meȓa ṯuḏfem ɣar ca n ṯendint war kenniw qbiȓen ca ayṯbab nnes, ffɣem ssenni ɣar ibriḏen nnes inim-asen qa uȓa ḏ ṯaƹejjact n ṯendint nwem ḏayneɣ iȓeṣqen ḏeg iḍaren nneɣ at nemseḥ. Walakin itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏ tessnem belli ȓmulk n Arebbi yuḏes-d. <verse eid="LUK 10:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Ḏi Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab aḏ yiȓi lƹiqab n ṯendint nni ktar zi lƹiqab n ṯendint ṯaƹeffant n Sadum.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nnec ya abilaj n Kurazim! Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nnec ya abilaj n Bayt Ṣayda! Maƹlik lmuƹjizaṯ-a iy ḏaywem iweqƹen, weqƹent ḏi ṯneddam ṯiƹeffanin n Ṣur ḏ Ṣayda, ataf ayṯbab nsent tuben mecḥaȓ zeg wami, iȓi ggin arruḍ n lḥuzen qqimen x yiɣɣeḏ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iɣeḏ qqaren-ṯ i ṯnifesṯ.</char></note> ḥima aḏ d tban tuba nsen. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Aqa ṯineddam <char style="it">ṯiƹeffanin</char> nni n Ṣur ḏ Ṣayda aḏ iȓint ḥsen zzaywem ḏi Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Y cek, ay abilaj n Kafernaḥum! Ma tɣir-ac aḏ tgaƹƹḏeḏ ɣar ujenna? Lla, qa cek aḏ tehwiḏ ɣar Ljaḥim."<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Wenni itsȓan i wawaȓ nwem, ataf itesȓa-yayi i nec. Wenni war kenniw iqbiȓen ca, ataf uȓa ḏ nec war ḏayi iqbiȓ ca. Wenni war ḏayi iqbiȓen ca nec, ataf war iqbiȓ ca wenni ḏayi d issekken."<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯnayen u sebƹin n imeḥḍaren nni ḏewwȓen-d s ȓefraḥeṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ḏewren-d ṯnayen u sebƹin nni n imeḥḍaren farrḥen. Nnan-as i Ƹisa: "A Siḏi, qa uȓa ḏ jnun teggen-aneɣ array ƹlaḥsab isem nnec."<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Tuɣa twaȓiɣ Cciṭan iwḍa-d zeg ujenna mamc d iweṭṭa ȓbarq. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Aqa ticceɣ-awem jjheḏ iy zi ɣa ṯƹeffsem x ifiɣeran ḏ ṯɣirḏemiwin ḏ marra jjheḏ n ȓaƹḏu, war kenniw itḍarri walu. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Innama, war farrḥeṯ ca wami jnun ḏawem teggen array. Lla, farḥeṯ wami isemawen nwem urin zemmen ḏeg ujenna."<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Ȓexddenni ifareḥ Ƹisa s Arruḥ iqeddsen inna: "Ḥemḏeɣ-cek a Baba a Siḏi Arebbi n ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ ȓaḥeqqac ṯesnuffareḏ manaya x imiɣisen ḏ lƹulama, ṯseḍhareḏ-ṯ-id i iḥenjiren imezyanen. Wah a Baba, ȓaḥeqqac ammu iy xak yarḍa.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Immuc-ayi kuȓci zi Baba. War issin ḥadd min iƹna Mmis menɣir Babas. War issin ḥadd min iƹna Babas menɣir Mmis. Babas, aṯ ssnen ɣir yinni umi ixes Mmis aḏasen ṯiḏ ismeḍhar."<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ineqȓeb ɣar imeḥḍaren nnes waḥeḏsen inna-asen: "Ssaƹḏ n ṯiṭṭawin nni iẓrin min ṯeẓrim! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Minzi aḏawem iniɣ: Aṭṭas n lʼanbiya ḏ izeǧiḏen rzun aḏ ẓren min twaȓam, walakin war ṯ ẓrin ca. Rzun aḏ sȓen min ṯesȓam, walakin war ṯ sȓin ca."<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmiṯal n yij uṯarras zi Ayṯ-Samarya iteggen ȓxir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Yusa-d ijjen zeg yinni itcerraḥen ccariƹa ixes aḏ ijarreb Ƹisa inna-as: "A Lmuƹallim, min ɣa ggeɣ ḥima aɣari ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda?"<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Min ṯeqqar ccariƹa? Min ḏayes ṯessneḏ?"<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Yarra xas wenni inna-as: "Itxeṣṣa-ac aḏ texseḏ Siḏi Arebbi nnec s marra uȓ nnec ḏ marra arruḥ nnec ḏ marra jjheḏ nnec ḏ marra ȓaƹqeȓ nnec. Aḏ texseḏ ajjar nnec amecnaw ixef nnec."<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ɣarek ȓḥaqq ḏi min ṯenniḏ. Egg zzayes ḥima aɣarec ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ."<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Walakin wenni itcerraḥen ccariƹa irezzu aḏ yuc ȓḥaqq x yixef nnes, inna-as i Ƹisa: "Min iƹna wajjar inu?"<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yarra xas Ƹisa inna-as: "Ijjen n bnaḏem ihewwa zi ṯendint n Lquds iggur ɣar ṯendint n Ariḥa. Ffɣen-d akiḏes ixewwanen ḏeg ubriḏ kksen-as arruḍ nnes, uwṯin-ṯ jjin-ṯ jar ṯuḏarṯ ḏ ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Iƹḏu ssenni ijjen n ȓefqi ḏeg ubriḏ nni, iẓri-ṯ yarweȓ zzayes. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Ȓexddenni iƹḏu-d ssenni ijjen zi ccurfa n Ayṯ-Lawi, ƹaweḏ ixzar ḏayes yarweȓ. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Walakin ij uṯarras zi ṯmurṯ n Ayṯ-Samarya itsafar iƹḏu-d ssenni, iẓri-ṯ iqqes-as. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Iqarreb ɣares iysi zzect ḏ waman n uḍiȓ iḏhen-as s ijariḥen nnes icedd-as-ṯen. Ȓexddenni isney-ṯ x uɣyuȓ nnes, yuwi-ṯ ɣar yijjen n ṯeddarṯ n imsafaren ithella ḏayes igga ḏayes ȓxir. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ṯiwecca nnes iysi-d ṯnayen n dinar yuca-as-ṯen i bab n ṯeddarṯ n imsafaren inna-as: Thilla ḏayes, cḥaȓ ma xas ṯɣasṭareḏ nneɣni, ataf nec xmi d ɣa aseɣ aḏac ṯen d arreɣ." <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Inna-as Ƹisa i wenni: "Min twaȓiḏ cek? Min iƹna wenni zi ṯȓaṯa nni iy ɣa yiȓin ḏ ajjar n bnaḏem nni iy ṭṭfen ixewwanen?"<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Inna-as wenni itcerraḥen ccariƹa qa ḏ aṯarras nni iy ḏayes iggin ȓxir.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ruḥ, egg manayenni uȓa ḏ cek."<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Marṯa ḏ Maryam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Ƹisa ḏ imeḥḍaren nnes gguren x ubriḏ. Yuḏef ɣar yijjen n dcar, ṯreḥḥeb zzayes ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ qqaren-as Marṯa ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Akiḏes ijjen n učmas nettaṯ qqaren-as Maryam ṯruḥ ṯeqqim ɣar iḍaren n Siḏiṯneɣ ṯebḏa tsennaṭ i wawaȓ nnes.<verse eid="LUK 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Marṯa ṯennuɣ aṭṭas ḏi ccɣeȓ n ṯeddarṯ. Ṯusa-d ṯenna-as i Ƹisa: "A Siḏi, ma war ḏac ṯecqi ca učma ṯeqqim waha ṯejja-ayi waḥḏi xeddmeɣ ccɣeȓ? Ini-yas aḏayi ṯƹawen baƹḏa!"<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41-42" />Inna-as Siḏiṯneɣ: "A Marṯa a Marṯa, bnaḏem iteḥḏaja ɣir ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ. Cem ḏayem amnus txeyyaqeḏ x waṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin, Maryam ṯixḍar min iṣebḥan war ḏas itwakkes ca."<verse eid="LUK 10:41-42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa iseȓmaḏ imeḥḍaren nnes mamc ɣa ẓẓaǧen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ijjen n wass Ƹisa itẓaǧa ḏeg yijjen n umcan. Wami ikemmeȓ ṯẓaǧiṯ nni inna-as ijjen zeg imeḥḍaren nnes: "A Siḏi, seȓmeḏ-aneɣ a neẓẓaǧ mammec iseȓmaḏ Yaḥya imeḥḍaren nnes."<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Meȓmi ɣa ṯeẓẓaǧem inim ammu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="bd">A Babaṯneɣ, ḏ ameqqran ig iǧa yisem nnec. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="bd">Aḏ d yas ȓmulk nnec. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />
    <char style="bd">Uc-aneɣ kuȓ nhar aɣrum iy ɣa neḥḏaj. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />
    <char style="bd">Ɣfar-aneɣ ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ i neccin, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="bd">mammec nsemmeḥ i yinni iy kiḏneɣ ixeṭṭan. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="bd">War ḏaneɣ tegg ca ḏi ȓemḥayen." </char><verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5-6" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Maṯalan ijjen zzaywem ɣares ameddukeȓ. Ḏi ȓwesṭ n ǧiȓeṯ iruḥ ɣar umeddukeȓ nnes inna-as: Ay ameddukeȓ, uc-ayi ṯȓaṯa n uɣrum minzi ijjen n umeddukeȓ inu isafar ikka-d xafi, nec war ɣari min ḏas ɣa uceɣ. <verse eid="LUK 11:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Axas yarr umeddukeȓ nni nnes zi ḏaxeȓ n ṯeddarṯ aḏas yini: War ḏayi tseddaƹ ca! Nec ȓexxu ṯawwarṯ ṯbelleƹ ṯarwa inu ṭṭṣen akiḏi, war zemmareɣ ca aḏ kkareɣ aḏac uceɣ." <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Aḏawem iniɣ: Ḏ amezwaru yugi aḏ ikkar aḏas yuc min irezzu waxxa netta ḏ ameddukeȓ nnes, walakin aḏ ikkar aḏas yuc marra min iḥḏaj ȓaḥeqqac <char style="it">yusa-d ɣares ḏi ȓwesṭ n ǧiȓeṯ</char> itrezza-yas azeǧif."<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />"Nec aḏawem iniɣ: Ttarem, ataf aḏawem immuc. Rezzum, ataf aḏ tafem. Sqerqubem, ataf aḏawem rezmen. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Minzi marra wenni ɣa ittaren aḏas immuc. Wenni ɣa irzun aḏ yaf. Wenni ɣa isqerqben aḏas ṯnurzem ṯewwarṯ. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Meȓa can yijjen zzaywem ittar-as mmis asȓem, ma aḏas yuc fiɣer ḏeg umcan n usȓem nni? Lla! <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ma aḏas yuc babas ṯɣirḏent i memmis meȓa ittar-as ṯamǧaȓṯ? Lla! <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Meȓa kenniw ḏ iƹeffanen ṯessnem aḏ tucem i ṯarwa nwem min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan, ataf Babaṯwem ig iǧan ḏeg ujenna itegg ktar, iƹni iticc Arruḥ iqeddsen i yinni ḏas ṯ itettaren."<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itwajah yinni iǧan ḍed nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Isufeɣ Ƹisa ijjen n jjenn ḏ azeynun <char style="it">zeg yijjen n uryaz</char>. Wami iffeɣ jjenn nni issiweȓ uryaz, qqimen tƹejjben ȓɣaci.<verse eid="LUK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Walakin ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen nnan: "Bnaḏem-a isufuɣ jnun minzi arrayes n jnun umi qqaren Bƹalzabul yuca-as jjheḏ-a."<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Inneɣni tettarren zzayes ijjen n lƹalama ḏ ṯameqqrant zeg ujenna bac aṯ jarrben.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Issen Ƹisa min nwan inna-asen: "Mkuȓ lmemlaka iy ḏi tmenɣan ayṯbab nnes ijjen ak unneɣni aḏ tnehḏem. Mkuȓ ṯaddarṯ iy ḏi tmenɣan ayṯbab nnes ijjen ak unneɣni aḏ tewḍa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Meȓa Cciṭan ikkar aḏ iqḍa x Cciṭan, mammec ɣa ṯegg aḏ teqqim lmemlaka nnes? Minzi ṯeqqarem sufuɣeɣ jnun s jjheḏ n Bƹalzabul. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nec meȓa sufuɣeɣ jnun s jjheḏ n Bƹalzabul nni zaƹma, inim-ayi kenniw, mammec teggen yiwḏan nwem sufuɣen-ṯen uȓa ḏ niṯni? Niṯni s yixef nsen tbeyyanen belli kenniw war ɣarwem bu ȓḥaqq ḏi min ṯeqqarem. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Nec meȓa sufuɣeɣ jnun s jjheḏ n ufus n Arebbi, aqa ȓmulk n Arebbi yusa-d ɣarwem.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Aryaz ijehḏen wenni ɣar iǧa ȓesnaḥ iḥeṭṭa ṯaddarṯ nnes, ataf agȓa nnes itiȓi ḏi ȓaman. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Walakin meȓa ihjem xas wenni xas ijehḏen, ataf aṯ iɣȓeb aḏas ikkes marra ȓesnaḥ iy xef iƹewweȓ aḏas yawi agȓa nnes marra."<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Wenni war kiḏi iǧin ca, ataf aqaṯ ḍed inu. Wenni war kiḏi ismunen ca, ataf netta itzeǧaƹ.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Xmi ɣa itwasufeɣ jjenn aƹeffan zi can bnaḏem, ataf aḏ iggur ḏeg imucan yuzɣen irezzu amcan mani ɣa ireyyeḥ. Meȓa war yufi ca, ataf aḏ yini aqa nec aḏ raḥeɣ aḏ ḏewȓeɣ ɣar ṯeddarṯ inu manis iy ffɣeɣ. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Ssenni aɣares iḏweȓ at yaf ṯeƹḏeȓ, ṯenqa. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Uca aḏ iraḥ aḏ d yawi sebƹa n jnun nneɣni ḏ iƹeffanen ktar zzayes ḥima aḏ ḏewȓen kuȓci aḏayes zeḏɣen. Ataf aḏ tiȓi lḥala ṯaneggarut n bnaḏem nni ḏ ṯaƹeffant ktar zi lḥala nnes ṯamezwarut."<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Wami tuɣa issawaȓ x manaya, ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯȓaɣa ḏi ȓwesṭ n ȓɣaci ṯenna: "Ssaƹḏ n ṯemɣarṯ nni iy cek d yurwen, ṯenni iy c issuṭḍen."<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Walakin netta inna: "Lla, ssaƹḏ n yinni itsȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi, tṭaƹan-as."<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yinni irezzun lƹalama ṯameqqrant zi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Wami temzaḥamen ȓɣaci, ibḏa Ƹisa iqqar: "Iwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a ḏ iƹeffanen. Niṯni tettaren lƹalama ṯameqqrant walakin war ḏasen ticc illa ṯenni n nnabi Yunes. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Mammec tuɣa iǧa nnabi Yunes ḏ ijjen n lƹalama i ayṯbab n ṯendint n Ninwa, amenni ƹaweḏ aḏ yiȓi Mmis n bnaḏem ḏ ijjen n lƹalama i yiwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab aḏ tekkar lmalika n Ljanub ak yiwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a axasen ṯceṯca, ȓaḥeqqac ṯusa-d nettaṯ zi ṯmurṯ yugjen ḥima aḏ tṣenneṭ i ȓefhameṯ n Suliman. U ḏanita ijjen ḏ ameqqran zi Suliman. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab aḏ d kkaren imezḏaɣ n ṯendint n Ninwa ak yiwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a axasen ceṯcan, ȓaḥeqqac ayṯbab n ṯendint n Ninwa tuben wami ṯen inha nnabi Yunes. U ḏanita ijjen ḏ ameqqran zi Yunes.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯfawṯ n ddat nettaṯ ḏ ṯiṭṭawin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Uȓa ḏ ijjen war itcaƹƹiȓ ȓqendiȓ ḥima aṯ isers ḏeg yij umcan inuffar niɣ axas iqȓeb aqnuc. Lla, itegg-iṯ x ȓmarfaƹ ḥima aḏasen yuc ṯfawṯ i yinni iy d ɣa yaḏfen. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ṯiṭṭ nnec nettaṯ ḏ ṯfawṯ i ṯuḏarṯ nnec. Meȓa ɣarek ṯiṭṭawin ṣeḥḥant, ataf aɣarek ṯiȓi ṯfawṯ marra ḏi ṯuḏarṯ nnec. Meȓa ṯiṭṭawin nnec war ǧint ca mliḥ, ataf aḏ tiȓi marra ṯuḏarṯ nnec ḏ ṯaǧest. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ḥḍa ixef nnec mliḥ ḥima nnur iy ḏayek war itḏewwiȓ ca ḏ ṯaǧest. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Meȓa marra ddat nnec ḏayes ṯfawṯ war ḏayes bu ṯaǧest, ataf aḏ tceƹceƹ aṭṭas aḏ tegg ṯfawṯ amecnaw mammec ḏawem iticc ȓqendiȓ ṯfawṯ."<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓefḍiḥaṯ n ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Wami issiweȓ Ƹisa, yusa-d ijjen zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen iƹareḍ-iṯ ḥima akiḏes icc. Yuḏef Ƹisa iqqim ɣar missa, <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />afarrisi nni itƹejjeb wami yufa Ƹisa war isireḏ ca <char style="it">ifassen nnes</char> qbeȓ ma aḏ icc.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Inna-as Siḏiṯneɣ: "Kenniw ifarrisiyen ṯsiriḏem ȓkas nwem ḏ ṭṭebsi nwem ɣar barra mliḥ, walakin ɣar ḏaxeȓ nwem ṯeccurem s ṭṭmaƹ ḏ ccarr. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />A yinni war ifehhmen! Arebbi ḏ netta ig iggin ddat, ḏ netta ƹaweḏ ig iggin min ḏayes ɣar ḏaxeȓ. <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ṣeddqem min ḏaywem ɣar ḏaxeȓ, ataf marra aḏ iḏweȓ isireḏ i kenniw.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem a ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen! Ticcem ȓaƹcur uȓa x naƹnaƹ ḏ uwram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awram netta ḏ ijjen n nnuƹ n ȓaƹcub.</char></note> ḏ marra ȓaƹcub, walakin war tehtimim ca zi ȓḥaqq ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ n Arebbi. Lla, ixeṣṣa-awem aḏ tehtamem s manaya bȓa ma tettum ȓaƹcur.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem a ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen! Minzi texsem imucan imezwura ḏi ṯemziḏawin, iteƹjib-awem axawem seǧmen yiwḏan ḏi ȓeswaq. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem, kenniw amecnaw imeḍȓan iweddaren gguren xasen yiwḏan war d arrin ca ȓexbar."<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Indeq-d ijjen zeg yinni itcerraḥen ccariƹa inna-as: "A Lmuƹallim, wami ṯeqqareḏ manaya aqa uȓa ḏ neccin tḥeggareḏ-aneɣ!"<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yarra xas Ƹisa inna: "Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem uȓa ḏ kenniw a yinni itcerraḥen ccariƹa minzi tceddam ȓeḥmeȓ iḏeqȓen iqesḥen x yiwḏan ḥima aṯ arbun, walakin kenniw war tḥiḏim bu ȓeḥmeȓ nni uȓa s yijjen n uḍaḍ nwem. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem minzi kenniw ṯbennam imeḍȓan n lʼanbiya tarrim-ṯen ḏ imrabḏen u kenniw ȓejḏuḏ nwem ḏ niṯni iy ṯen inɣin. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Tafaqem ak ȓejḏuḏ nwem, kenniw ḏ ȓechuḏ x min xeḏmen minzi d niṯni ig inɣin lʼanbiya u kenniw ṯbennam imrabḏen nsen. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />X manaya ƹaweḏ ṯeqqar lḥikma n Arebbi aḏasen ssekkeɣ lʼanbiya ḏ arrusul, ijjen aṯ nɣen ijjen axas azzȓen. <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ḥima iwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a aḏ twaƹaqben x marra iḏammen iy yuzzȓen zi lʼanbiya zeg wami ṯeǧa ddunect-a. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Zeg iḏammen n Habil aȓ iḏammen n Zakariya wenni inɣin jar ȓmeḏbaḥ ḏ ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant. Wah, aḏawem iniɣ: Marra lƹiqab x manayenni ḏ iwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a iy xas ɣa itwaḥesben! <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nwem a yinni itcerraḥen ccariƹa! Ṯeṭṭfem ȓmeftaḥ n ȓefhameṯ, kenniw war tiḏfem ca ḏayes war tejjim wi ɣa yaḏfen."<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Wami ssenni iffeɣ, bḏan imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ḏ ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen tƹarraḍen-ṯ ktar, tseddaƹen-ṯ x waṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Ḥeṭṭan-ṯ ḥima aḏ yini can wawaȓ aṯ ṭṭfen zzayes.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Ṯiggwḏi zi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ȓexddenni munen aṭṭas n uȓufaṯ n yiwḏan aȓ wami ḏewȓen ƹeffsen x wayawya. Ibḏa Ƹisa iqqar-asen i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Ḥḍam ixef nwem zi nnifaq n ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen iǧan am untun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Antun netta amṯun.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Marra min itwasnuffaren aḏ inefḍeḥ. Marra min inuffaren aḏ itwassen. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />X manaya, marra min ṯeqqarem ḏi ṯaǧest aḏas tesȓan s uziȓ. Marra min ṯeqqarem s ȓḥess ɣar ḏaxeȓ i ixammen, azzayes tƹeyyaḍen x ṯzeqqa.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Aḏawem iniɣ ay imeddukaȓ inu: War teggwḏem ca zi yinni ineqqen ddat waha war ɣarsen min ɣa ggen ktar zi manayenni. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Lla, aḏawem iniɣ wi zi ɣa ṯeggwḏem: Ggwḏeṯ zi Wenni iy ɣa inɣen ddat nwem menbaƹd aɣares yiȓi jjheḏ bac aḏ igg ktar, at inḍar ḏi jahennama. Wah, qqareɣ-awem: Wenni ggwḏem-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Ma war tmenzin xemsa n izawjiwen s ṯnayen n duru? Walakin Arebbi war itettu uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaysen. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Uȓa ḏ izuṭṭan iy ɣarwem x uzeǧif nwem iḥseb-iṯen Arebbi marra. War teggwḏem ca, kenniw ṯseggwam ktar s waṭṭas x izawjiwen.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Wenni zzayi ɣa icehḏen nec zzaṯ i yiwḏan, ataf azzayes <char style="it">cehḏeɣ nec</char> Mmis n bnaḏem zzaṯ i lmalaʼikaṯ n Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Wenni ḏayi ɣa inkaren zzaṯ i yiwḏan, ataf aḏ itwankar zzaṯ i lmalaʼikaṯ n Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Wenni ɣa yinin can wawaȓ war iḥȓin x Mmis n bnaḏem ataf axas iɣfar. Wenni ɣa yinin can wawaȓ war iḥȓin x Arruḥ iqeddsen ataf war xas iɣeffar ca ƹemmarṣ.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Axmi kenniw ɣa awin ɣar ṯemziḏawin n Ayṯ-Israʼil niɣ ḏ ȓḥukkam ḏ imxazniyen, bȓa ma aḏ teysim amnus ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem minzi ɣa ṯdafƹem x yixef nwem niɣ ḏ min ɣa ṯinim. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Minzi Arruḥ iqeddsen aḏawem yuc min ɣa ṯinim ḏi ṯsaƹƹat nni."<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n ttajar netta ḏ afɣuȓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Inna-as ijjen n uryaz zi ȓɣaci nni: "A Lmuƹallim, in-as i wuma akiḏi ifreq ȓwarṯ."<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "A bnaḏem, wi ḏayi iggin jarawem ḏ ȓqaḍi niɣ ḏ wenni iferqen ȓwarṯ?" <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Inna-asen: "Ḥḍam ixef nwem, beƹƹḏeṯ x ṭṭmaƹ minzi ṯuḏarṯ n bnaḏem war tiȓi ca s waṭṭas n wagȓa."<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Issiweȓ akiḏsen s yijjen n ȓmaƹna inna-asen: "Ijjen n bnaḏem ḏ ttajar ṯamurṯ nnes ṯurew-as aṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Inna ḏi nnefs nnes: War ufiɣ bu amcan mani ɣa xemmȓeɣ ṯafeǧaḥṯ-a, min ɣa ggeɣ? <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Inna: Aḏ heḏmeɣ ixezzanen inu, aḏ bniɣ inneɣni ḏ jḏiḏ ḏ imeqqranen xasen, aḏaysen xemmȓeɣ marra ṯafeǧaḥṯ ḏ arzeq inu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Aḏ iniɣ i yixef inu: Ṣafi, ɣari aṭṭas n ȓxir iy ḏayi ɣa iqidden i waṭṭas n iseggwusa, aḏ qqimeɣ waha aḏ cceɣ aḏ sweɣ aḏ farḥeɣ! <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Walakin inna-as Arebbi: Ay afɣuȓ! Umi ṯsewjaḏeḏ manaya? Ḏi ǧiȓeṯ-a ṯanita aḏ itwaffeɣ buḥbeȓ nnec. <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Amenni iy ɣa yiȓi wenni ijemmƹen agȓa i yixef nnes waha war ijemmeƹ ca i Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">War kessim bu s umnus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes: "X manaya aḏawem iniɣ: War kessim ca s umnus i ṯuḏarṯ nwem ƹlaḥsab min ɣa ṯeccem niɣ ḏ arruḍ iy ɣa ṯeḥḏajem i ddat nwem. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Minzi ṯuḏarṯ-a tseggwa ktar zi macca. Ddat-a tseggwa ktar zeg warruḍ. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Xzarem ɣar ibaɣeriwen. War zerrƹen, war mejjaren. War ɣarsen ṯisrafin uȓa ḏ mani ɣa xezznen. Ḏ Arebbi iy ḏasen iticcen aḏ ccen. Kenniw, ma war tseggwim ca aṭṭas s waṭṭas x yijḍaḍ? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ug izemmaren zzaywem aḏ yarni s umnus nnes ɣir ṯsaƹƹat waha ḏi ȓƹumur nnes? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Meȓa war ṯzemmarem ca uȓa i min iǧan ḏ amezyan, mayemmi ṯkessim amnus i ca n ȓḥajeṯ nneɣni?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Xzareṯ ḏi nwar n ȓexȓa mammec igga, war yarebbeȓ war itxeyyiḍ. Qqareɣ-awem nec: Uȓa ḏ azeǧiḏ Suliman, mecḥaȓ ɣares ḏ agȓa war izemmar ca aḏ yareḍ ca n warruḍ igga am nwar-a wanita. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Meȓa Arebbi iticc arruḍ zaƹma i arbiƹ n ȓexȓa ig iǧan nhara aḏ iḥreq ṯiwecca ḏeg ufarran, ma war itegg akiḏwem kenniw ktar? Ḏaywem lʼiman nwem ḏ uqlil. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />War rezzuṯ ca min ɣa ṯeccem niɣ ḏ min ɣa ṯeswem, war kessiṯ bu s umnus. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Marra manaya rezzun-ṯ ȓegnus n ddunect-a, kenniw Babaṯwem issen belli teḥḏajim ṯimesȓayin-a. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Rezzuṯ kenniw x ȓmulk n Arebbi, ssenni ṯimesȓayin-a aḏawem marnint. <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />War teggwḏem ca a ṯḥimerṯ inu ṯamezyant, irḍa Babaṯwem aḏawem yuc ȓmulk nnes.<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Zenzeṯ agȓa nwem, ṣeddqem-ṯ. Ggeṯ ṯicemmusin n tmenyaṯ iy war ifennin ca niṯenti ḏ ijjen n ȓkenz ḏeg ujenna war iqeṭṭin ca. War itqarrib ca ḏinni uceffar, ṯikeccawin war ṯ tettent ca. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Aqa mani iǧa ȓkenz nwem, ḏinni iy ɣa yiȓi wuȓ nwem.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iȓim ṯewjḏem xmi d ɣa iḏweȓ Siḏiṯneɣ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Iȓim ṯewjḏem geffḍem, aḏ iȓin ȓeqnaḏeȓ nwem caƹƹȓen. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Iȓim ṯwejḏem am yiwḏan iy trajan siḏiṯsen aḏ d iḏweȓ zi ȓfarḥ, aḏ d yas aḏ isqerqeb aḏas rezmen ḏeɣya. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Ssaƹḏ n ixeddamen nni meȓa yusa-d siḏiṯsen yufi-ṯen ƹaḏ war ṭṭiṣen ca. Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Aḏ igeffeḍ siḏiṯsen aṯen isɣim, aḏ ibḏa itsexxar xasen. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Meȓa yusa-d yufi-ṯen ƹaḏ war ṭṭiṣen ca waxxa ḏi ȓwesṭ n ǧiȓeṯ niɣ qbeȓ i ȓefjar, ataf ssaƹḏ n ixeddamen nni. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Itxeṣṣa-awem aḏ tessnem manaya: Mȓi bab n ṯeddarṯ issen ṯsaƹƹat iy ḏi d ɣa yas uceffar, iȓi war ṯ itijji ca aḏ d yaḏef ṯaddarṯ nnes. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Swejḏem ixef nwem minzi Mmis n bnaḏem aḏ d yas ḏeg yijjen n ṯsaƹƹat war ṯ trijim ca."<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Indeq-d Buṭrus inna-as: "A Siḏi, ȓmaƹna-ya ma ṯeqqareḏ-ṯ ɣir i neccin ma i marra iwḏan?"<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Yarra xas Siḏiṯneɣ inna-as: "Iwa min iƹna uweqqaf nni iǧan ḏ amiɣis ḏayes ȓaman? Netta ḏ wenni ig itkellaf siḏes aḏasen yuc lmakla i ixeddamen nnes ḏi ȓweqṯ nican. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ssaƹḏ n uweqqaf nni xmi d ɣa iḏweȓ siḏes aṯ yaf ixeddem. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Aṯ ikellef siḏes x marra agȓa nnes. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Walakin aweqqaf nni meȓa inewwa ḏeg yixef nnes iqqar: Siḏi itƹeṭṭaȓ aṭṭas war d itis ca, ṯumma aḏ ibḏa iccaṯ ixeddamen ḏ ṯxeddamin itett isess aqaṯ ak iskayriyen waha, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />ataf aḏ d yas siḏes n uweqqaf nni ḏeg yijjen n nhar war ṯ inwi ca, ḏeg yijjen n ṯsaƹƹat war t issin ca. Aṯ iqess ḏ iwezwizen, aṯ inḍar ḏeg umcan nni n yinni iy ḏi war iǧi ca lʼiman.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Aweqqaf nni netta issen min irezzu siḏes walakin war isewjiḏ ca i siḏes war itegg ca min irezzu siḏes, ataf aḏ itwaƹaqeb aṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Wenni war issinen ca min irezzu siḏes itegg ṯimesȓayin isḏahǧen aƹmuḏ, ataf aḏ itwaƹaqeb ḏrus waha. Marra wenni umi immuc aṭṭas, azzayes rzun aṭṭas. Wenni ig itwakellfen x waṭṭas, azzayes rzun aṭṭas.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwḏan aḏ menɣen x ssabab n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Usiɣ-d aḏ nḍareɣ ijjen n ṯmessi icemmḍen x ṯmurṯ, u mecḥaȓ tmenniɣ at afeɣ ȓexxu ṯceƹƹeȓ! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Itxeṣṣa-ayi aḏ twaƹaddbeɣ, xeyyqeɣ aṭṭas ḥetta aȓ ɣa ƹḏuɣ manayenni. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Ma tfekkarem belli usiɣ-d aḏ ggeɣ ȓehna ḏi ddunect-a? Lla! Aḏawem iniɣ usiɣ-d aḏ ggeɣ amenɣi. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ssa aȓ ṯsawent xemsa n yiwḏan aḏ menɣen ak wayawya ḏeg yijjen n ṯeddarṯ: ṯȓaṯa aḏ menɣen ak ṯnayen, ṯnayen aḏ menɣen ak ṯȓaṯa. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Babas aḏ imneɣ ak mmis, mmis aḏ imneɣ ak babas. Yemmas aḏ temneɣ ak yeǧis, yeǧis aḏ temneɣ ak yemmas. Lalla aḏ temneɣ ak ṯesȓiṯ, ṯasȓiṯ aḏ temneɣ ak lallas."<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹalamaṯ n zman-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i ȓɣaci nni: "Meȓa ṯeẓrim aseynu igaƹƹeḏ-d zi ȓɣarb, ḏeɣya aḏ tinim aḏ yiȓi unẓar. U ḏ manayenni iy ɣa yiȓin. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Meȓa iṣuḍ-d arriḥ zi ljanub, aḏ tinim aḏ yiȓi ȓeḥmu aṭṭas. U ḏ manayenni iy ɣa yiȓin." <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Inna-asen: "A lmunafiqin! Lḥala n ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ ṯessnem aṯen tcarrḥem mamc ǧan. Mayemmi war ṯzemmarem ca aḏ tcarrḥem lḥala n zman-a iy ḏi neǧa ȓexxu?"<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meṣȓaḥeṯ ak yiwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Kenniw, mayemmi war tmeyyizem ca s yixef nwem min iǧan ḏ ȓḥaqq? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Cuf, meȓa ithem-icek ca ḥadd menbaƹd uwin-ac-d lʼistidƹa ḥima akiḏes ṯraḥeḏ ɣar lmaḥkama, ƹḏeȓ akiḏes ḏeɣya ḏeg ubriḏ bac war c isiwwiḍ ca ɣar ȓqaḍi, ȓqaḍi nni aḏ iʼamar amxazni, amxazni nni ac inḍar ḏi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nniɣ-ac: War ssenni d teffɣeḏ ca aȓ ɣa ṯxeǧseḏ frank aneggaru."<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issawaȓ x ttuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ḏi nhar nni ḥḍaren-d can yiwḏan xebbaren Ƹisa x ca n yiwḏan zi Ayṯ-Ljalil tuɣa ɣarrṣen i dbiḥaṯ nsen wami d yusa lḥakem ḏ arumani Bilaṭus inɣi-ṯen, iḏammen nsen xellṭen ak iḏammen n dbiḥaṯ nsen.<verse eid="LUK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yarra xasen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Ma ṯḥesbem ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n ijaliliyen-a ktar zi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n marra Ayt-Ljalil wami d tehwa xasen ȓmuṣiba-ya? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Qqareɣ-awem lla. Meȓa war ṯtubem ca, ataf marra iḏwem aḏ temmṯem amecnaw niṯni. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Niɣ ṯmenṭac nni iy xef d tewḍa ṣṣumƹeṯ ḏi ḥay-Silwam ṯenɣi-ṯen, ma tɣir-awem belli ggin dunub ktar zi marra iwḏan izeddɣen ḏi ṯendint ṯekmaȓ n Lquds? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Qqareɣ-awem lla. Meȓa war ṯtubem ca, ataf marra iḏwem aḏ temmṯem amecnaw niṯni."<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n ṯcejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ war itarwen ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Issiweȓ akiḏsen s ȓmaƹna-ya inna-asen: "Ijjen n uryaz ɣares ṯacejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ ṯeẓẓu ḏi ȓaƹraṣi nnes, yusa-d netta azzayes iȓqeḏ ṯazarṯ yufa war ḏayes walu qaƹ. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Inna-as i wenni ixeddmen ȓaƹraṣi nnes: Ṯacejjarṯ-a ṯeȓt snin nec taseɣ-d ɣares ḥima azzayes ȓeqḏeɣ ṯazarṯ war ḏayes tifeɣ walu. Araḥ-d qess-it! Mayemmi t ɣa nejj aḏ tḍeyyeƹ ṯamurṯ waha? <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Yarra xas uxeddam nni inna-as: A siḏi, ejj-it ɣir ȓƹam-a waha axas neqceɣ aḏas ggeɣ ȓeɣbar. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Meȓa ṯurew-d ṯazarṯ ḏeg useggwas-a iy d ɣa yasen, ataf mliḥ. Meȓa ƹaḏ walu, ataf ṣafi qess-it."<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa aƹrur i yijjen n ṯemɣarṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Tuɣa Ƹisa iseȓmaḏ ḏeg yijjen n ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Yufa ḏinni ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯmenṭac iseggwusa zeg wami ṯehȓec ḏayes jjenn, ṯeqwes war ṯzemmar ca aḏ tbedd nican.<verse eid="LUK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Wami t iẓra Ƹisa iȓaɣa-d xas inna-as: "A ṯamɣarṯ, cem ȓexxu ṯenfekkeḏ zi ȓehȓac nnem." <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Isers xas ifassen nnes ȓexddenni ṯbedd nican ṯebḏa ṯḥemmeḏ Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Arrayes n ṯemziḏa nni war ḏas iƹjib bu ȓḥaȓ wami Ƹisa isgenfa ṯamɣarṯ nni ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada. Ikkar netta inna-asen i yiwḏan: "Arebbi yuca settiyyam n ȓxeḏmeṯ, ḏi settiyyam nni iy d ɣa tasem aḏ tgenfim, war iǧi bu ḏi nhar n lƹibada."<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Inna-as Siḏiṯneɣ: "A lmunafiqin, ma war ṯḍeǧqem ca ifunasen ḏ iɣyaȓ nwem zi ȓkuri ḏi nhar n lƹibada ḥima aṯen ṯsesswem? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ṯamɣarṯ-a meskina iǧan zi ddurriṯ n Brahim iḥebbes-it Cciṭan ṯmenṭac iseggwusa, ma war ḏas nrezzem ca zi ȓeḥbes-a ḏi nhar n lƹibada ma lla?" <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Wami inna awaȓ-a, marra yinni akiḏes itmenɣan seḏḥan. Iwḏan nneɣni marra farḥen zi ȓexḏayem ṯimeqqranin ig itegg.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issawaȓ x ȓmulk n Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Minḏi itcabbah ȓmulk n Arebbi? Niɣ s minzi ɣa ṯ meṯṯleɣ? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ȓmulk n Arebbi igga am yijjen n zzarriƹeṯ n yijjen n nnuƹ n arbiƹ qqaren-as bugarḏaȓ. Iysi-t ijjen n uryaz yuwi-t iẓẓu-t ḏi ȓƹarseṯ nnes. Ṯemɣar ṯḏewweȓ am ṯcejjarṯ, ijḍaḍ tasen-d teggen ḏayes ȓaƹwac nsen."<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Inna-asen ƹaweḏ: "S minzi ɣa meṯṯleɣ ȓmulk n Arebbi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Netta am untun ṯeysi-ṯ ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯuggwa zzayes ȓmudd n waren, antun nni isgaƹƹeḏ-iṯ-id marra."<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯawwarṯ n ṯuḏarṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Ikka Ƹisa x ibilajen ḏ ȓedcuraṯ, iseȓmaḏ iggur ɣar ṯendint n Lquds.<verse eid="LUK 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Isseqsa-ṯ ijjen n uryaz inna-as: "A Siḏi, ma ḏrus iy ɣa iraḥen ɣar ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Inna-as Ƹisa: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />"Ggeṯ mamc ɣa ṯaḏfem zi ṯewwarṯ iḥṣaren. Aḏawem iniɣ: Aṭṭas n yiwḏan ataf aḏ rzun aḏ aḏfen walakin war zemmaren. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Bab n ṯeddarṯ aḏ ikkar aḏ ibelleƹ ṯawwarṯ ṣafi. Kenniw meȓa ṯeqqimem ɣar barra ṯesqerqubem ḏi ṯewwarṯ ṯeqqarem: A siḏi, rzem-aneɣ! Aḏawem yini: Nec war ssineɣ ca zi manis d tusim! <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ssenni aḏ tebḏam aḏ tinim: Neccin necca neswa akiḏec, tuɣa ṯseȓmaḏeḏ-aneɣ ḏeg ibriḏen nneɣ! <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Aḏawem yini: Nec war ssineɣ ca zi manis d tusim. Beƹƹḏem xafi a yinni iteggen ccarr! <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Ḏinni i ɣa yiȓin imeṭṭawen ḏ uɣeẓẓaẓ n ṯeɣmas xmi ɣa ṯeẓrem Brahim ḏ Isḥaq ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ marra lʼanbiya ɣar ḏaxeȓ ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi, kenniw tmenḍarem ɣar barra! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Aḏ d asen yiwḏan zi ccarq ḏ ȓɣarb ḏ ccamal ḏ ljanub, aḏ qqimen ɣar missa ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Yinni iǧan ḏ ineggura aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ imezwura; Yinni iy iǧan ḏ imezwura aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ ineggura."<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ixeyyeq x ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Nhar nni qarrben ȓebƹaḍ zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ɣar Ƹisa nnan-as: "Ffeɣ ssanita aqa azeǧiḏ Hirudus irezzu ac ineɣ!"<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ruḥeṯ inim-as i wuccen nni: Qa nec sufuɣeɣ jnun, sgenfayeɣ iwḏan nhara ḏ ṯiwecca. Ḏi nhar wis ṯeȓtiyyam aḏ kemmȓeɣ. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Walakin labud aḏ uyureɣ nhara ḏ ṯiwecca ḏ nhar iy ṯiḏ ɣa iḏfaren minzi war izemmar aḏ immeṯ can nnabi illa ḏi ṯendint n Lquds.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Ya Lquds, ya Lquds! Ḏ cem ig ineqqen lʼanbiya, ḏ cem ig irejjmen yinni ɣarem d issekk Arebbi! Nec mecḥaȓ n ṯwaȓaṯin xseɣ aḏ smuneɣ ṯarwa nnem am can ṯyaziṭ iteḥbubuḍen x ifiǧusen nnes walakin kenniw ṯugim. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Aqa ṯaddarṯ nwem aḏ texȓa! Aḏawem iniɣ belli war ḏayi ṯẓerrem ca ƹaweḏ ḥetta aȓ nhar nni iy ɣa ṯinim: Ssaƹḏ ya wenni iy d yusin ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏi Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ijjen n uryaz ihȓec ḏayes ṯuffet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Ijjen n nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada iruḥ Ƹisa yuḏef ṯaddarṯ n yijjen zeg imeqqranen n ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḥima aḏ icc aɣrum, niṯni ḥeṭṭan-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ḏinni zzaṯes ijjen n uryaz ihȓec ḏayes ṯuffet.<verse eid="LUK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i yinni itcerraḥen ccariƹa ḏ yinni zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen: "Ma ḥalal aḏ itwasgenfa bnaḏem ḏi nhar n lƹibada ma lla?" <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Niṯni sqaren waha. Uca Ƹisa isqarreb-iṯ-iḏ ɣares isgenfa-ṯ, inna-as iwa ruḥ.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Meȓa can yijjen zzaywem iwḍa-yas mmis niɣ ḏ ayenduz nnes ḏeg wanu ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada, ma war ṯiḏ isiȓi ca ḏeɣya niɣ lla?" <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Niṯni ugin aṯ jawben x manaya.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n inewjiwen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Ƹisa wami yufa ḏinni yinni itwaƹarḍen qqimen rezzun x imucan imezwura ɣar missa, ibḏa issawaȓ akiḏsen s yijjen n ȓmaƹna inna-asen: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />"Meȓa iƹareḍ-ic can yijjen ɣar yijjen n ȓfarḥ, war tɣima ca cek ḏeg umcan amezwaru; Lla, imken ƹarḍen can ijjen ɣares lqima ktar zzayek. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Aɣarek d yas wenni iy xawem iƹarḍen aḏac yini uc-as amcan nnec i wanita! Ataf aḏ tseḏḥiḏ aḏ tekkareḏ aḏ traḥeḏ ɣar umcan aneggaru. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Lla, meȓa ƹarḍen xak, ruḥ qqim ḏeg umcan aneggaru. Aɣarek d yas wenni iy c iƹarḍen aḏac yini ay ameddukeȓ inu gaƹƹeḏ ḏiha. Ataf aḏ temɣareḏ ɣar marra yinni itwaƹarḍen. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ȓaḥeqqac wenni isemɣaren ixef nnes, ataf aḏ yiȓi ḏ amezyan. Wenni isemzayen ixef nnes, ataf aḏ yiȓi ḏ ameqqran."<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Inna-as Ƹisa i wenni iy ṯ iƹarḍen: "Meȓa ṯeggiḏ amecri niɣ ḏ amensi, war ƹarreḍ ca x imeddukaȓ nnec niɣ ḏ ayṯmac niɣ ḏ familya nnec niɣ ḏ jjiran iǧan ḏ twajar minzi meȓa ƹarḍen-c uȓa ḏ niṯni, ataf war ɣarek bu lʼajar x manaya. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Lla, meȓa ṯeggiḏ zarrdeṯ ƹareḍ x ȓmusakin ḏ inecrufen ḏ izeḥḥafen ḏ iḍarɣaȓen. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Ssaƹḏ nnec ƹlaḥeqqac war ɣarsen minzi c ɣa xeǧsen. Ataf aḏac itwaxȓef ḏi Nhar nni xmi d ɣa kkaren zi ȓmewṯ yinni iǧan nican."<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n umensi ameqqran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ikkar ijjen zeg yinni itwaƹarḍen isȓa i wawaȓ nni inna-as i Ƹisa: "Ssaƹḏ n wenni iy ɣa iccen aɣrum ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi!"<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ijjen n uryaz igga amensi ḏ ameqqran iƹareḍ x waṭṭas n yiwḏan. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Issekk axeddam nnes ḏi ȓweqṯ n umensi i yinni xef iƹareḍ bac aḏasen yini: Araḥem-d aqa kuȓci iwjeḏ! <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Marra iḏsen bḏan teggen ssabab bac war triḥen ca. Ḏ amezwaru inna-as ijjen: Nec sɣiɣ ij umarjeƹ itxeṣṣa-ayi aḏ raḥeɣ aṯ ẓreɣ, sameḥ-ayi. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Inna-as ijjen ƹaweḏ: Nec sɣiɣ xemsa n ṯyuya n ifunasen. Ȓexxu aḏ raḥeɣ ḥima aṯen qeǧbeɣ, sameḥ-ayi. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Inna-as ijjen nneɣni: Nec uwiɣ ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ, x manaya war zemmareɣ aḏ d aseɣ. <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Iḏweȓ-d uxeddam nni ɣar siḏes iƹaweḏ-as min iweqƹen. Ȓexddenni iɣḍeb bab n ṯeddarṯ inna-as i uxeddam nnes: Ffeɣ ḏeɣya ɣar ccawariƹ ḏ znaqi, siḏef-d ȓmusakin ḏ inecrufen ḏ iḍarɣaȓen ḏ izeḥḥafen. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Inna-as uxeddam: Aqayi ggiɣ min ḏayi ṯenniḏ a siḏi walakin ƹaḏ qqimen imucan xwan. <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Inna-as siḏes: Ffeɣ ɣar ibriḏen ḏ imesruqen, siḏef-d iwḏan s bezzez bac aḏ aḏfen bac aḏ tƹemmar ṯeddarṯ inu. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Uȓa ḏ ijjen zeg yinni iy xef ƹarḍeɣ war itqisi amensi inu!"<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ameḥḍar itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ ismeḥ ḏeg yixef nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Ḏinni aṭṭas n ȓɣaci gguren ak Ƹisa, ineqȓeb-d ɣarsen inna-asen: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />"Wenni ɣari d itasen nec, meȓa iƹizz xas babas ktar zzayi nec niɣ ḏ yemmas niɣ ḏ ṯemɣarṯ nnes niɣ ḏ ṯarwa nnes niɣ ḏ ayṯmas niɣ ḏ swiṯmas niɣ ḏ ixef nnes, ataf war izemmar aḏ yiȓi ḏ ameḥḍar inu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xzar Lkitab n Matta 10:37.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Wenni irezzun aḏayi iḏfar war ikessi ca ṣṣalib nnes <char style="it">mix ɣa iƹeddeb</char>, ataf war izemmar aḏ yiȓi ḏ ameḥḍar inu.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Meȓa can ijjen zzaywem irzu aḏ ibna ṣṣumƹeṯ, itxeṣṣa-yas ḏ amezwaru aḏ igg ȓeḥsab mecḥaȓ minzi ɣa ṯenqam ma izemmar-as at ikemmeȓ ma lla. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Maci aḏ igg dsas waha, ṣṣumƹeṯ nni war izemmar ca at ikemmeȓ. Yinni iy ḏayes ixezzaren ataf marra axas ḍeḥcen, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />aḏ inin qa aryaz-a ibḏa ibenna walakin war izemmar ca at ikemmeȓ.<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Azeǧiḏ, meȓa iruḥ aḏ igg ȓḥarb ak yijjen n uzeǧiḏ nneɣni, itxeṣṣa-yas ḏ amezwaru aḏ ifekkar ma aḏ irbeḥ ȓḥarb nni s ƹecraȓaf n ȓƹaskar ȓƹaḏu nnes ɣares ƹicrin aȓaf n ȓƹaskar. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Meȓa war ḏas izemmar ca, aɣares issekk nnuyab nnes netta ƹaḏ iggwej war d yuwiḍ ca bac azzayes ttaren mamc ɣa ggen aḏ ƹeḏȓen jarasen.<verse eid="LUK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Amenni ƹaweḏ war izemmar ca uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaywem aḏ yiȓi ḏ ameḥḍar inu illa meȓa ismeḥ ḏi marra min ɣares.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Ȓemȓeḥ ṯṣeǧaḥ, walakin meȓa iruḥ-as lmaḏaq nnes, mamc ḏas ɣa negg aḏas ṯiḏ narr? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ataf war ṯṣeǧaḥ lla i ṯmurṯ lla i ṯzewbayṯ, ɣir at nḍaren ɣar barra waha. Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan."<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n yinni d iḏewȓen ɣar ubriḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Marra yinni iǧan ḏ iƹeccaren ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan qarrben-d ɣar Ƹisa ḥima aḏas ṣennṭen. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ssawaȓen ḏi Ƹisa nnan: "Aryaz-a itreḥḥab zeg yinni iƹeṣṣan itett akiḏsen!"<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen ȓmaƹna-ya: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />"Ijjen zzaywem ɣares miyya n iḥuȓiyen maṯalan. Meȓa iweddar-as ijjen zzaysen, ataf aḏ ijj tesƹa u tesƹin ḏi ȓexȓa aḏ iraḥ aḏ irzu x wenni iweddaren aȓ ṯ ɣa yaf. Amenni niɣ lla? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Xmi ṯ ɣa yaf aṯ iysi x uɣiȓ nnes aḏ ifareḥ. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Aḏ iḏweȓ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes aḏ d iȓaɣa x imeddukaȓ nnes ḏ jjiran nnes aḏasen yini farḥem akiḏi aqa ufiɣ aḥuȓi nni iy tuɣa ḏayi iweddaren! <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Aḏ farḥen ḏeg ujenna aṭṭas x yijjen meȓa iḏweȓ-d ɣar ubriḏ ktar zi min ɣa farḥen x tesƹa u tesƹin nni war ffiɣen ca abriḏ.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Niɣ, can ṯemɣarṯ ɣares ƹecra n dinar maṯalan, iweddar-as ijjen. Ataf aḏ tceƹƹeȓ ȓqendiȓ aḏ tsekk ḏi ṯeddarṯ aḏ terzu aṭṭas x dinar nni aȓ ṯ ɣa ṯaf. Amenni niɣ lla? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Xmi ṯ ɣa ṯaf, aḏ tȓaɣa x ṯmeddukaȓ ḏ ṯajjarin aḏasent ṯini: Farḥent akiḏi aqa ufiɣ dinar nni iy tuɣa ḏayi iweddaren! <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Amenni ijjen meȓa iƹṣa menbaƹd itub, ataf akiḏes farḥent lmalaʼikaṯ n Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n uḥenjir ig iǧan ḏ amfelles</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Ƹisa inna ƹaweḏ: "Tuɣa ijjen n uryaz ɣares ṯnayen n iḥenjiren. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Wenni amezyan inna-as i babas: A baba uc-ayi ȓḥaqq inu ḏi ȓwarṯ. Ṣafi ikkar uryaz nni ifreq agȓa i ṯarwa nnes. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Wami ƹḏun cwayt n wussan, aḥenjir nni amezyan iysi marra min ɣares ḏ agȓa iruḥ ɣar yijjen n ṯmurṯ ṯiggwej isperḏer ḏinni tmenyaṯ nnes ḏi teflayes. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Wami iḍeyyeƹ marra agȓa nnes, iwqeƹ ḏi ṯmurṯ nni ijjen n buheyyuf war yufi min ɣa icc. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ssenni ibḏa ixeddem ɣar yijjen n uryaz zi ṯmurṯ nni issekk-iṯ aḏ yarwes iȓfan ḏeg imarjeƹiwen nnes. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ḏayes imezȓan aḏ ijjawen s iqaccwen n ṯsȓiɣwa yinni iy tetten yiȓfan nni, war ṯ iƹṯiq ḥadd. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ibḏa ȓexddenni itxemmam mliḥ ḏeg yixef nnes inna: Mecḥaȓ ɣares ḏ ixeddamen ɣar baba itceṭṭa xasen uɣrum, nec aqayi ḏanita tmettiɣ s jjuƹ. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Inna: Aḏ kkareɣ aḏ ḏewȓeɣ ɣar baba aḏas iniɣ: A baba ƹṣiɣ Siḏi Arebbi, ƹṣiɣ cek. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ȓexxu war sḏihǧeɣ ca aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ mmic, egg-ayi am uxeddam nnec waha. <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ikkar iruḥ ɣar babas. Netta aqaṯ ƹaḏ iggwej aṭṭas x ṯeddarṯ wami ṯ iẓra babas iqqes-as. Iruḥ ɣares itazzeȓ iḏerreƹ-as iseǧem xas. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Inna-as mmis: A baba ƹṣiɣ Siḏi Arebbi, ƹṣiɣ cek. War sḏihǧeɣ ca aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ mmic.<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Inna-asen babas i ixeddamen nnes: Ruḥem ḏeɣya awim-d čammir ḏ aṣebḥan arḍem-as-ṯ. Ggem-as ṯxaḏent ḏeg ufus nnes, ggem-as ṯisiȓa ḏeg iḍaren nnes. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23-24" />Awim-d ayenduz nni iṣeḥḥen ɣarṣem-as. A necc a nfareḥ minzi mmi tuɣa immuṯ, ȓexxu iddar. Tuɣa iweddar, ȓexxu itwaf. Niṯni bḏan farrḥen.<verse eid="LUK 15:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Mmis ameqqran netta tuɣaṯ ƹaḏ ḏeg umarjeƹ. Wami d iḏweȓ ɣar ṯeddarṯ iqarreb-d, itesȓa i lmusiqa ḏ cḍiḥ. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Iȓaɣa-d x yijjen zeg ixeddamen isseqsa-ṯ, inna-as min ḏa iweqƹen? <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Inna-as uxeddam nni qa umac iḏweȓ-d. Ȓexxu babac iɣareṣ-as i uyenduz iseḥḥen ȓaḥeqqac ireḥḥeb zeg wumac wami d iḏweȓ s buḥbeȓ nnes. <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Iqqes-as ȓḥaȓ i mmis ameqqran yugi aḏ yaḏef ɣar ṯeddarṯ. Iffeɣ-d ɣares babas ɣar barra ibḏa itḥeccam-iṯ bac aḏ yaḏef. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Inna-as i babas: Nec mecḥaȓ n iseggwusa aqayi xeddmeɣ akiḏec ȓebda tṭaƹaɣ-ac, ƹemmarṣ war ḏayi ṯuciḏ uȓa ḏ iɣiyḏ ḥima aḏ farḥeɣ zzayes ak imeddukaȓ inu. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Wami d yusa mmic-a wanita ig isperḍren agȓa nnec ḏi lfasdaṯ waha, cek min ṯeggiḏ? Ṯɣarṣeḏ-as i uyenduz iṣeḥḥen?<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Inna-as babas: Lla a mmi inu, cek aqac akiḏi ḏanita i ȓebda, marra min ɣari ḏ agȓa inu aḏ iḏweȓ i cek. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ȓexxu itxeṣṣa-aneɣ a nfareḥ a nezhu aṭṭas minzi umac tuɣa immuṯ, ȓexxu iddar. Tuɣa iweddar, ȓexxu itwaf."<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n uweqqaf iy ḏi ṯeǧa ȓefṭaneṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Ƹisa inna-asen ƹaweḏ i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Ijjen n ssiyyed ḏ ttajar ɣares aweqqaf. Ucin-as ȓexbar x uweqqaf nnes iḍeyyeƹ-as aṭṭas n tmenyaṯ. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ikkar ssiyyed nni iȓaɣa-d xas inna-as: Min xak tesȓiɣ? Uc-ayi-d ȓeḥsab iǧan jaraneɣ. Zi nhara aȓ ṯsawent war tɣimiḏ ca aḏ tiȓiḏ ḏ aweqqaf inu. <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Inna uweqqaf ḏi nnefs nnes: Min ɣa ggeɣ? Ȓexxu bab n ci aḏayi ikkes lwakala. Nec war ḏayi bu jjheḏ aḏ neqceɣ, aḏ seḏḥiɣ aḏ ttareɣ. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Uca inna: Ssneɣ min ɣa ggeɣ. Meȓa ikkes-ayi lwakala, ataf azzayi reḥḥben yiwḏan ɣar ṯuḏrin nsen. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Ȓexddenni iȓaɣa-d i kuȓ ijjen umi itars bab n ci. Inna-as i umezwaru: Mecḥaȓ ḏac itars bab n ci inu?<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Yarra xas inna-as: Miyya n ṯbarmiȓin n zzect.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">Inna-as uweqqaf nni: Ysi-d lisṭa nnec qqim ḏeɣya, ari ḏayes ɣir xemsin!<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ƹaweḏ inna-as i unneɣni: Y cek, mecḥaȓ ḏac itars?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Yarra xas inna-as: Miyya n iqendaren n yirḏan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Inna-as uweqqaf nni: Ysi-d lisṭa nnec, ari ḏayes ɣir ṯmanin!<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Bab n ci icekkar aweqqaf nnes ḏi iǧa lḥila x ȓefṭaneṯ nnes.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:8">Cuf, ṯarwa n zman-a ḏaysen ȓefṭaneṯ jarasen ktar zi ṯarwa n nnur. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Nec aḏawem iniɣ: Ggem imeddukaȓ zi ȓewsex n ddunect-a. Ataf xmi ɣa itwaqḍa aḏ twaqebȓem ḏi ṯuḏrin n ȓebda.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Wenni ḏi iǧa ȓaman x ḏrus, ḏayes ȓaman x waṭṭas. Wenni war ḏi iǧi ȓaman x ḏrus, war ḏayes bu ȓaman x waṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Meȓa war ḏaywem bu ȓaman x ȓewsex n ddunect-a, wi ḏaywem ɣa iggen ȓaman x wagȓa n ṣṣaḥ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Meȓa war ḏaywem bu ȓaman x min war iǧin nwem, wi ḏaywem ɣa yucen min iǧan nwem?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />War izemmar aḏ yiȓi can yijjen ḏ axeddam ɣar ṯnayen n siyaḏis. Mayemmi? Ima ijjen aṯ iƹiff, ijjen aṯ ixes. Niɣ ijjen aḏayes iṭṭef, ijjen aṯ iḥeggar. Aḏ txeḏmem i Arebbi niɣ aḏ txeḏmem i ȓewsex n ddunect-a, war iǧi bu s ṯnayen."<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ccariƹa war tbeddiȓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen niṯni zeg yinni itexsen tmenyaṯ, wami sȓin i marra manaya ḍeḥcen xas. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Kenniw ḏ yinni iy irezzun aḏ ucen ȓḥaqq x yixef nsen zzaṯ i yiwḏan, walakin Arebbi issen min ɣarwem ḏeg wuȓawen nwem. Min itarran bnaḏem ɣares lqima, ataf manayenni ḏ aƹeffan aṭṭas ɣar Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Ccariƹa n Musa ḏ useȓmeḏ n lʼanbiya tuɣa ǧan aȓ wami d yusa Yaḥya. Zi ȓweqṯ n Yaḥya ssenni aȓ ṯsawent ibḏa itwabeccar ȓmulk n Arebbi, kuȓ ijjen itemḏeḥḥas ḥima aḏayes yaḏef. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Innama, isheȓ aḏ itwakkes ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ qbeȓ iy ɣa ttwakkes ijjen n ṯneqqiṭ zi ccariƹa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Marra wenni ɣa iǧfen i ṯemɣarṯ nnes yuwi can yicten nneɣni, ataf izna. Marra wenni iy ɣa imeȓcen ak ṯenni iǧfen, ataf izna."<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ttajar ḏ ȓmeskin wenni umi qqaren Liƹazar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />"Cuf, tuɣa ijjen ḏ ttajar, netta itareḍ arruḍ iɣȓan kuȓ nhar itƹic ḏeg yijjen n nniƹmeṯ izehhu. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ḏinni ƹaweḏ ijjen nneɣni netta ḏ ȓmeskin waha qqaren-as Liƹazar, ḏayes aṭṭas n ṯḥebba netta itmenḍar ɣar ṯewwarṯ n ttajar nni. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Itmenna aḏ icc min iweṭṭan zi missa n ttajar nni. Arnin-as uȓa ḏ iqzinen tasen-d ȓessḥen-as ṯiḥebba nnes.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Ṣafi immuṯ ȓmeskin nni, ysint-ṯ lmalaʼikaṯ sersent-ṯ x ufuḏ n Brahim. Ƹaweḏ immuṯ ttajar nni ysin-ṯ neḍȓen-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Isiȓi ttajar ṯiṭṭawin nnes itƹeddab ḏi Ljaḥim, iẓra Brahim ḏ Liƹazar akiḏes aqaṯen ḏi ȓeggwaj. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Iȓaɣa-yas inna-as: A baba Brahim rḥem-ayi, sekk-d Liƹazar ḥima aḏ isuff ijjen n ṯicceṭ n uḍaḍ n ufus nnes ḏeg waman bac azzayes semḍeɣ iȓes inu minzi nec tƹeddabeɣ ḏi ṯmessi-ya.<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Inna-as Brahim: Ƹqeȓ a mmi inu, cek ṯeysiḏ ȓḥaqq nnec zi ȓxir ḏi ṯuḏarṯ nnec, Liƹazar iƹic mƹaddeb. Ȓexxu netta aqaṯ ḏa mliḥ, cek aqac ḏi ȓaƹḏab. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />U ƹaweḏ ḏinni ijjen n ȓaǧeɣ yuǧeɣ jaraneɣ. Ijjen ssanita meȓa ixes aɣarwem d iƹḏu war izemmar ca. Ijjen ssenni meȓa ixes aɣarneɣ d iƹḏu war izemmar ca.<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Inna-as ttajar nni: A baba Brahim, x manaya tettareɣ zzayek aḏ tessekkeḏ Liƹazar ɣar ṯeddarṯ n baba. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Ɣari xemsa n ayṯma xseɣ aṯen iƹȓem ḥima uȓa ḏ niṯni war tƹeddiben ca ḏeg umcan-a.<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Inna-as Brahim: Lla, ayṯmac ɣarsen Musa ḏ lʼanbiya nneɣni, itxeṣṣa aḏasen ṣennṭen.<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Inna-as ttajar nni: A baba Brahim! Meȓa iruḥ ɣarsen can yijjen zeg yinni immuṯen, ataf aḏ tuben.<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Inna-as Brahim: Lla, meȓa niṯni war tesȓin ca i Musa ḏ lʼanbiya, waxxa ikkar-d can yijjen zi ȓmewṯ ataf war ṯen isneqniƹ ca."<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Lʼiman ḏ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Ȓebda tewqiƹent ṯmesȓayin iy ɣa iɣeḍȓen iwḏan ḏi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ, walakin ya tamara n bnaḏem nni ig iǧan ḏ ssabab n ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nni. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Netta, meȓa cedden ijjen n uzru n ṯsirṯ s usɣun ɣar yiri nnes aṯ nḍaren ḏi ȓebḥar, ataf ḥsen i netta zi meȓa yuwi ijjen zeg imezyanen-a ɣar ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ḥḍam ixef nwem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Meȓa ixḍa akiḏec umac nha-ṯ. Meȓa indem sameḥ-as. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Meȓa ixḍa akiḏec sebƹa n ṯwaȓaṯin ḏi nhar iḏweȓ-d ɣarek sebƹa n ṯwaȓaṯin inna-ac ndemmeɣ x min xeḏmeɣ, ataf aḏas ṯsamḥeḏ."<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Nnan-as arrusul i Siḏiṯneɣ: "Arni ḏayneɣ lʼiman."<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Yarra xasen Siḏiṯneɣ inna-asen: "Mȓi ḏaywem lʼiman ɣir anect ijjen n ṯḥebbuct n bugarḏaȓ, ataf aḏas ṯinim i ṯcejjarṯ-a n ttuṯ: Neqȓeƹ-d cem s iẓewran ruḥ aḏ teẓẓuḏ ixef nnem ḏi ȓebḥar, ataf aḏawem ṯegg array."<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Semzayem ixef nwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />"Cuf, can yijjen zzaywem maṯalan ɣares axeddam itfeǧaḥ niɣ itrass iḥuȓiyen. Xmi ɣa d iƹqeb zeg umarjeƹ, ma aḏas ṯiniḏ qqim ḏeɣya aḏ tecceḏ? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Lla, aḏas ṯiniḏ sewjeḏ-ayi-d min ɣa cceɣ. Geffeḍ, sexxar xafi aȓ ɣa cceɣ aḏ sweɣ. Ƹaḏ ȓexddenni iy ɣa ṯecceḏ cek aḏ tesweḏ. <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Axeddam nni, ma ṯ ṯcekkareḏ meȓa igga-ac array? Lla. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ammu uȓa ḏ kenniw. Meȓa ṯeggim marra minxef kenniw weṣṣan, ataf aḏ tinim neccin ḏ ixeddamen waha, ntegg ɣir lwajib nneɣ itxeṣṣa aṯ negg."<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ƹecra n imehȓac ḏaysen jḏam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ƹisa ḏeg ubriḏ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds, ikka x ubriḏ mani tḥedda ṯmurṯ n Samarya ḏ ṯmurṯ n Ljalil. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Yuḏef ɣar yijjen n dcar yufa ḏinni ƹecra n iryazen ḏaysen jḏam. Bedden ɣar ȓeggwaj <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />tȓaɣan-as s jjheḏ qqaren: "A Ƹisa a Lmuƹallim, rḥem-aneɣ!"<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Ixzar ḏaysen inna-asen: "Ruḥem ɣar ȓfuqaha seḍharem-asen ixef nwem!" Niṯni wami uyuren ḏeg ubriḏ nsen ṣafi genfan.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Ijjen zzaysen wami yufa ixef nnes igenfa, iḏweȓ-d iḥemmeḏ Arebbi s jjheḏ. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Isejjeḏ-as i Ƹisa ɣar iḍaren nnes ibḏa itcekkar-iṯ. Netta aryaz nni zi Samarya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Inna Ƹisa: "Ƹecra nni, genfan marra ma lla? Mani ǧan tesƹa nni nneɣni? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ma abarrani-ya waha iy d iḏewȓen iḥemmeḏ Arebbi?" <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Inna-as: "Kkar aḏ trewwḥeḏ, lʼiman nnec isenjem-ic."<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmulk n Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Iwḏan zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen sseqsan Ƹisa nnan-as: Meȓmi d ɣa yas ȓmulk n Arebbi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ȓmulk n Arebbi war d itis ca s lƹalamaṯ nni iy zi ɣa ṯetwaȓam. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Lla, ataf iwḏan war qqaren ca qa xzareṯ aqaṯ ḏiha niɣ aqaṯ ḏa! Mayemmi? Ataf ȓmulk n Arebbi aqaṯ ḏaywem."<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Inna-asen i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Aḏ d asent ȓiyyam aḏaysent ṯrezzum aḏ teẓrem ijjen n nhar zi nhuraṯ n Mmis n bnaḏem walakin war ṯ tẓerrem ca. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Aḏawem inin yiwḏan aqaṯ ḏa niɣ aqaṯ ḏiha! Walakin war ḏinni triḥem ca, war ṯen tḏeffarem ca. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Minzi am wassam itebsissiqen ḏi ṭṭarf n ujenna aḏ igg ṯfawṯ ḏi ṭṭarf nneɣni, amenni iy ɣa yiȓi Mmis n bnaḏem ḏi nhar nnes. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Walakin itxeṣṣa-as ḏ amezwaru aḏ itwaƹeddeb aṭṭas, aṯ ƹiffen yiwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Amecnaw mamc iwqeƹ ḏi ȓiyyam nni n Nuḥ, amenni iy ɣa iwqeƹ ḏi ȓiyyam n Mmis n bnaḏem: <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Iwḏan tuɣa tetten sessen, meǧcen twasmeǧacen, ḥetta aȓ nhar nni wami yuḏef Nuḥ ḏeg uɣarrabu. Yusa-d ṭṭufan inɣi-ṯen marra iḏsen.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ƹaweḏ mammec iwqeƹ ḏi ȓiyyam n Luṭ: Iwḏan tuɣa tetten sessen, ssaɣen znuzan, teẓẓun bennan. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Walakin ḏi nhar nni iy ḏi iffeɣ Luṭ zi ṯendint n Sadum ṣafi isehwa-d xasen Arebbi ṯimessi ḏ izra issecmaḍen zeg ujenna, inɣi-ṯen marra.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Amenni iy ɣa iweqƹen ḏi Nhar nni iy ḏi d ɣa imeḍhar Mmis n bnaḏem. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Ḏi Nhar nni, wenni ɣa yiȓin x ṯzeqqa ȓeḥwayej nnes aqaṯen swedday ḏi ṯeddarṯ itxeṣṣa-as war ihewwi ca ɣar ṯeddarṯ ḥima aḏ iysi ȓeḥwayej nnes. Ƹaweḏ wenni ɣa yiȓin ḏeg umarjeƹ itxeṣṣa-as war iteƹqib ca ɣar ṯeddarṯ. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Fekkareṯ ḏi min ḏas iweqƹen i ṯemɣarṯ n Luṭ!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wami Arebbi isufeɣ Luṭ ḏ ṯemɣarṯ nnes zi ṯendint ṯaƹeffant n Sadum, iƹȓem-asen inna-asen war xezzareṯ ca ɣar ḏeffar. Walakin ṯamɣarṯ n Luṭ ṯeƹṣa Arebbi, ṯexzar ɣar ḏeffar ȓexddenni isemsex-it ṯeḏweȓ ḏ azru n ȓemȓeḥ. Xzar ḏi Lkitab n imezwura 19:15-26.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Wenni ixsen aḏ isenjem ṯuḏarṯ nnes ataf at ixsar. Wenni iy ɣa ixsaren ṯuḏarṯ nnes ataf at isenjem. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Ḏi ǧiȓeṯ nni aḏ iȓin ṯnayen ṭṭṣen ḏeg yijjen n ṯassuṯ, ijjen aḏ imeysi ijjen aḏ iqqim. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Aḏ iȓint ṯnayen n ṯemɣarin ḏi ṯsirṯ ḥerrint ṯiḥebba, icten aḏ tmeysi icten aḏ teqqim. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />{Aḏ iȓin ṯnayen n iryazen ḏeg yij umarjeƹ, ijjen aḏ imeysi ijjen aḏ iqqim."}<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Sseqsan-ṯ imeḥḍaren nnes nnan-as: "A Siḏi, mani ɣa iwqeƹ manaya?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Indeq-d netta inna-asen: "Mani ǧan imurḍas, ḏinni ig itmunen ibaɣeriwen."<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Ȓmiṯal n ṯajjaȓṯ iy irezzun ȓḥaqq nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Issiweȓ akiḏsen Ƹisa s yijjen n ȓmaƹna bac aḏ ssnen belli itxeṣṣa-yasen aḏ tẓaǧen ȓebda war tiḥȓen ca. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Inna-asen: "Ijjen n twaȓa ḏeg yijjen n ṯendint ijjen n ȓqaḍi war iteggweḏ ca Arebbi, war itweqqir ca iwḏan. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ḏinni ḏi ṯendint nni ijjen n ṯajjaȓṯ traḥ ɣares teqqar-as: Uc-ayi ȓḥaqq inu x wenni ḏayi iḍellmen! <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Aṭṭas zeg wami itagi aḏas yuc min ḏas tettar nettaṯ. Walakin menbaƹd i manaya inna ḏi nnefs nnes: Waxxa war teggwḏeɣ ca Arebbi, war tweqqireɣ ca iwḏan, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ṯajjaȓṯ-a ṣafi ṯsiḥeȓ-ayi. Aḏas uceɣ ȓḥaqq ḥima war d tƹiqib ṯwaȓa nneɣni aḏayi ṯseddeƹ."<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Inna-asen Siḏiṯneɣ: "Ṣennṭeṯ i min inna ȓqaḍi-ya iḍeǧmen. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Arebbi, ma war ḏasen iticc ȓḥaqq i yiwḏan nnes iy ṯ itettaren ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar? Ma axasen iƹeṭṭaȓ war ḏasen istijib ca? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Aḏasen yuc ȓḥaqq ḏeɣya. Innama, Mmis n bnaḏem nhar iy ḏi d ɣa yas, ma aḏ yaf lʼiman ḏi ṯmurṯ?"<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯẓaǧiṯ n ṣṣaḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Issiweȓ s ȓmaƹna-ya ak can yiwḏan tuɣa tarran ixef nsen nican, tḥeggaren inneɣni: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />"Ijjen n nhar ruḥen ijjen ṯnayen n iryazen ɣar ṯemzida ṯameqqrant n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḥima aḏ ẓẓaǧen, ijjen zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen, ijjen ijemmeƹ ḍḍariba. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Ibedd ufarrisi nni itẓaǧa ḏi nnefs nnes inna: Ya Arebbi tcekkareɣ-cek, minzi war ǧiɣ ca am yiwḏan nneɣni iǧan ḏ ixewwanen niɣ ḏ yinni war iǧin ca nican niɣ ḏ yinni izennan niɣ am wanita ig ijemmƹen ḍḍariba! <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Tẓummiɣ yumayen ḏi ssimana, tƹeccareɣ x marra min rebḥeɣ ḏ agȓa.<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Walakin wenni ijemmƹen ḍḍariba ibedd ɣar ȓeggwaj. War izƹim ḥetta aḏ iysi ṯiṭṭawin nnes ɣar ujenna, iccaṯ ḏeg wuȓ nnes inna: Ya Arebbi, rḥem-ayi nec ḏ lƹaṣi!<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Wenni ijemmƹen ḍḍariba iḏweȓ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes mliḥ imeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi, afarrisi nni lla. Minzi wenni isemɣaren ixef nnes, ataf aḏ yiȓi ḏ amezyan. Wenni isemzayen ixef nnes, ataf aḏ yiȓi ḏ ameqqran."<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itbarak iḥenjiren imezyanen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Tuɣa iwḏan tawin-as-d uȓa ḏ iseyman i Ƹisa ḥima aṯen iḥaḏa. Walakin imeḥḍaren nnes wami ẓrin manayenni tƹarraḍen-asen. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ikkar Ƹisa iȓaɣa-d x <char style="it">iḥenjiren</char> uca inna-asen <char style="it">i imeḥḍaren nnes</char>: "Jjem iḥenjiren imezyanen aɣari d asen. War ḏasen tƹarraḍem ca ȓaḥeqqac ȓmulk n Arebbi itiȓi ɣar yinni iy iǧan am yina. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Labud i bnaḏem aḏ yamen s ȓmulk n Arebbi mamc zzayes itamen uḥenjir amezyan. Meȓa lla, ataf bnaḏem nni ƹemmarṣ aḏ yaḏef ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aryaz iǧan ḏ ttajar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Isseqsa-ṯ ijjen zi lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil inna-as: "A Lmuƹallim aṣebḥan, min ɣa ggeɣ ḥima aɣari ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda?"<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yarra xas Ƹisa inna-as: "Mayemmi ṯeqqareḏ qa nec ḏ aṣebḥan? War iǧi ḥadd ḏ aṣebḥan illa Arebbi waḥḏes. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ṯessneḏ ȓuṣiyaṯ: War zenna, war neqq, war tacar, war cehheḏ bu ẓẓur, weqqar babac ḏ yemmac."<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Inna-as uryaz nni: "Zeg wami iy ǧiɣ nec ḏ amezyan tweqqareɣ qaƹ manaya."<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ƹisa wami isȓa i wawaȓ nnes inna-as: "Qa ṯeqqim-ac ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ war t ṯeggiḏ ca. Ruḥ zenz marra min ɣarek ḏ agȓa ṣeddeq-iṯ x ȓmusakin. Ssenni aɣarek yiȓi ȓkenz ḏeg ujenna, ȓexddenni araḥ-d cek ḏfar-ayi-d." <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Wami isȓa i manayenni ixeyyeq aṭṭas ȓaḥeqqac ɣares aṭṭas n wagȓa. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Ixzar ḏayes Ƹisa inna: "Mecḥaȓ iqseḥ xasen x twajar aḏ aḏfen ȓmulk n Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Aqa isheȓ aḏ iƹḏu uȓɣem zi ṯiṭṭ n ṯseynefṯ qbeȓ ma aḏ yaḏef ttajar ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi!"<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Nnan yinni itesȓan: "Xyar, ug izemmaren aḏ injem!?"<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Min war ḏas zemmaren ca yiwḏan, izemmar-as Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Inna-as Buṭrus: "Aqa neccin nesmeḥ ḏi kuȓci neḏfar-ic!"<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Marra wenni isemḥen ḏi ṯeddarṯ nnes niɣ ḏi ṯemɣarṯ nnes niɣ ḏi ayṯmas niɣ ḏi babas niɣ ḏi yemmas niɣ ḏi ṯarwa nnes ƹlaḥsab ȓmulk n Arebbi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ataf aɣares ṯiȓi ḏi ddunect-a ktar s waṭṭas. U ḏi zman iy d ɣa yasen ataf aɣares ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda."<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ƹaweḏ issawaȓ x ȓmewṯ nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Iruḥ Ƹisa yuwi ṯenƹac nni <char style="it">n imeḥḍaren nnes</char> waḥeḏsen inna-asen: "Aqa netgaƹƹaḏ ɣar Lquds mani iy ɣa ikemmeȓ marra min urin lʼanbiya x Mmis n bnaḏem. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Aṯ sellmen i yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, axas ḍeḥcen, aṯ seḥqaren, axas ssusfen. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Aṯ uwṯen s usɣun, aṯ nɣen. Nhar wis ṯeȓtiyyam aḏ d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ."<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Imeḥḍaren nni war fhimen walu zeg wawaȓen-a. Ȓmaƹna n wawaȓen-a inuffar xasen, war ssinen ca minxef issawaȓ.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ij uḍarɣaȓ ḏi ṯendint n Ariḥa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Wami iqarreb Ƹisa ɣar ṯendint n Ariḥa, ufin ḏinni ijjen n uḍarɣaȓ iqqim ṭṭarf n ubriḏ itettar. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Wami isȓa i ȓɣaci ƹeddun inna-asen min iweqƹen? <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Nnan-as qa Ƹisa Naṣiri netta iy ssa iƹeddun. <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ibḏa isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ iqqar-as: "A Ƹisa a Mmis n Ayṯ-Dawed, rḥem-ayi!" <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Yinni izwaren i Ƹisa nhan-ṯ nnan-as sqar. Netta yugi, iqqim isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ ƹaḏ s jjheḏ iqqar: "A Mmis n Ayṯ-Dawed, rḥem-ayi!" <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Ibedd Ƹisa yumar-iṯen ḥima aḏas ṯiḏ awin. Wami ɣares d iqarreb isseqsa-ṯ inna-as: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />"Min ṯexseḏ aḏac ggeɣ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Inna-as uḍarɣaȓ nni: "A Siḏi, qa nec xseɣ aḏ twaȓiɣ."<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-as: "Twaȓa, qa lʼiman nnec isgenfa-cek!" <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Ȓexddenni ibḏa itwaȓa, iḏfar Ƹisa isemɣar Arebbi. Wami ẓrin yiwḏan nni min iweqƹen, marra bḏan ḥemmḏen Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏi ṯeddarṯ n Zaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yuḏef Ƹisa ɣar ṯendint n Ariḥa iƹeddu-d ssenni. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Ḏinni ijjen n uryaz ḏ ttajar zeg imeqqranen n iƹeccaren qqaren-as Zaki. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Irezzu aḏ issen Ƹisa min iƹna walakin war izemmar aṯ iẓer ƹlaḥeqqac ḏinni aṭṭas n ȓɣaci u netta ḏ aquḍaḍ. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Yuzzeȓ ɣar zzaṯ igaƹƹeḏ x yijjen n ṯcejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ n isemɣan x ubriḏ nni manis d ɣa ikk Ƹisa ḥima aṯ iẓer. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Wami yuweḍ Ƹisa ɣar umcan nni, irfeƹ ṯiṭṭawin nnes iẓri-ṯ inna-as: "Hwa-d ḏeɣya ssenni a Zaki, itxeṣṣa-ayi nhara aḏ raḥeɣ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnec." <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Ihwa-d ḏeɣya ireḥḥeb zzayes s ȓefraḥeṯ.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Iwḏan marra ẓrin manaya bḏan tgemgumen nnan qa yuḏef Ƹisa aḏ iqqim ḏi ṯeddarṯ n yijjen n uryaz ḏ lƹaṣi!<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ibedd Zaki inna-as i Siḏiṯneɣ: "A Siḏi, aḏ uceɣ azyen n wagȓa inu i ȓmusakin. Meȓa cemṯeɣ can yijjen aḏas arniɣ arbeƹa n ṯseqqar."<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Inna-as Ƹisa i Zaki: "Nhara ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ-a nejmen minzi aryaz-a wanita uȓa ḏ netta zi ddurriṯ n Brahim. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Mmis n bnaḏem yusa-d ḥima aḏ irzu aḏ isenjem yinni iweddaren."<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n ṯraṯa n ixeddamen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Wami tesȓan i manaya, issiweȓ akiḏsen Ƹisa s yijjen n ȓmaƹna nneɣni ȓaḥeqqac tuɣaṯ yuḏes ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. Ƹaweḏ tɣir-asen ȓmulk n Arebbi aḏ d imeḍhar ȓexddenni. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Inna-asen: "Ijjen n ssiyyed lʼaṣel nnes zeg imeqqranen isafar <char style="it">zi ṯmurṯ nnes</char> ɣar yijjen n ṯmurṯ ṯiggwej ḥima aḏ iysi tesriḥ aḏ iḏweȓ aḏ iḥkem <char style="it">x ṯmurṯ nnes.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Iȓaɣa-d x ƹecra zeg ixeddamen nnes, kuȓ ijjen zzaysen yuca-as ƹecra n ȓuznaṯ n nnuqarṯ. Inna-asen: Ggem zzaysent ttijara aȓ d ɣa ḏewȓeɣ. <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Walakin ccaƹb nnes ƹiffen-ṯ seḏfaren-as ca n nnuyab aȓ mani ɣa iraḥ bac aḏ inin qa neccin war nexs ca aryaz-a aḏ yiȓi ḏ azeǧiḏ xaneɣ.<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Wami iḏweȓ ḏ azeǧiḏ iƹqeb-d, yumar ḥima aḏas d awin ixeddamen nni umi yuca tmenyaṯ nni ḥima aḏ ixzar mecḥaȓ irbeḥ mkuȓ ijjen zzaysen.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Yusa-d uxeddam amezwaru inna-as: A siḏi, ƹecra n ȓuznaṯ n nnuqarṯ nnec kuȓ icten ṯarni ƹecra nneɣni.<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Azeǧiḏ nni inna-as: Ṯeggiḏ mliḥ ay axeddam aṣebḥan! Cek ḏayek ȓaman x ḏrus, ȓexxu aḏac uceɣ aḏ tḥekmeḏ x ƹecra n ṯneddam.<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Yusa-d wenni wis ṯnayen inna-as: A siḏi, ƹecra nni n ȓuznaṯ n nnuqarṯ iy ḏayi ṯuciḏ kuȓ icten ṯarni xemsa nneɣni.<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Inna-as uzeǧiḏ: Aḏac uceɣ aḏ tḥekmeḏ x xemsa n ṯneddam.<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Yusa-d wenni wis ṯȓaṯa inna-as: A siḏi, aqac ƹecra nni n ȓuznaṯ n nnuqarṯ iy ḏayi ṯuciḏ. Tuɣa nec xemmȓeɣ-ṯent ḏeg yijjen n zzif <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />minzi ggwḏeɣ zzayek. Cek ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem ṯeqsḥeḏ, ṯkessiḏ min war ṯesrusiḏ ṯmejjareḏ min war ṯzerrƹeḏ.<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Indeq-d uzeǧiḏ nni inna-as: Cek min ṯenniḏ axak ḥekmeɣ zzayes ay axeddam amcum. Iwa ṯessneḏ belli nec ḏ ijjen n uryaz qesḥeɣ, kessiɣ min war srusiɣ, mejjareɣ min war zerrƹeɣ. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Mayemmi war ṯejjiḏ tmenyaṯ inu ɣar iṣarrafen ataf nec aḏ d aseɣ aḏ ysiɣ tmenyaṯ inu ḏ ȓefḍeȓ akiḏsent?<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Uca inna-asen i yinni iǧan ḏinni: Kksem-as ƹecra n ȓuznaṯ n nnuqarṯ i wanita, arnim-ṯent i wenni ɣar iǧa miyya n ȓuznaṯ n nnuqarṯ.<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nnan-as: Mayemmi zaƹma a siḏi? Aqa wenni ṣafi, ɣares miyya n ȓuznaṯ n nnuqarṯ!<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Wah, wenni iǧan ɣares itmarni-yas. Walakin wenni war ɣar iǧi ca, itwaksi-yas uȓa ḏ min ɣares. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Amma ȓƹaḏyan inu yinni tuɣa war ixsen ca axasen iȓiɣ ḏ azeǧiḏ, awim-ṯen-d ḏanita nɣem-ṯen zzaṯi."<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itaḏaf x usnus ɣar ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ƹisa wami inna awaȓ-a ikkar netta iggur bac aḏ igaƹƹeḏ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Wami ƹȓayen aḏ yaweḍ ɣar ibilajen umi qqaren Bayt Faji ḏ Bayt Ƹanya ɣar uḏrar umi qqaren Aḏrar n Zzitun, ikkar netta issekk ṯnayen zeg imeḥḍaren nnes <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />inna-asen: "Ruḥem ɣar ubilaj-in iy iǧan zzaṯwem. Xmi ɣa ṯawḍem ḏinni, aḏ tafem ijjen n usnus iqqen ƹemmarṣ war xas inyi ḥadd, fsim-as awim-ayi-ṯ-id. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Meȓa issiweȓ ɣarwem can yijjen inna-awem mayemmi ḏas ṯ fsim, inim-as qa iḥḏaj-iṯ Siḏiṯneɣ."<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ruḥen yinni itwasekken ɣar zzaṯ ufin mammec ḏasen inna Ƹisa. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Wami fessin i usnus nni nnan-asen ayṯbab nnes: "Min teggem? Mayemmi ṯfessim i usnus-a?"<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Arrin xasen nnan-asen: "Iḥḏaj-iṯ Siḏiṯneɣ." <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ȓexddenni uwin-ṯ-iḏ ɣar Ƹisa, ggin xas izeǧuba nsen senyen xas Ƹisa.<verse eid="LUK 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Netta wami tuɣa iggur, iwḏan tsun-as abriḏ s izeǧuba nsen. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Iqarreb ɣar ṯeksarṯ n ubriḏ zzaṯ i Uḏrar n Zzitun, bḏan aṭṭas n imeḥḍaren nnes farrḥen ḥemmḏen Arebbi s jjheḏ x marra lmuƹjizaṯ nni iy ẓrin. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Qqaren: "Ssaƹḏ n uzeǧiḏ iy d yusin ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏi Arebbi. Ȓehna ḏeg ujenna, lḥamdu i Arebbi yuƹȓan!"<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Ȓebƹaḍ zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen iǧan ḏi ȓɣaci nni nnan-as: "A Lmuƹallim, nha imeḥḍaren nnec."<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Inna-asen: "Aḏawem iniɣ: Meȓa sqaren niṯni, ataf izra aḏ snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ."<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Wami ƹȓayen aḏ yaweḍ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds, iẓri-t ibḏa itru xas. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Inna: "<char style="it">A ṯandint n Lquds,</char> cem maƹlik tuɣa ṯessneḏ nhara ṯimesȓayin iy d iticcen ȓehna! Walakin lla, ȓexxu nuffarent x ṯiṭṭawin nnem. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Aqa axam d asen nhuraṯ xmi xam d ɣa sennḍen ȓƹaḏyan nnem ijjen n ṣṣur, aḏam d nnḍen, acem seḥsaȓen zi mkuȓ jjiheṯ. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Acem sheḏmen cem ḏ ṯarwa nnem iy iǧan ɣar ḏaxeȓ nnem. War ḏayem tejjin bu uzru x unneɣni minzi ifqeḏ-icem Arebbi, cem war xas ṯeƹqireḏ."<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ssenni yuḏef ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Ayṯ-Israʼil ibḏa itazzeȓ x yinni iznuzan ḏinni. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Inna-asen: "Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Ṯaddarṯ inu aḏ tiȓi ḏ ṯaddarṯ n ṯẓaǧiṯ.&gt; Walakin kenniw ṯarrim-teṯ ḏ ifri n ixewwanen."<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Tuɣa iseȓmaḏ mkuȓ nhar ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant. Arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ḏ imeqqranen n ccaƹb rezzun aṯ nɣen. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />War ufin mammec ɣa ggen minzi marra ccaƹb tuɣa itesȓa-yas iqqim ḏeg wawaȓ nnes.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Ssulṭa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ijjen n nhar ḏeg wussan nni, Ƹisa aqaṯ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant iseȓmaḏ iwḏan itbeccar-iṯen, usin-d ɣares arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Kkaren nnan-as: "Ini-yaneɣ cek, manis ḏac d ṯekka ssulṭa nni iy zi teggeḏ ṯimesȓayin-a? Wi ḏac yucin ssulṭa nni?"<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3-4" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Uȓa ḏ nec akenniw sseqsiɣ x yijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ. Inim-ayi: Yaḥya, man ssulṭa iy zi iṭehhar s waman, ma zi Arebbi ma zeg yiwḏan?"<verse eid="LUK 20:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Mcawaren jarasen nnan: "<char style="it">Ssulṭa nni</char>, meȓa nenna-as qa ṯekka-d zi Arebbi, ataf aḏaneɣ yini Ƹisa mayemmi war zzayes ṯuminem ca? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Walakin meȓa nenna-as <char style="it">ssulṭa nni</char> qa ṯekka-d zeg yiwḏan, ataf marra iwḏan aḏaneɣ rejmen minzi umnen belli Yaḥya ḏ nnabi." <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Uca nnan-as i Ƹisa: "Neccin war nessin ca manis d ṯekka <char style="it">ssulṭa nni nnes</char>."<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Iwa uȓa ḏ nec war ḏawem qqareɣ ca manis ḏayi d ṯekka ssulṭa-ya iy zi teggeɣ ṯimesȓayin-a."<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n ixemmasen iy ḏi iǧa ccarr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ibḏa Ƹisa issawaȓ ak ccaƹb s ȓmaƹna-ya ṯanita inna-asen: "Ijjen n ssiyyed iẓẓu aḍiȓ ḏeg yijjen n umarjeƹ nnes, ijja ḏayes ixemmasen ṣafi iruḥ isafar aṭṭas n ȓweqṯ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Wami d yuweḍ ȓweqṯ n uȓqeḍ n uḍiȓ, ikkar issekk ijjen n uxeddam nnes ɣar ixemmasen nni bac aḏas d ucen ȓḥaqq nnes n umarjeƹ n uḍiȓ. Walakin min ggin ixemmasen nni? Uwṯin-ṯ, ssekken-ṯ-id ixwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Iruḥ issekk-asen ijjen n uxeddam nneɣni, walakin uȓa ḏ wenni uwṯin-ṯ ƹedden xas ssekken-ṯ-id ixwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Issekk-asen ḥetta ḏ ij uxeddam wis ṯȓaṯa, uȓa ḏ wenni jarḥen-ṯ uzzȓen xas.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Ssenni bab n umarjeƹ n uḍiȓ inna, min ɣa ggeɣ? Ṣafi, nec aḏasen ssekkeɣ memmi iƹizzen imken aṯ ggwḏen. <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ixemmasen nni min ggin? Wami ufin mmis yusa-d, kkaren nnan i wayawya: Aqa wenni iy ɣa iwarṯen! Aṯ nneɣ bac aḏas nawi amarjeƹ-a n uḍiȓ! <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Nḍaren-ṯ-iḏ ɣar barra i umarjeƹ uḍiȓ nɣin-ṯ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Iwa, min ḏasen ɣa igg bab n umarjeƹ nni uḍiȓ i ixemmasen nni? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Aḏ d yas netta s yixef nnes aḏ ineɣ ixemmasen nni marra, aḏ ijj amarjeƹ nni uḍiȓ i inneɣni."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Wami sȓin i manaya nnan: "Arebbi istar!"<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ixzar ɣarsen inna: "Min ixes aḏ yini wawaȓ-a iy yurin ḏi Lkitab?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;Azru iy ƹiffen ibennayen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">iwqeƹ ḏeg umcan aṣebḥan ḏi ṯɣemmarṯ n dsas.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Wenni ɣa iwḍan x uzru-ya aḏ irez.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:18">Wenni xef ɣa iwḍa uzru-ya aḏ ineȓbeẓ."<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Ȓexddenni imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ḏ arruyas n ȓfuqaha rezzun aḏ ṭṭfen Ƹisa, fehmen belli issawaȓ xasen s ȓmaƹna-ya walakin ggwḏen zi ccaƹb.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ḍḍariba n lmalik Qayṣar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Bḏan imseȓmaḏen nni n ccariƹa ḏ arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḥeṭṭan Ƹisa, rezzun aṯ ṭṭfen x can wawaȓen nnes ḥima aṯ sellmen i lḥakem ḏ ssulṭa nnes. Ruḥen ssekken-as i Ƹisa can yiwḏan sneƹmiȓen aqaṯen nican walakin niṯni ḏ ibergagen. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Sseqsan-ṯ nnan-as: "A Lmuƹallim, nessen belli cek ṯeqqareḏ ȓḥaqq ṯseȓmaḏeḏ s ȓḥaqq. War teggeḏ bu uḏemawen, ṯseȓmaḏeḏ s ȓḥaqq mammec ixes Arebbi a nƹic. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Ini-yaneɣ, ma ṯsemmeḥ ccariƹa nneɣ a nxeǧes ḍḍariba i uzeǧiḏ Qayṣar niɣ lla?"<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Issen Ƹisa ixarwiḍen nni iy ḏaysen, inna-asen: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />"Awim-ayi-d dinar nni <char style="it">n ḍḍariba</char> ḥima aṯ ẓreɣ." Inna-asen: "Wi yiȓan teṣwirṯ-a ḏ yisem-a iy ḏayes?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Nnan-as: "N Qayṣar."<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Min iǧan n Qayṣar ucem-as-ṯ i Qayṣar, min iǧan n Arebbi ucem-as-ṯ i Arebbi." <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Niṯni war zemmaren ca aḏ cemṯen <char style="it">Ƹisa </char> zi can wawaȓ nnes zzaṯ i ccaƹb. Qqimen tƹejjben ḏeg ujawab nnes, war ufin ca min ɣa inin.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itbeccar x ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Kkaren can yiwḏan zi ȓḥizeb n iṣadduqiyen qarrben-d ɣar Ƹisa. (Qqaren niṯni belli iwḏan war d tekkaren ca zi ȓmewṯ.) Sseqsan Ƹisa nnan-as: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />"A Lmuƹallim, qa yura-aneɣ Musa aryaz meȓa immuṯ ijja ṯamɣarṯ nnes war kiḏes d ijji bu ṯarwa, ṯajjaȓṯ nni labud at yawi uȓwes nnes bac akiḏes d ijj ṯarwa i wumas nni immuṯen. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Neccin tuɣa akiḏneɣ sebƹa n wawmaṯen, imȓec umezwaru immuṯ war d ijji bu ṯarwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30-31" />Ṯamɣarṯ nni yuwi-t wis ṯnayen immuṯ war d ijji bu ṯarwa. Amenni ƹaweḏ wis ṯȓaṯa aȓ wis sebƹa. <verse eid="LUK 20:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Aȓ uneggaru uȓa ḏ ṯamɣarṯ nni ṯemmuṯ. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Yum Lqiyama, umi ɣa ṯiȓi ṯemɣarṯ nni? Aqa uwin-t s sebƹa iḏsen."<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yarra xasen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Wah, ṯarwa n ddunect-a meǧcen twasmeǧacen. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Walakin inneɣni iḥesseb-iṯen Arebbi aɣarsen ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda, xmi d ɣa kkaren zi ȓmewṯ ataf niṯni war meǧcen ca war twasmeǧicen ca. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />War zemmaren ca aḏ mmṯen, aḏ iȓin amecnaw lmalaʼikaṯ. Niṯni ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi, xeȓqen-d ḏi Yum Lqiyama.<verse eid="LUK 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Walakin cuf, yinni immuṯen aḏ d kkaren zi ȓmewṯ. Uȓa ḏ Musa isbeyyan-d manaya ḏi ȓqiṣṣa n uxcab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maci maƹruf min iƹna uxcab-a, walakin imken ḏ can arbiƹ am ṯabɣa niɣ am can ṯcejjarṯ ṯamezyant ḏayes isennanen.</char></note> wami inna qa Siḏi Arebbi ḏ Arebbi n Brahim ḏ Arebbi n Isḥaq ḏ Arebbi n Yaƹqub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siḏna Musa tuɣa irass ȓebhayem n uḏeggwaȓ nnes qqaren-as Yaṯrun ḏ ȓefqi n Midyan. Ijjen n nhar indeh ȓebhayem ɣar ṣṣaḥra ḥetta aȓ mani yuweḍ ɣar uḏrar n Arebbi umi qqaren Ḥurib. Ḏinni iy ḏas d ṯmeḍhar lmalaʼika n Siḏi Arebbi ḏeg uceƹƹar n ṯmessi zi ȓwesṭ n yijjen n uxcab. Iẓra Musa axcab nni iḥarreq bȓa ma ṯ tecc ṯmessi. Inna ḏi nnefs nnes: "Aḏ raḥeɣ ḥima aḏ xzareɣ ṯamesȓayṯ-a ig iseḏhacen. Mayemmi axcab-a war iḥarreq ca?" Wami iruḥ ḏinni aḏ ixzar, iẓri-ṯ Siḏi Arebbi ibarreḥ-as-d zi ȓwesṭ n uxcab inna-as: "A Musa a Musa." Inna-as Musa: "Ha aqayi." Inna-as Arebbi: "War tqarreb ca ḏanita. Kkes ṯisiȓa zeg iḍaren nnec ȓaḥeqqac amcan-a iy xef ṯbeddeḏ netta ḏ ijjen n ṯmurṯ muqeddsa." Uca inna-as: "Nec ḏ Arebbi n ȓejḏuḏ nnec ḏ Arebbi n Brahim ḏ Arebbi n Isḥaq ḏ Arebbi n Yaƹqub." Ȓexddenni iseḏḥa Musa isaḏar aɣembub nnes iggweḏ aḏ iẓer Arebbi.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Netta ḏ Arebbi n yinni iddaren maci n yinni immuṯen, ȓaḥeqqac netta marra iwḏan aɣares iȓin ddaren."<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Nnan-as can imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa: "A Siḏi, ṯenniḏ mliḥ!" <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />U ssenni war izƹim ḥadd aṯ isseqsa ƹaḏ ktar.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmasiḥ netta ḏ Siḏes n Dawed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Mayemmi qqaren qa Lmasiḥ ḏ mmis n Dawed? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Qa Dawed inna netta s yixef nnes ḏi Lkitab n Zzabur:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;Siḏi Arebbi inna-as i Siḏi: Qqim-d x ufusi inu,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />aȓ d ɣa ggeɣ ȓƹaḏyan nnec swadday i iḍaren nnec.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Mammec ɣa yiȓi Lmasiḥ ḏ mmis n Dawed? Netta Dawed iqqar-as i Lmasiḥ A Siḏi."<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmunafiqin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes u marra ccaƹb itesȓa-yas: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />"Ḥḍam ixef nwem zeg imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa. Niṯni texsen aḏ uyuren s iseȓhamen nni nsen, texsen axasen seǧmen ḏi ȓeswaq, texsen aḏ qqimen ḏeg imucan imezwura ḏi ṯemziḏawin ḏ ȓefruḥ. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Tetten ṯajjaȓin, smeḍharen-d ixef nsen tẓaǧan aṭṭas ḥima aḏ beyynen i yiwḏan belli niṯni ṣebḥen aṭṭas zaƹma. Yina, lḥisab nsen aḏ yiȓi iqṣeḥ aṭṭas!"<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Ṣṣaḏaqa ṯameqqrant n yijjen n ṯajjaȓṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Ixzar Ƹisa itwaȓa twajar mammec teggen ṣṣaḏaqa nsen ḏi ṣṣenduq <char style="it">n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant</char>. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Iẓra ƹaweḏ ijjen n ṯajjaȓṯ ḏ ȓmeskina waha ṯegga ḏinni ṯnayen iṣuldan. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Inna: "Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Ṯajjaȓṯ-a ḏ ȓmeskina waha ṯegga ḏi ṣṣenduq ktar zi min ggin marra inneɣni. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Minzi marra inneɣni ucin zi min xasen izayḏen ḏ agȓa. Nettaṯ lla, waxxa ḏ ȓmeskina waha ṯṣeddeq marra min ṯeƹȓem."<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹalamaṯ n ȓefna n ddunect</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Can yiwḏan ssawaȓen x ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant qqaren mecḥaȓ ṯeṣbaḥ, ṯzewweq s uzru aṣebḥan u s ṣṣeḏqeṯ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:5">Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />"Ṯimesȓayin-a iy twaȓam qa aḏ d yas ijjen n nhar war ḏa itɣimi uȓa ḏ ijjen n uzru x unneɣni, marra manaya aḏ inehḏem."<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Sseqsan-ṯ nnan-as: "A Lmuƹallim, meȓmi ɣa iwqeƹ manaya? Min ṯeƹna lƹalama nni xmi ƹȓayen ɣa weqƹent ṯmesȓayin-a?"<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Inna-asen: "Ḥḍam ixef nwem ḥima war kenniw ixeddeƹ ḥadd. Aṭṭas iy d ɣa yasen s yisem inu zaƹma aḏ inin qa nec ḏ Lmasiḥ! Ƹaweḏ aḏawem inin qa ȓweqṯ ṯuweḍ-d! Walakin kenniw itxeṣṣa war ṯen teḏfirem ca. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Xmi ɣa ṯesȓam x lḥuȓub ḏ lfitnaṯ war teggwḏem ca minzi ṯimesȓayin nni labud aḏ weqƹent ḏ amezwaru. Walakin ddunect-a ƹaḏ war ṯfenni ca."<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Inna-asen: "Dduwla aḏ tehjem x dduwla, lmemlaka aḏ tehjem x lmemlaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Aḏ iwqeƹ zzinzal imɣar ḏeg waṭṭas n imucan. Aḏ yiȓi jjuƹ ḏ ȓehȓacaṯ ḏ waṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin isaggwaḏen, ḏ lƹalamaṯ ḏ ṯimeqqranin ḏeg ujenna.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Qbeȓ i marra manaya akenniw ṭṭfen, akenniw ƹeddben, akenniw sellmen i ṯemziḏawin nsen. Akenniw ḥebsen, akenniw jarren ɣar izeǧiḏen ḏ lḥukkam ƹlaḥsab isem inu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Manaya aɣarwem yiȓi ḏ ijjen n lfurṣa i chaḏeṯ. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Bȓa ma aḏ teysim amnus ḏ amezwaru ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem minzi ɣa ṯdafƹem x yixef nwem. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Lla, aḏawem uceɣ awaȓen ḏ ȓefhameṯ ḥima marra yinni kiḏwem itmenɣan war zemmaren ca axawem d arren. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Akenniw zzenzen lwalidin nwem ḏ ayṯmaṯwem ḏ ȓeḥbab nwem ḏ imeddukaȓ nwem, aḏ nɣen ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Akenniw ƹiffen marra iwḏan ƹlaḥsab isem inu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Waxxa amenni war iweṭṭi uȓa ḏ ij uzuṭṭu zeg uzeǧif nwem. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />S ṣṣbar nwem ataf aḏ tnejmem.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹalamaṯ n uhḏam n ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Meȓa ṯeẓrim ṯandint n Lquds nnḍen-as-d ȓƹaskar, aqa aḏ tessnem belli ƹȓayen aḏ tnehḏem. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ȓexddenni yinni iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya itxeṣṣa aḏ arewȓen ɣar iḏurar; ḏ yinni iǧan ḏi Lquds itxeṣṣa aḏ arewȓen ɣar barra; ḏ yinni iǧan ḏeg imarjeƹiwen itxeṣṣa war tiḏfen ca ɣar Lquds. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Aqa ȓiyyam nni ḏ ȓiyyam n uƹmuḏ, aḏaysen ikemmeȓ marra min yurin ḏi Lkutub n lʼanbiya. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Ya tamara x ṯemɣarin nni iy ɣa yiȓin s iƹeddisen ḏeg wussan nni ḏ ṯinni issuṭuḍen! Minzi ḏi ṯmurṯ-a aḏ iwqeƹ ijjen n uƹeddeb ḏ ameqqran ḏ uɣḍab x ccaƹb-a. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Aṯen nɣen s ȓesyuf, aṯen awin ḏ imeḥbas ɣar marra ȓegnus. Ssenni yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ heḏmen Lquds aȓ ɣa fnant lʼawqat nsen.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Aḏ d meḍharent lƹalamaṯ ḏ ṯimeqqranin ḏi ṯfuct ḏ ṯziri ḏ yiṯran. Ḏi ṯmurṯ, ȓegnus aḏ yiȓi ḏaysen amnus minzi war fhimen ca i ssdaƹ n ȓmujaṯ n ȓebḥar. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Aḏ sexfen yiwḏan s ṯiggwḏi ḏ umnus x min itewqiƹen ḏi ddunect minzi marra yinni ijehḏen ḏeg ujenna aṯen isenhezz Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Ȓexddenni iy ɣa ẓren Mmis n bnaḏem ihewwa-d ḏeg useynu s lƹaḍama ḏ jjheḏ nnes imɣaren. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Xmi ɣa ibḏa aḏ iwqeƹ manaya, beddeṯ sgaƹƹḏeṯ azeǧif nwem minzi ƹȓayen aḏ tnejmem."<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n ṯcejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Issiweȓ akiḏsen Ƹisa s yijjen n ȓmaƹna inna-asen: "Xzareṯ ɣar ṯcejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ ḏ marra ȓcejjur. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ɣir ȓefruƹ nnes aḏ ḥebbben aḏ ggen ṯifray ataf aḏ tessnem yallah anebḏu iqarreb-d. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Amenni uȓa ḏ kenniw, xmi ɣa ṯeẓrem ṯimesȓayin-a itewqiƹen ataf aḏ tessnem illa ȓmulk n Arebbi yuḏes-d. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Yiwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a war tmettin ca aȓ ɣa iwqeƹ marra manaya. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Aḏ ifna ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ, walakin awaȓen inu war fennin ca ƹemmarṣ.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Ma ṯexsem aḏ teccem uȓ nwem? Ḥḍaṯ ixef nwem zi lmaddla n ssekra ḏ waṭṭas n ccreb ḏ ȓehmum n ddunect-a. Qa aḏ d yas Nhar nni aneggaru ƹlaɣafla am yijjen n ṯexcefṯ. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Nhar nni aḏ iṭṭef marra yinni iǧan x ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Ḥḍaṯ, ẓaǧem ḏi mkuȓ ȓweqṯ ḥima ataf ṯzemmarem aḏ tnejmem zi marra min ɣa iweqƹen aḏ tbeddem zzaṯ i Mmis n bnaḏem."<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kuȓ nhar Ƹisa itraḥ iseȓmaḏ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant. S ǧiȓeṯ itraḥ isnusa ḏeg Uḏrar n Zzitun. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Marra iwḏan traḥen ɣares zic ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ḥima aḏ ṣennṭen i wawaȓ nnes.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Yahuḏa itafeq aḏ izzenz Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Iqarreb-d Ȓƹid n Ṯefḍirṯ umi qqaren Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa rezzun mammec ḏas ɣa ggen ḥima aḏ nɣen Ƹisa walakin ggwḏen zi ccaƹb.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Yuḏef Cciṭan ḏeg wuȓ n Yahuḏa wenni umi qqaren Isxaryuṭi, netta zi ṯenƹac nni n arrusul. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ikkar iruḥ aḏ itafeq ak arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imeqqranen n iƹessasen n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Ayṯ-Israʼil x mamc ɣa igg aḏasen izzenz Ƹisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Farḥen, weƹḏen-ṯ aḏas ucen tmenyaṯ. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ssenni iwafeq netta, irezzu lfurṣa mammec iy ɣa igg aḏ izzenz Ƹisa bȓa ma akiḏes yiȓi ccaƹb.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ imeḥḍaren nnes tetten amensi n Ȓƹiḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Yuweḍ-d nhar n Ȓƹiḏ n Ṯefḍirṯ nhar nni iy ḏi ɣarrṣen i ȓƹiḏ. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Iruḥ Ƹisa issekk Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna inna-asen: "Ruḥem swejḏem-aneɣ amensi n Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran ḥima aṯ necc."<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Nnan-as: "Mani ṯexseḏ a nraḥ aṯ nsewjeḏ?"<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Inna-asen: "Xmi ɣa ṯaḏfem ɣar ṯendint, akiḏwem imeȓqa ijjen n uryaz iysi-d aqnuc n waman, ḏfarem-ṯ ɣar ṯeddarṯ mani ɣa yaḏef. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Inim-as i bab n ṯeddarṯ nni: Qa inna-ac lmuƹallim, mani iǧa uxxam n inewjiwen iy ḏi ɣa ƹeyyḏeɣ nec ḏ imeḥḍaren inu? <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Akenniw yawi ɣar yijjen n ṯɣurfat ḏ ṯameqqrant ṯessu, ṯeƹḏeȓ. Ḏinni iy ḏaneɣ ɣa ṯeswejḏem."<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ruḥen ufin nican mamc ḏasen inna. Ṣafi swejḏen amensi n Ȓƹiḏ.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Wami d tuweḍ ȓweqṯ yusa-d Ƹisa iqqim ɣar missa aḏ icc ak arrusul nnes. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Inna-asen: "Mecḥaȓ nec tuɣa trajiɣ akiḏwem munsweɣ ḏi Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran-a qbeȓ iy ɣa twaƹeddbeɣ. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Aqa qqareɣ-awem: Zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent war zzayes tetteɣ ca aȓ ɣa iwqeƹ ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi." <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Iysi-d Ƹisa ȓkas icekkar Arebbi inna-asen: "Ysim ȓkas-a, ferqem-ṯ jarawem. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Aqa qqareɣ-awem: Zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent war sesseɣ ca zeg waman-a n uḍiȓ aȓ d ɣa yas ȓmulk n Arebbi."<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Iysi aɣrum icekkar Arebbi irzi-ṯ yuca-asen-ṯ inna-asen: "Ḏ wa ig iǧan ḏ ddat inu iy ɣa immucen ƹlaḥsab kenniw. Teggeṯ manaya ḥima aḏayi ṯfekkarem."<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ammu ƹaweḏ menbaƹd i umensi iysi-d ȓkas inna-asen: "Ȓkas-a ḏ ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ iy kiḏwem teggeɣ s iḏammen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note> inu aḏ azzȓen ƹlaḥsab kenniw." <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Inna-asen: "Walakin wenni irezzun aḏayi izzenz fus nnes aqaṯ akiḏi x missa. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mmis n bnaḏem aḏas iwqeƹ ƹlaḥsab mamc xas iqqar Lkitab, walakin ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ n bnaḏem nni iy ṯ ɣa izzenzen." <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Bḏan imeḥḍaren ssawaȓen jarasen qqaren, Manwen zzayneɣ iy ɣa iggen manaya?<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ug iǧan ḏ ameqqran?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Tmenɣan ƹaweḏ ak wayawya ƹlaḥsab wenni iḥessben zzaysen ḏ ameqqran. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Izeǧiḏen n ȓegnus ḥekkmen x ccuƹub nsen. Lḥukkam nsen qqaren-asen ssadat. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Walakin manayenni itxeṣṣa war itiȓi ca jarawem; Lla, wenni iǧan ḏ ameqqran jarawem itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ yiȓi am umezyan nwem ḏ wenni iḥekkmen itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ yiȓi am wenni itsexxaren. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ug iǧan ḏ ameqqran? Ma ḏ wenni iqqimen aḏ icc niɣ ḏ wenni iy xas itsexxaren? Yac ḏ wenni iqqimen aḏ icc niɣ lla? Walakin nec aqayi akiḏwem am wenni iy xawem itsexxaren.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Ḏ kenniw iy kiḏi iṣbaren ḏi ȓemḥayen inu. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Mamc ḏayi yuca Baba ijjen n ȓmulk i nec, uȓa ḏ nec aḏawem uceɣ ijjen n ȓmulk. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Iƹni ḏi ȓmulk inu aḏ teqqimem akiḏi ɣar missa aḏ teccem aḏ teswem. Aḏ teqqimem x ȓƹarcaṯ ḥima aḏ tḥekmem x ṯenƹac n ṯqebbaȓ n Ayṯ-Israʼil."<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issawaȓ x unkar n Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Xzar a Simƹan: Cciṭan irezzu akenniw iɣarbeȓ am mammec tɣarbaȓen irḏan. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Tettareɣ akiḏec ɣar Siḏi Arebbi ḥima lʼiman nnec war ineqqeṣ ca. Xmi ɣari d ɣa ṯḏewȓeḏ, cejjeƹ ayṯmac."<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Inna-as Buṭrus: "A Siḏi, aqayi akiḏec wejḏeɣ meȓa ṯuḏfeḏ ȓeḥbes akiḏec aḏfeɣ, meȓa ṯemmuṯeḏ akidec mmṯeɣ."<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yarra xas Ƹisa inna-as: "Aḏac iniɣ a Buṭrus: Qbeȓ ma aḏ idden uyaziḍ nhara ataf aḏayi ṯenkareḏ ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin war ḏayi ṯessineḏ ca."<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ȓexddenni inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Wami kenniw ssekkeɣ bȓa ṯazeƹbuȓṯ, bȓa aqrab, bȓa ṯisiȓa, ma ixeṣṣi-kenniw ca?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Nnan-as: "Lla."<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Inna-asen: "Ȓexxu wenni ɣar ṯeǧa can ṯzeƹbuȓṯ niɣ can uqrab aṯ iysi. Wenni war ɣar iǧi ca ssif, aḏ izzenz arruḍ nnes aṯ iseɣ. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Aḏawem iniɣ: U labud aḏayi iwqeƹ min yurin ḏi Lkitab ƹlaḥsab mamc iqqar: &lt;Ḥesben-ṯ ak lmujrimin.&gt; Iwa min xafi yurin ṣafi aḏ iwqeƹ."<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Nnan-as: "Aqa ɣarneɣ ṯnayen n ȓesyuf a Siḏi."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Inna-asen: "Wah, ṣafi."<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itẓaǧa ḏeg Uḏrar n Zzitun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Iffeɣ Ƹisa am ȓebda iruḥ ɣar Uḏrar n Zzitun, ḏfaren-ṯ ƹaweḏ imeḥḍaren nnes. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Wami yuweḍ ɣar umcan nni inna-asen: "Ẓẓaǧem ḥima war tiḏfem ca ḏi ȓemḥayen." <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ibeƹƹeḏ xasen cwayt, isejjeḏ ɣar ṯmurṯ ibḏa itettar i Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Inna: "A Baba, meȓa ṯexseḏ sbeƹƹeḏ-iṯ xafi ȓkas-a n ȓaƹḏab. Maci mamc xseɣ nec; Lla, mamc ixes ȓxaḍar nnec cek." <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ȓexddenni ṯbedd-d ɣares ijjen n lmalaʼika zeg ujenna ḥima aḏas ṯuc jjheḏ. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ixeyyeq wuȓ nnes yarni itẓaǧa ktar ƹaḏ, ṯiḏi nnes ṯehwa-d zzayes ɣar ṯmurṯ ṯegga am ṯneqqiḍin n iḏammen nican. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Wami ikemmeȓ ṯẓaǧiṯ nnes, iḏweȓ ɣar imeḥḍaren nnes yufi-ṯen ṭṭṣen s lḥuzen. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Inna-asen: "Mayemmi teṭṭṣem? Kkarem, ẓẓaǧem ḥima war tiḏfem ca ḏi ȓemḥayen."<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ irumaniyen teṭṭfen Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yallah Ƹisa issawaȓ yuweḍ-d Yahuḏa, ijjen zi ṯenƹac n arrusul nnes. Yuwi-d akiḏes ȓɣaci aṭṭas, iqarreb ɣares ḥima axas iseǧem x uɣembub nnes. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ma s sȓam-a iy zi ɣa ṯezzenzeḏ Mmis n bnaḏem a Yahuḏa?"<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Wami ẓrin imeḥḍaren manaya nnan-as: "A Siḏi, ma a nuweṯ s ssif?" <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ijjen zeg yinni ḏinni iǧan yuwṯa ismeɣ n arrayes n ȓfuqaha iqess-as amezzuɣ afusi. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ṣafi, beddeṯ!" Iḥaḏa amezzuɣ n uryaz nni isgenfa-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imeqqranen n iƹessasen n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil iy ɣares d yusin: "Ma tɣir-awem qa nec ḏ lmujrim wami d ṯeysim ȓesyuf ḏ idebbuzen ḥima aḏayi ṯeṭṭfem niɣ? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Tuɣa tɣimiɣ akiḏwem mkuȓ nhar ḏi ṯemzida ṯameqqrant war ḏayi ṯeṭṭifem ca. Walakin ȓexxu ḏ ṯsaƹƹat nwem ḏ jjheḏ n ṯaǧest."<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buṭrus inekkar Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ṭṭfen Ƹisa, uwin-ṯ ɣar ṯeddarṯ n arrayes n ȓfuqaha siḏfen-ṯ. Iḏfar-iṯ Buṭrus zi ȓeggwaj. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ceƹƹȓen ṯimessi ḏi ȓwesṭ n ȓemraḥ n ṯeddarṯ. Qqimen ḏinni, iqqim akiḏsen Buṭrus. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ṯeẓri-ṯ ijjen n ṯxeddant iqqim zzaṯ i ṯmessi, ṯexzar ḏayes mliḥ ṯenna-asen: "Bnaḏem-a wanita tuɣa iǧa akiḏes."<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Inkar Buṭrus inna-as: "A ṯamɣarṯ, war ṯ ssineɣ ca."<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Menbaƹd cwayt iẓri-ṯ ijjen nneɣni inna-as: "Cek ḏ ijjen zzaysen?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Inna-as Buṭrus: "A bnaḏem, nec lla!"<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Wami ṯeƹḏu can ṯsaƹƹat inna-as ijjen nneɣni u netta mʼakked: "Ḏ ṣṣaḥ, aṯarras-a wanita tuɣa iǧa akiḏes minzi uȓa ḏ netta zi Ljalil."<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Inna-as Buṭrus: "A bnaḏem, nec war ssineɣ ca minxef ṯessawaȓeḏ cek!" Netta wami tuɣaṯ ƹaḏ issawaȓ, ȓexddenni idden uyaziḍ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Ineqȓeb-d Siḏiṯneɣ ixzar ɣar Buṭrus, Buṭrus ifekkar-d awaȓ nni iy ḏas inna Siḏiṯneɣ: Qbeȓ ma aḏ idden uyaziḍ ataf aḏayi ṯenkareḏ ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Iffeɣ ɣar barra iru imeṭṭawen ḏ imeǧaḥen aṭṭas.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Bḏan yinni iḥeṭṭan Ƹisa ḍeḥḥcen xas ccaṯen-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Ȓeḥḥfen-as x uɣembub nnes qqaren-as: "Iwa a nnabi siweȓ, ssen uw c yuwṯin zzayneɣ!" <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Arnin x wawaȓen nni, qqaren-as ṯimesȓayin nneɣni war iḥȓin ca.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zzaṯ i Jmaƹṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Wami iṣbeḥ ȓḥaȓ munen imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa, uwin Ƹisa ɣar Jmaƹṯ n lḥukkam nsen. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Nnan-as: "Meȓa cek ḏ Lmasiḥ ini-yaneɣ-t!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Inna-asen: "Meȓa nniɣ-awem-t, kenniw ataf war ḏayi timnem ca. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Meȓa sseqsiɣ-kenniw, ataf war ḏayi tjiwibem ca. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Walakin zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent aḏ iqqim Mmis n bnaḏem x ufusi n Lqawi."<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Nnan-as marra iḏsen: "Iwa cek ḏ Mmis n Arebbi baƹda?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Inna-asen: "Aqa ṯennam-ṯ kenniw ḏ nec."<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ȓexddenni nnan: "Ma ƹaḏ a neḥḏaj ca n ȓechuḏ? Neccin marra iḏneɣ nesȓa-yas min inna netta s uqemmum nnes."<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Tawin Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ɣar lḥakem Bilaṭus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kkaren marra iḏsen uwin Ƹisa aṯ sellmen i lḥakem Bilaṭus. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Bḏan ttahmen-ṯ nnan: "Nufi-ṯ itegg lbelbala ḏi ccaƹb. Iqqar-asen war ticceṯ bu ḍḍariba i uzeǧiḏ Qayṣar. Netta iḥesseb ixef nnes ḏ Lmasiḥ iƹni ḏ ijjen n uzeǧiḏ."<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Isseqsa-ṯ Bilaṭus inna-as: "Ma ḏ cek ḏ azeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Inna-as Ƹisa: "Aqa ṯenniḏ-t cek."<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Inna-asen Bilaṭus i arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ ȓɣaci nni: "War xas tifeɣ bu can ttuhmeṯ x uṯarras-a."<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Walakin niṯni zeyyaren xas aṭṭas nnan-as: "Itegg ȓfitna ḏi marra ṯamurṯ n Yahuḏiya s useȓmeḏ nnes. Ibḏa ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil, ȓexxu aqaṯ ḏa."<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Wami isȓa Bilaṭus belli nnan Ljalil, inna-asen: "Ma aryaz-a zi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil?" <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Wami issen belli Ƹisa zi ṯmurṯ nni mani iteḥkam Hirudus, ikkar issekk-iṯ ɣar Hirudus iǧan netta s yixef nnes ḏi ṯendint n Lquds ḏi ȓweqṯ nni.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawin Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ɣar uzeǧiḏ Hirudus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Wami iẓra Hirudus Ƹisa ifareḥ aṭṭas. Tuɣa ixes aṯ iẓer aṭṭas zeg wami. Wami xas isȓa itmenna aḏ igg Ƹisa can lmuƹjiza zzaṯes. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Isseqsa-ṯ aṭṭas walakin Ƹisa war xas d yarri ca qaƹ.<verse eid="LUK 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa bedden ḏinni tahamen-ṯ aṭṭas.<verse eid="LUK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Iḥeggar-iṯ Hirudus ḏ ȓƹaskar nnes ḍeḥḥcen xas. Igga xas aseȓham ḏ aṣebḥan, yarr-iṯ ɣar Bilaṭus. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Qbeȓ, Bilaṭus ḏ Hirudus tuɣa ḏin lƹadawa jarasen walakin ȓexxu ḏewȓen ḏ imeddukaȓ ḏi nhar nni.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lḥakem Bilaṭus irezzu aḏas d iḍȓeq i Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Iȓaɣa-d Bilaṭus x arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ marra ccaƹb. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Inna-asen: "Kenniw ṯuwim-ayi-d bnaḏem-a ṯennim-ayi qa itegg ȓfitna jar yiwḏan. Nec xemmmeɣ ḏi ṯmesȓayṯ-a zzaṯwem. War ḏayes ufiɣ ḏeg uṯarras-a bu can ttuhmeṯ ƹlaḥsab min ṯeqqarem kenniw. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Uȓa ḏ Hirudus war ḏayes yufi walu minzi yarra-aneɣ-ṯ-id. Xzareṯ, Ƹisa-ya war iggi min xef isḏaheǧ ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16-17" />Aḏas uceɣ aƹmuḏ aḏas d ḍeȓqeɣ."<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.16-17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tuɣa Bilaṭus iƹaffu ḏi mkuȓ Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran x yijjen n umeḥbus aḏ iffeɣ.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ marra ccaƹb nnan-as: "Ysi xaneɣ wanita, ḍȓeq-aneɣ-d i Barabas." <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Barabas-a tuɣa ggin-ṯ ḏi ȓeḥbes ƹlaḥsab ijjen n ȓfawḍa ṯewqeƹ ḏi ṯendint, ƹaweḏ ƹlaḥsab ijjen n ljarima n ȓmewṯ.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Bilaṭus ixes aḏ d iḍȓeq i Ƹisa, issiweȓ ak ccaƹb ṯwaȓa nneɣni. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Niṯni snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ nnan-as: "Ṣelleb-iṯ! Ṣelleb-iṯ!"<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Issiweȓ akiḏsen wis ṯeȓt-marraṯ inna-asen: "Mayemmi? Man ljarima ig igga wanita? Nec war ḏayes ufiɣ bu can ttuhmeṯ iy xef ɣa isḏaheǧ ȓmewṯ. Nec aḏas uceɣ aƹmuḏ aḏas d ḍeȓqeɣ." <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Niṯni snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ ḥima aṯ iṣelleb, ṣafi ṯɣuyyeṯ nsen ṯeqȓeb-as array. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ikkar Bilaṭus iḥkem s min xsen niṯni. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Iḍȓeq-d i wenni iǧan ḏi ȓeḥbes x ssabab n ȓfawḍa ḏ ljarima n ȓmewṯ, isellem-asen Ƹisa ḥima aḏas ggen min xsen.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawin Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa aṯ ṣellben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Wami uwin Ƹisa aṯ ṣellben, ṭṭfen ijjen n uryaz zi ṯendint n Lqurina qqaren-as Simƹan, aryaz-a ikka-d zi ȓkampu iƹḏu-d ssenni. Sarbun-as <char style="it">ȓƹaskar</char> ṣṣalib ḥima aṯ yarbu aḏ iḏfar Ƹisa. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Ḏfaren-ṯ aṭṭas n ȓɣaci, ṯimɣarin ḥeznent trunt xas. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Ineqȓeb-d ɣarsent Ƹisa inna-asent: "Ay yessis n Lquds war xafi trunt ca, runt x yixef nkent ḏ ṯarwa nkent. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Aḏ d tas ijjen n ȓweqṯ aḏayes inin: Ssaƹḏ nsent n ṯinni war izemmaren ca aḏ arwent ḏ ṯinni ƹemmarṣ war uriwent ca ḏ ṯinni ƹemmarṣ war ssuṭḍent ca. <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Aḏ bḏan aḏ inin i iḏurar wḍam-d xaneɣ, aḏ inin i ṯeƹrurin qbarent-id xaneɣ. <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Meȓa iwḏan-a yina ggin manaya i ṯcejjarṯ ḏ ṯazeyzawṯ, min ḏas ɣa iweqƹen xmi ɣa ṯazeɣ?"<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Ƹaweḏ uwin-d ṯnayen nneɣni ḏ lmujrimin ḥima akiḏes twanɣen.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irumaniyen tṣellaben Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa x ṣṣalib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Wami uwḍen ɣar umcan nni umi qqaren Jumjuma, ṣellben-ṯ ḏinni ak ṯnayen nni n lmujrimin, ijjen x ufusi ijjen x uẓeȓmaḍ. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Inna Ƹisa: "A Baba, ɣfar iwḏan-a qa war ssinen ca min teggen." Ȓƹaskar nni ggin lqurƹa x warruḍ nnes ḥima kuȓ ijjen min ɣa iysi.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Iwḏan bedden ḏinni xezzaren ḏayes, arruyas tbuṣaren xas qqaren: "Meȓa ḏ ṣṣaḥ netta ḏ Lmasiḥ iy ixḍar Arebbi ataf aḏ isenjem ixef nnes minzi isenjem inneɣni." <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Ƹaweḏ uȓa ḏ ȓƹaskar ḍeḥḥcen xas, qarrben ɣares ucin-as aman uḍiȓ ḏ isemmamen. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Nnan-as: "Meȓa cek ḏ azeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil senjem ixef nnec." <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ɣar uzeǧif nnes ggin-as ijjen n ṯeȓwiḥet ṯura ḏayes: Wanita ḏ azeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Ijjen zi lmujrimin nni iy kiḏes ṣellben ibḏa itzawar-iṯ iqqar-as: "Cek ma ḏ Lmasiḥ ma lla? Yallah, nejja ixef nnec nejja-yaneɣ."<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Inha-ṯ wenni nneɣni inna-as: "Cek ma war teggwiḏeḏ ca Arebbi? Qa ḥekkmen xak amecnaw netta. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Neccin ḥekkmen xaneɣ nican, nesḏaheǧ lḥukem-a ƹlaḥsab min negga. Walakin aryaz-a war iggi ca minxef." <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ȓexddenni inna-as: "Ƹqeȓ xafi a Ƹisa xmi d ɣa ṯaseḏ ɣar ȓmulk nnec."<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-as: "Aqa tesȓiḏ ȓḥaqq: Nhara aḏ tiȓiḏ akiḏi ḏi jjenneṯ."<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa immuṯ x ṣṣalib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ɣar ṯenƹac n uziȓ, ṯehwa-d ṯaǧest x ṯmurṯ amen-ṯekmaȓ aȓ wami ḏ ṯȓaṯa uƹecci. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Ṯfuct ṯruḥ-as ṯfawṯ nnes, iqqarṣ arrwaq n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant x ṯnayen. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Iȓaɣa Ƹisa s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯejheḏ inna: "A Baba, nec buḥbeȓ inu sellmeɣ-ac-ṯ ḏeg ifassen nnec." Wami inna manaya yarra nnefs ṣafi immuṯ. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Aƹaskari nni ameqqran n arrumanus <char style="it">iy iǧan ḏinni</char> wami iẓra min iweqƹen ibḏa isemɣar Arebbi inna: "Aṯarras-a ḏ ṣṣaḥ bariʼ iy iǧa." <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Marra iwḏan iy ḏinni imunen wami ẓrin min iweqƹen, trewwaḥen-d ccaṯen ḏeg wuȓawen nsen. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Marra imƹacaren nnes ḏ ṯemɣarin iy ṯ iḏfaren zi Ljalil bedden ɣar ȓeggwaj ẓrin manayenni.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Neṭṭȓen Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Ḏinni ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Yusef zi Jmaƹṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil, netta ḏ ijjen n uryaz iṣbaḥ iǧan nican. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />War iqbiȓ ca minxef ṯtafeq jmaƹṯ nni ḏ min ṯxeddem. Netta zeg ubilaj n Arimatya iy iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya. Itreḥḥab ƹaweḏ zi ȓmulk n Arebbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Iruḥ ɣar Bilaṭus ittar-as ddat n Ƹisa. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Iruḥ Yusef isehwa-t-id,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iƹni, isehwa-d ddat n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zi ṣṣalib.</char></note> ikeffen-it s ȓecfen. Isers-it ḏeg yijjen n unḍeȓ iɣzin ḏeg uzru <char style="it">igga am yifri</char>, ƹemmarṣ war ḏayes inḍiȓ ḥadd. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Nhar nni tuɣa ḏ jjemƹa, israʼiliyen sewjaḏen i nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada iy tuɣa ƹȓayen aḏ ibḏa. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Ṯimɣarin nni iy d yusin ak Ƹisa zi Ljalil ḏfarent Yusef ɣar unḍeȓ ẓrint-ṯ ḏ mamc ḏayes inḍeȓ ddat nnes. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ḏewȓent ɣar ṯeddarṯ sewjaḏent lƹiṭar ḏ waman n lwarḍ. Ḏi nhar n lƹibada qqiment reyyḥent ƹlaḥsab ȓuṣiyeṯ nni <char style="it">n Musa</char>.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ikkar-d zi ȓmewṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Nhar amezwaru n ssimana iƹni ḏ ȓḥad, ṯimɣarin nni ruḥent ɣar ṣbaḥ zic ɣar <char style="it">yifri n</char> unḍeȓ nni, uwint lƹiṭar iy tuɣa swejḏent. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Ufint azru itwakkes x unḍeȓ. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Wami uḏfent ḏayes war ufint ca ḏinni ddat n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Niṯenti wami qqiment ḏehhcent ḏi manayenni, bedden-d ɣarsent ṯnayen n iṯarrasen ggin arruḍ itceƹciƹ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iṯarrasen-a niṯni ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ, tcabbahen ḏi bnaḏem.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ggwḏent ṯemɣarin nni aṭṭas sejjḏent ɣar ṯmurṯ, nnan-asent ṯnayen n iṯarrasen nni: "Mayemmi ṯrezzunt x wenni iddaren jar yinni immuṯen? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Netta war ḏa iǧi ca, ikkar-d zi ȓmewṯ. Ma war ṯeƹqiȓent ca wami kiḏwem issiweȓ u netta tuɣaṯ ƹaḏ ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil? <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Inna-awem qa itxeṣṣa Mmis n bnaḏem aḏ itwasellem i yinni iƹeṣṣan, niṯni aṯ ṣellben netta aḏ d itwasekkar ḏi nhar n wis ṯeȓtiyyam." <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ssenni niṯenti ƹeqȓent x wawaȓ nni n Ƹisa.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Ḏewȓent-id zeg unḍeȓ ssiwḍent marra ȓexbar-a ɣar ḥiṭac n arrusul ḏ marra inneɣni. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Ṯinni issiwḍen ȓexbar-a ɣar arrusul niṯenti ḏ Maryam ṯamagdaliṯ, ḏ Ayunna, ḏ Maryam yemmas n Yaƹqub, ḏ ṯinneɣni. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Arrusul-a war uminen ca ṯimɣarin nni minzi fekkaren niṯenti ssawaȓent waha. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Walakin Buṭrus ikkar yuzzeȓ ɣar <char style="it">yifri n</char> unḍeȓ nni, wami issij ḏinni yufa ȓecfen imars waḥḏes. Iruḥ netta iḏweȓ ɣar ṯeddarṯ itƹejjeb ḏi nnefs nnes ƹlaḥsab min iweqƹen.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa imḍehhar-d x ubriḏ n dcar n Ƹinwas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Nhar nni, ṯnayen n imeḥḍaren nnes traḥen ɣar yijjen n dcar qqaren-as Ƹinwas. Iggwej x ṯendint n Lquds ijjen n ḥiṭac n kilumit. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Ssawaȓen jarasen x ṯmesȓayin iweqƹen. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Wami ssawaȓen temnaqacen imeȓqa akiḏsen Ƹisa netta s yixef nnes ibḏa iggur akiḏsen. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Walakin niṯni war itwasmiḥ ca aṯ ƹeqȓen.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Min iƹna manaya iy xef ṯessawaȓem ammu wami ṯuggurem ḏeg ubriḏ?" Bedden, iban lḥuzen x wuḏem nsen.<verse eid="LUK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Indeq-d ijjen zzaysen qqaren-as Klupas inna-as: "Ma ḏ cek waḥḏec ḏanita iy d izuren ɣar Lquds ḏeg wussan-a qa war ṯessineḏ ca min iweqƹen?!"<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Min iweqƹen ḏinni?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Nnan-as: "Qa Ƹisa naṣiri tuɣa iǧa ḏ ijjen n nnabi ɣares jjheḏ ḏi min itegg ḏ min iqqar zzaṯ i Arebbi ḏ marra iwḏan. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ṭṭfen-ṯ arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ lḥukkam nneɣ sellmen-ṯ aṯ nɣen, ṣellben-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Neccin tuɣa netmenna belli ḏ netta iy ɣa isnejmen Ayṯ-Israʼil! Nhara ḏ wis ṯeȓtiyyam zeg wami iwqeƹ manaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ƹaweḏ ḏinni can ṯemɣarin zzayneɣ jjint-aneɣ nestƹejjeb minzi ruḥent ɣar unḍeȓ zic <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />war ḏinni ufint ca ddat nnes. Ḏewȓent-id, nnant-aneɣ belli meḍharent-id lmalaʼikaṯ xebbarent-ṯent belli aqaṯ iddar. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Ȓexddenni ruḥen can yiwḏan zzayneɣ ɣar unḍeȓ nnes, ufin nican mamc ḏaneɣ nnant ṯemɣarin nni, walakin netta war ṯ ufin ca ḏinni."<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "A yinni war ifhimen ca! A yinni war itimnen ca ḏeɣya ḏi marra min nnan lʼanbiya! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Tuɣa itxeṣṣa i Lmasiḥ aḏ iƹeddeb, ssenni aḏ yaḏef ɣar lƹaḍama nnes." <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ḏinni ibḏa-yasen Ƹisa zi Ccariƹa n Musa ḏ Lkutub n marra lʼanbiya isefhem-iṯen min xas yurin ḏi marra Lkutub nni.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Qarrben ɣar dcar iy ɣar traḥen, Ƹisa igga ixef nnes axmi ixes aḏ ikemmeȓ x ubriḏ nnes. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Walakin bḏan niṯni teḥcamen-ṯ nnan-as: "Qqim akiḏneɣ minzi ƹȓayen ḏ ṯameddiṯ qa iruḥ ȓḥaȓ." Ssenni yuḏef ɣarsen ḥima akiḏsen isens. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Wami akiḏsen iqqim aḏ icc, ikkar iysi aɣrum icekkar Arebbi irzi-ṯ ibḏa ifarreq-asen-ṯ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ḏinni iy nurzment ṯiṭṭawin nsen ƹeqȓen-ṯ, walakin netta inerfeƹ war iqqim ca aṯ ẓerren. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Nnan i wayawya: "Neccin nesḥissa can ȓḥajeṯ ṯeccaṯ ḏeg wuȓawen nneɣ wami tuɣaṯ issawaȓ akiḏneɣ ḏeg ubriḏ isefhem-aneɣ Lkutub."<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Ȓexddenni kkaren ḏewȓen ɣar Lquds. Ufin ḥiṭac n arrusul ḏ yinni iy kiḏsen imunen ḏinni. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Nnan-asen: "Manaya ḏ ṣṣaḥ! Ikkar-d Siḏiṯneɣ zi ȓmewṯ, tuɣa iban-d i Simƹan!" <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Txebbaren-ṯen s min iweqƹen ḏeg ubriḏ ḏ mammec ssnen Siḏiṯsen wami irza aɣrum.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa imḍehhar-d i imeḥḍaren nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Wami ssawaȓen x manaya yusa-d Ƹisa ibedd ḏi ȓwesṭ nsen inna-asen: "Sȓam xawem." <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ggwḏen aṭṭas tɣir-asen aqa twaȓan can ȓexyaȓ. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Inna-asen: "Min kenniw yuɣin ṯenxeȓƹem? Mayemmi uȓawen nwem ḏaysen ccekk? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Xzarem ifassen inu ḏ iḍaren inu, aqa ḏ nec. Ḥaḏam-ayi, xzarem. Aqa ȓexyaȓ war ḏayes bu uysum uȓa ḏ yixsan ammu iy ḏayi twaȓam nec." <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Inna-asen manaya, isbeyyen-asen-d ifassen nnes ḏ iḍaren nnes. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Niṯni qqimen ƹaḏ war uminen ca min iweqƹen minzi farrḥen ḏehhcen. Uca inna-asen: "Ma ḏa can lmakla at cceɣ?" <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Ucin-as cwayt n iseȓman cenfen. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Iysi-t icci-t zzaṯsen.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Inna-asen: "Ḏ wa ḏ awaȓ iy zi kiḏwem ssiwȓeɣ wami ƹaḏ tuɣa ǧiɣ akiḏwem, iƹni labud aḏ ikemmeȓ marra min xafi yurin ḏi Ccariƹa n Musa ḏ Lkutub n lʼanbiya ḏ Zzabur." <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ȓexddenni irzem Ƹisa ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen ḥima aḏ fehmen Lkutub. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Inna-asen: "Ammu iy yura ḏi Lkitab qa itxeṣṣa i Lmasiḥ aḏ itwaƹeddeb aḏ d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ wis ṯeȓtiyyam. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Aḏ beccaren marra ȓegnus ḥima aḏ tuben aḏ twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen s yisem n Lmasiḥ. Aḏ ibḏa manaya ḏi Lquds. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Kenniw aqa ṯcehhḏem x manaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ataf minḏi kenniw iwƹeḏ Baba aḏawem ṯiḏ ssekkeɣ nec. Qqimem ḏi ṯendint-a aȓ xawem d ɣa ihwa jjheḏ zeg ujenna."<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itwarfeƹ ɣar ujenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Isufeɣ-iṯen zi ṯendint yuwi-ṯen ɣaȓ Bayt Ƹanya. Isgaƹƹeḏ ifassen nnes ibarek-iṯen. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Wami ṯen itbarak, itgaƹƹaḏ xasen itwarfeƹ ɣar ujenna. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Sejjḏen-as, ḏewȓen-d ɣar Lquds niṯni farrḥen aṭṭas. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Ssenni qqimen ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ḥemmḏen Arebbi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>